export const amerikanerCardGameTranslationsByLocale = Object.freeze({"am":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner ካርድ ጨዋታ","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner ካርድ ጨዋታ መስመር ላይ — ጨረታ፣ አጋር ፈልግ እና ብልሃቶችን አሸንፍ","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"የኖርዌይ አሜሪካነር ካርድ ጨዋታን ከሶስት እስከ ስድስት ተጫዋቾችን በአገር ውስጥ ይጫወቱ። ለተንኮል ተጫራች፣ ትራምፕን ምረጥ፣ አጋርህን ፈልግ እና ውጤቱን በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ አቆይ።","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"የኖርዌይ አሜሪካነርን የማታለል ጨዋታ ይማሩ፡ እርስዎ እና ያልታወቀ አጋር ምን ያህል ብልሃቶችን እንደሚወስዱ ጨረታ ያውጡ፣ በእርሳስዎ ትራምፕን ያዘጋጁ እና አጋርዎን የሚገልጥበትን ካርድ ይጠይቁ።","A quick example":"ፈጣን ምሳሌ","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"በአራት ተጫዋቾች የ 8 ጨረታ ያሸንፋል እርስዎ እና በጠየቁት ካርድዎ የተገለጠው አጋር ቢያንስ 8 ዘዴዎችን አንድ ላይ ከወሰዱ። እያንዳንዱ የቡድን ጓደኛ 8 ነጥቦችን ያገኛል; እያንዳንዱ ሌላ ተጫዋች የራሳቸውን የማታለያ ብዛት ያገኛሉ።","How to play":"እንዴት መጫወት እንደሚቻል","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"ይህ የአገር ውስጥ ስሪት በኖርስኬ kortspill ላይ የተረጋገጠውን የኖርዌይ አሜሪካነር ህግን ይከተላል። ከሦስት እስከ ስድስት ተጫዋቾችን በመደበኛ የመርከቧ ወለል እና ምንም ቀልዶችን ይደግፋል። በእኩል ደረጃ ለመስራት አንድ ፣ ሁለት ወይም አራት ሁለት ለሦስት ፣ ለአምስት ወይም ለስድስት ተጫዋቾች ተዘጋጅተዋል ። አራት ተጫዋቾች ሁሉንም የ 52 ካርዶችን ይጠቀማሉ. ተጫዋቹ በመጀመሪያ ጨረታውን ለቋል። መደበኛ ጨረታ ቢያንስ ግማሽ እጅዎ የተጠቀለለ እና አሁን ካለው ጨረታ ከፍ ያለ መሆን አለበት። ያለ አጋር ወይም ትራምፕ ብቻውን ለመሞከር አሜሪካነርን ማለፍ ወይም መደወል ይችላሉ። መደበኛ ጨረታ ካሸነፍክ ትራምፕን ለማዘጋጀት የመጀመሪያውን ካርድ ይምራው እና በእጅህ ውስጥ በሌለው ልብስ ውስጥ የውስጠ-ጨዋታ ካርድ ጠይቅ። ያዢው በመጀመሪያው ብልሃት መጫወት እና አጋርዎ መሆን አለበት። በኋለኛው አመራር ላይ ምንም ተዛማጅ ካርድ በተቃዋሚዎች እጅ ውስጥ ካልቀረ ያለ አጋር ይቀጥሉ; እንደ ተጫራቾች ያስቆጠረው ማስታወቂያው ብቻ ነው። ከተቻለ ተጫዋቾች የሚመራውን ፈለግ መከተል አለባቸው። ከፍተኛው ትራምፕ ብልሃትን ያሸንፋል፣ ወይም መለከት ከሌለ በሊድ ልብስ ውስጥ ያለው ከፍተኛው ካርድ። አወጀው እና አጋር እያንዳንዳቸው ጨረታውን ሲያወጡ ወይም እያንዳንዳቸው ሲያጡ ይሸነፋሉ፤ ሌሎች ተጫዋቾች ለሚወስዱት እያንዳንዱ ዘዴ አንድ ነጥብ ያገኛሉ። ስኬታማ አሜሪካዊ የ 52 ነጥቦችን ያገኛል እና ያልተሳካለት 52 ያጣል። ከአንድ ዙር በኋላ ሻጩ ወደ ግራ ይንቀሳቀሳል. አንዴ ውጤት 52 ሲደርስ ከፍተኛው ነጥብ ያሸንፋል። የአካባቢ ኮምፒውተር ተቃዋሚዎች ቀላል የሂዩሪስቲክ ምርጫዎችን ያደርጋሉ። የመስመር ላይ ብዙ ተጫዋች የለም።","How many players can play?":"ምን ያህል ተጫዋቾች መጫወት ይችላሉ?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"ሶስት, አራት, አምስት ወይም ስድስት መቀመጫዎችን ይምረጡ. ተጫዋች አንዱ አንተ ነህ; ሌሎቹ መቀመጫዎች የአካባቢ ኮምፒዩተሮች ተቃዋሚዎች ናቸው.","How is the deck dealt?":"መከለያው እንዴት ይስተናገዳል?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"የ 52 ካርዶችን ያለ ቀልዶች ይጠቀሙ። አንዱን ሁለቱን ለሶስት ተጫዋቾች አንድም ለአራት፣ ሁለት ለአምስት፣ እና አራቱንም ሁለቱን ለስድስት አስቀምጥ እያንዳንዱ እጅ አንድ አይነት የካርድ ብዛት አለው።","How do I find my partner?":"የትዳር ጓደኛዬን እንዴት ማግኘት እችላለሁ?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"ከመደበኛው ጨረታ በኋላ፣ ትራምፕ ለማዘጋጀት ካርድ ይምሩ እና በእጅዎ ላይ ያልሆነ የዚያ ልብስ ካርድ ይጠይቁ። ማንም የሚይዘው በመጀመሪያ ተንኮል መጫወት እና አጋርዎ መሆን አለበት።","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner ምን ማለት ነው","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"ዋናው ጥሪ ነው፡ ያለ አጋር እና ትራምፕ ብቻህን ለማሸነፍ ሞክር። የተሳካ ጥሪ ለ 52 ነጥቦች ዋጋ አለው; ያልተሳካው 52 ያስከፍላል።","How is a normal bid scored?":"የተለመደ ጨረታ እንዴት ነው የተገኘው?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"አዋጅ እና አጋር እያንዳንዳቸው ጥምር ተንኮሎቻቸው ካሟሉ ጨረታውን ያገኛሉ ወይም እያንዳንዳቸው ቢያቅታቸው ጨረታውን ይሸነፋሉ። ሁሉም ሰው በአንድ ብልሃት አንድ ነጥብ ያገኛል።","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"ይህ ጨዋታ ካርዶቼን ወይም ውጤቶቼን ይሰቅላል?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"ቁ. የጨዋታ ሁኔታ እና አማራጭ የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ በዚህ አሳሽ ውስጥ ይቆያሉ።","Rules and limitations":"ህጎች እና ገደቦች","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"ይህ የአንድ የኖርዌይ ደንብ ስብስብ ዲጂታል ልምምድ ስሪት ነው እንጂ እያንዳንዱ የቤት ህግ ተሸፍኗል የሚለው አይደለም። የሃገር ውስጥ የኮምፒዩተር ተቃዋሚዎች ቀላል ሂዩሪስቲክስ ይጠቀማሉ እንጂ የባለሙያ ስልት አይደሉም። ምንም የመስመር ላይ ባለብዙ ተጫዋች፣ መለያ ወይም የተሰቀለ የጨዋታ ውሂብ የለም። ውጤቱ በመጨረሻው ላይ እኩል ከሆነ፣ መሳሪያው በዘፈቀደ አንዱን ከመምረጥ ይልቅ የታሰሩትን ከፍተኛ ተጫዋቾችን ሪፖርት ያደርጋል።","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"ለመጫወት ነፃ። ካርዶች፣ ውጤቶች እና አማራጭ ቆጣቢው በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ ይቆያሉ፤ ምንም አልተሰቀለም.","Play Amerikaner":"አጫውት Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ነጻ · በአሳሽዎ ውስጥ ይሰራል","Total players":"ጠቅላላ ተጫዋቾች","New game":"አዲስ ጨዋታ","Resume saved game":"የተቀመጠውን ጨዋታ ከቆመበት ቀጥል","Delete saved game":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ሰርዝ","Export scores":"ውጤቶችን ወደ ውጪ ላክ","Spades":"ስፋቶች","Hearts":"ልቦች","Diamonds":"አልማዞች","Clubs":"ክለቦች","Jack":"ጃክ","Queen":"ንግስት","King":"ንጉሥ","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"ጨረታዎን ይምረጡ","Lead a card":"ካርድ ምራ","Play a card":"ካርድ ይጫወቱ","No trump":"ትራምፕ የለም።","Not revealed":"አልተገለጠም።","No card has been played yet.":"እስካሁን ምንም ካርድ አልተጫወተም።","You passed.":"አለፍክ።","Your lead is on the table.":"መሪዎ በጠረጴዛው ላይ ነው.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} መርቶ የአጋር ካርድ ጠየቀ።","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} ተጫውቷል።","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"አንድ ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ ወይም በዚህ መሣሪያ ላይ የተቀመጠውን ይቀጥሉ።","Player":"ተጫዋች","You":"አንተ","Computer {number}":"ኮምፒውተር {number}","Score":"ነጥብ","Tricks":"ብልሃቶች","Round":"ዙር","Current bid":"ወቅታዊ ጨረታ","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} ጨረታ እየመረጠ ነው።","Turn":"መዞር","Dealer":"አከፋፋይ","Trump":"ትራምፕ","Partner":"አጋር","Bid":"ጨረታ","Number of tricks":"የማታለል ብዛት","Place bid":"ቦታ ጨረታ","Pass":"ማለፊያ","Call Amerikaner":"Americaner ይደውሉ","Minimum":"ቢያንስ","Maximum":"ከፍተኛ","Set trump and request your partner":"ትራምፕን ያዘጋጁ እና አጋርዎን ይጠይቁ","Choose your lead card":"የሊድ ካርድዎን ይምረጡ","Request a card in this suit":"በዚህ ልብስ ውስጥ ካርድ ይጠይቁ","Lead and request this card":"ይህንን ካርድ ይምሩ እና ይጠይቁ","Play selected card":"የተመረጠውን ካርድ ያጫውቱ","Choose a card to play":"ለመጫወት ካርድ ይምረጡ","Current trick":"የአሁኑ ብልሃት።","Your hand":"የእርስዎ እጅ","Cards in hand":"ካርዶች በእጃቸው","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"በሚችሉበት ጊዜ የሚመራውን ልብስ ይከተሉ። የተጠየቀው የአጋር ካርድ በመጀመሪያው ብልሃት መጫወት አለበት።","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"ቢያንስ ግማሽ እጅዎ የተጠቀለለ እና አሁን ካለው ጨረታ ከፍ ያለ ጨረታ ያውጡ ወይም ለአሜሪካነር ይደውሉ።","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"የእርሳስ ልብስዎ ትራምፕ ይሆናል። እርስዎ ያልያዙት በዚያ ልብስ ውስጥ የውስጠ-ጨዋታ ካርድ ይጠይቁ። መያዣው መጀመሪያ መጫወት አለበት.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"ምንም ተዛማጅ ካርድ በተቃዋሚዎች እጅ አልቀረም። ያለ አጋር መምራት; የራስዎ ጨረታ ብቻ ነው የሚመዘነው።","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"ጨዋታው ተጀመረ። ተጫዋቹ በመጀመሪያ ጨረታውን ለቋል።","{player} passed.":"{player} አልፏል።","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} ጨረታ {count} ዘዴዎች.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"አሜሪካነር ተብሎ የሚጠራው {player}: እያንዳንዱ ብልሃት ብቻውን, ምንም መለከት የለም.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"ሁሉም አለፉ። እጁ ተስተካክሏል እና ሻጩ ወደ ግራ ተንቀሳቅሷል።","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} የተጠየቀውን ካርድ ይዞ የእርስዎ አጋር ነው።","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ብልሃቱን አሸንፏል።","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"ዙር ተጠናቋል። {player} {count} ዘዴዎችን ወስዷል።","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ጨዋታውን በ {count} ነጥብ አሸንፏል!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"ጨዋታው በ {players} መካከል በ {count} ነጥቦች መካከል ተካሂዷል።","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"ተጫራች: እያንዳንዱ የቡድን ጓደኛ {count} ነጥቦችን አግኝቷል።","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"ጨረታ አምልጦታል፡ እያንዳንዱ የቡድን ጓደኛ {count} ነጥቦችን ያጣል።","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"ስኬታማ አሜሪካነር፡ 52 ነጥቦች።","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"ያልተሳካ አሜሪካነር፡ -52 ነጥቦች።","Game saved on this device.":"ጨዋታ በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ተቀምጧል።","Saved game resumed.":"የዳነ ጨዋታ ቀጠለ።","Saved game deleted.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ተሰርዟል።","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"አካባቢያዊ ቁጠባ አይገኝም። ይህ ጨዋታ ገጹን እስክትወጣ ድረስ ክፍት ሆኖ ይቆያል።","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ ሊነበብ አልቻለም። አዲስ ጨዋታ ይጀምሩ ወይም የተበላሸውን ቆጣቢ ይሰርዙ።","There is no saved game on this device.":"በዚህ መሳሪያ ላይ ምንም የተቀመጠ ጨዋታ የለም።","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"አንድ መደበኛ 52-ካርድ ወለል፣ ቀልዶች የሉም። በቂ ሁለቱን ወደ ጎን በማድረግ ለ3–6 ተጫዋቾች እኩል ይስሩ። መደበኛ ጨረታ የሚጀምረው በግማሽ እጅ የተጠቀለለ ሲሆን የቀደመውን ጨረታ መሙላት አለበት። ሁሉንም ዘዴዎች ብቻውን ለመውሰድ አሜሪካነርን ይደውሉ። በመደበኛ ጨረታ ትራምፕን ለማዘጋጀት ይምሩ እና የአጋር ካርድ ይጠይቁ። በሚቻልበት ጊዜ ተከተሉት። ቡድኑ እያንዳንዳቸው ጨረታውን ያሸንፋሉ ወይም ያጣሉ; ሌሎች ተጫዋቾች የማታለል ችሎታቸውን ያገኛሉ። ከፍተኛው ነጥብ አንድ ነጥብ 52 ሲደርስ ያሸንፋል።","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"የኖርዌይ ህጎች 16 ጥቅምት 2026 ታይቷል","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"ar":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"لعبة بطاقة أمريكانر\nلعبة بطاقة","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner عبر الإنترنت — قم بالمزايدة، وابحث عن شريك، واربح الحيل","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"العب لعبة بطاقة Amerikaner النرويجية محليًا مع ثلاثة إلى ستة لاعبين. قم بالمزايدة على الحيل، واختر الورقة الرابحة، وابحث عن شريكك واحتفظ بالنتيجة على هذا الجهاز.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"تعرف على لعبة الخدع النرويجية Amerikaner: قم بالمزايدة على عدد الحيل التي يمكنك القيام بها أنت وشريك غير معروف، وحدد الورقة الرابحة مع تقدمك، واطلب البطاقة التي تكشف عن شريكك.","A quick example":"مثال سريع","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"مع أربعة لاعبين، يفوز عرض بقيمة 8 إذا قمت أنت والشريك الذي كشفت عنه البطاقة المطلوبة بجمع حيل 8 معًا على الأقل. ثم يربح كل زميل في الفريق نقاط 8؛ يكسب كل لاعب آخر عدد الحيل الخاصة به.","How to play":"كيفية اللعب","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"يتبع هذا الإصدار المحلي قواعد Amerikaner النرويجية التي تم التحقق منها ضد Norske kortspill. وهو يدعم ثلاثة إلى ستة لاعبين بمجموعة قياسية ولا يوجد مهرجين. للتعامل بالتساوي، يتم تخصيص واحد أو اثنين أو أربعة ثنائيات لثلاثة أو خمسة أو ستة لاعبين؛ يستخدم أربعة لاعبين جميع بطاقات 52. اللاعب الموجود على يسار الموزع يقدم عروضه أولاً. يجب أن يكون العرض العادي على الأقل نصف قيمة يدك وأعلى من العرض الحالي؛ يمكنك أيضًا المرور أو الاتصال بـ Amerikaner لتجربة كل خدعة بمفردك بدون شريك أو ورقة رابحة. إذا فزت بمزايدة عادية، قم بقيادة البطاقة الأولى لتعيين الورقة الرابحة واطلب بطاقة أثناء اللعب في تلك الدعوى التي ليست في يدك. يجب على حاملها أن يلعبها في الجولة الأولى ويصبح شريكك. إذا لم تبقى أي بطاقة مطابقة في أيدي الخصوم في تقدم لاحق، فاستمر بدون شريك؛ يتم تسجيل المُعلن فقط باعتباره مقدم العرض. يجب على اللاعبين اتباع الدعوى التي يقودها عندما يكون ذلك ممكنًا. أعلى ورقة رابحة تفوز بالخدعة، أو أعلى بطاقة في المجموعة التي تقودها إذا لم يكن هناك ورقة رابحة. يحصل كل من المعلن والشريك على العطاء عندما يقدمونه، أو يخسر كل منهما العطاء عندما يفوته؛ يكتسب اللاعبون الآخرون نقطة واحدة مقابل كل خدعة يقومون بها. يكسب Amerikaner الناجح نقاط 52 ويخسر الشخص الفاشل 52. بعد جولة، يتحرك التاجر إلى اليسار. بمجرد وصول النتيجة إلى 52، تفوز النتيجة الأعلى. يتخذ خصوم الكمبيوتر المحليون خيارات إرشادية بسيطة؛ لا يوجد لاعبين متعددين عبر الإنترنت.","How many players can play?":"كم عدد اللاعبين الذين يمكنهم اللعب؟","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"اختر ثلاثة أو أربعة أو خمسة أو ستة مقاعد. اللاعب الأول هو أنت؛ المقاعد الأخرى هي معارضي الكمبيوتر المحليين.","How is the deck dealt?":"كيف يتم التعامل مع سطح السفينة؟","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"استخدم بطاقات 52 بدون مزاح. خصص واحدًا اثنين لثلاثة لاعبين، ولا شيء لأربعة، واثنان لخمسة، وكل أربعة ثنائيات لستة، بحيث يكون لكل يد نفس عدد البطاقات.","How do I find my partner?":"كيف أجد شريك حياتي؟","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"بعد عرض عادي، قم بقيادة البطاقة لتعيين الورقة الرابحة واطلب بطاقة من تلك الدعوى التي ليست في يدك. من يحملها يجب أن يلعبها في الحيلة الأولى ويصبح شريكك.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"ماذا يعني Amerikaner؟","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"إنها المهمة الأهم: حاول الفوز بكل خدعة بمفردك، بدون شريك أو ورقة رابحة. المكالمة الناجحة تستحق 52 نقطة؛ الفشل يكلف 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"كيف يتم تسجيل العطاء العادي؟","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"يحصل كل من المعلن والشريك على العرض إذا استوفت حيلهم المجمعة ذلك، أو يخسر كل منهما العرض إذا فشلوا. يكسب الجميع نقطة واحدة لكل خدعة.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"هل تقوم هذه اللعبة بتحميل بطاقاتي أو نتائجي؟","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"لا. تظل حالة اللعبة واللعبة المحفوظة الاختيارية في هذا المتصفح على هذا الجهاز.","Rules and limitations":"القواعد والقيود","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"هذا إصدار تدريبي رقمي لمجموعة قواعد نرويجية واحدة، وليس ادعاءً بتغطية كل قاعدة منزلية. يستخدم خصوم الكمبيوتر المحليون استدلالات بسيطة، وليس استراتيجية الخبراء. لا توجد بيانات متعددة اللاعبين أو حساب أو لعبة تم تحميلها عبر الإنترنت. في حالة تعادل النتائج عند النهاية، تقوم الأداة بالإبلاغ عن أعلى اللاعبين المتعادلين بدلاً من اختيار واحد بشكل تعسفي.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"لعب مجاني. تبقى البطاقات والنتائج والحفظ الاختياري على هذا الجهاز؛ لم يتم تحميل أي شيء.","Play Amerikaner":"تشغيل أمريكانر","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مجاني · يعمل في متصفحك","Total players":"إجمالي اللاعبين","New game":"لعبة جديدة","Resume saved game":"استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة","Delete saved game":"حذف اللعبة المحفوظة","Export scores":"تصدير النتائج","Spades":"البستوني","Hearts":"قلوب","Diamonds":"الماس","Clubs":"النوادي","Jack":"جاك","Queen":"الملكة","King":"ملك","Ace":"آس","Choose your bid":"اختر عرضك","Lead a card":"قم بقيادة البطاقة","Play a card":"العب بطاقة","No trump":"لا ترامب","Not revealed":"لم يكشف","No card has been played yet.":"لم يتم لعب أي بطاقة حتى الآن.","You passed.":"لقد مررت.","Your lead is on the table.":"الرصاص الخاص بك هو على الطاولة.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"قاد {player} بطاقة الشريك وطلبها.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} لعبت {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ابدأ لعبة أو استأنف اللعبة المحفوظة على هذا الجهاز.","Player":"لاعب","You":"أنت","Computer {number}":"الكمبيوتر {number}","Score":"نتيجة","Tricks":"الحيل","Round":"دائري","Current bid":"العطاء الحالي","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} يختار عرضًا.","Turn":"دور","Dealer":"تاجر","Trump":"ترامب","Partner":"شريك","Bid":"مُنَاقَصَة","Number of tricks":"عدد الحيل","Place bid":"مكان العطاء","Pass":"تمرير","Call Amerikaner":"اتصل بـ Amerikaner","Minimum":"الحد الأدنى","Maximum":"الحد الأقصى","Set trump and request your partner":"اضبط الورقة الرابحة واطلب شريكك","Choose your lead card":"اختر بطاقة الرصاص الخاصة بك","Request a card in this suit":"اطلب بطاقة بهذه البدلة","Lead and request this card":"قم بالقيادة واطلب هذه البطاقة","Play selected card":"تشغيل البطاقة المحددة","Choose a card to play":"اختر بطاقة للعب","Current trick":"الخدعة الحالية","Your hand":"يدك","Cards in hand":"البطاقات في متناول اليد","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"اتبع بدلة LED عندما تستطيع. يجب أن يتم لعب بطاقة الشريك المطلوبة في الجولة الأولى.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"قم بالمزايدة بنصف توزيع الورق على الأقل وأعلى من العرض الحالي، أو قم بالمزايدة على هذا المزاد، أو اتصل بـ Amerikaner لتجربة كل خدعة بمفردها.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"بدلتك الرئيسية تصبح ورقة رابحة. اطلب بطاقة اللعب التي لا تحملها في تلك الدعوى؛ يجب على حاملها أن يلعبها أولاً.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"لا توجد بطاقة مطابقة في أيدي الخصوم. القيادة بدون شريك؛ سيتم تسجيل العرض الخاص بك فقط.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"بدأت اللعبة. اللاعب الموجود على يسار الموزع يقدم عروضه أولاً.","{player} passed.":"تم تمرير {player}.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} حيل {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} يسمى Amerikaner: كل خدعة وحدها، لا ورقة رابحة.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"مر الجميع. تم إعادة توزيع اليد وتحرك التاجر إلى اليسار.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} يحمل البطاقة المطلوبة وهو شريكك.","{player} won the trick.":"فاز {player} بالخدعة.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"الجولة كاملة. استغرق {player} حيل {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"فاز {player} باللعبة بنقاط {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"انتهت المباراة بالتعادل بين {players} عند نقاط {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"العرض المقدم: يكسب كل زميل في الفريق {count} نقطة.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"تم تفويت العرض: يخسر كل زميل في الفريق {count} نقطة.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"الأمريكي الناجح: نقاط 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerikaner الفاشل: −52 نقطة.","Game saved on this device.":"اللعبة محفوظة على هذا الجهاز","Saved game resumed.":"تم استئناف اللعبة المحفوظة.","Saved game deleted.":"تم حذف اللعبة المحفوظة.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"الحفظ المحلي غير متاح؛ ستبقى هذه اللعبة مفتوحة حتى تغادر الصفحة.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"تعذرت قراءة اللعبة المحفوظة. ابدأ لعبة جديدة أو احذف الحفظ التالف.","There is no saved game on this device.":"لا توجد لعبة محفوظة على هذا الجهاز.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"مجموعة بطاقات 52 قياسية واحدة، بدون مزاح. تعامل بالتساوي مع لاعبي 3–6 من خلال تخصيص ما يكفي من اللاعبين الثنائيين. يبدأ العرض العادي بنصف توزيع الورق تقريبًا ويجب أن يفوق العرض السابق. اتصل بـ Amerikaner ليأخذ كل الحيل بمفرده. في المزايدة العادية، قم بتعيين الأوراق الرابحة وطلب بطاقة الشريك. اتبع حذوها عندما تكون قادرة على ذلك. يربح كل فريق العرض أو يخسره؛ يكتسب اللاعبون الآخرون عدد حيلهم. أعلى الدرجات تفوز بمجرد وصول النتيجة إلى 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"تم فحص القواعد النرويجية 16 أكتوبر 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"نورسكي كورتسبيل · أمريكانير"},"bg":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Американска игра на карти","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online — наддавай, намирай партньор и печели трикове","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Играйте играта на карти Norwegian Amerikaner локално с трима до шестима играчи. Наддавайте за трикове, изберете коз, намерете своя партньор и запазете резултата на това устройство.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Научете играта за вземане на трикове от Norwegian Amerikaner: задайте колко трика можете да вземете вие ​​и непознат партньор, задайте коз с преднината си и поискайте картата, която разкрива вашия партньор.","A quick example":"Бърз пример","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"При четирима играчи оферта от 8 печели, ако вие и партньорът, разкрит от заявената ви карта, вземете поне 8 взятки заедно. След това всеки съотборник печели 8 точки; всеки друг играч печели свой собствен брой трикове.","How to play":"Как се играе","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Тази локална версия следва правилата на Norwegian Amerikaner, проверени спрямо Norske kortspill. Поддържа от три до шестима играчи със стандартно тесте и без джокери. За да се раздават равномерно, една, две или четири двойки се отделят за трима, пет или шестима играчи; четирима играчи използват всички 52 карти. Играчът отляво на дилъра наддава първи. Редовната оферта трябва да бъде поне половината от вашата ръка, закръглена нагоре и по-висока от текущата оферта; можете също да преминете или да се обадите на Amerikaner, за да опитате всеки трик сам без партньор или коз. Ако спечелите обичайно наддаване, поведете първата карта, за да зададете коз и поискайте карта в игра в тази боя, която не е във вашата ръка. Притежателят му трябва да го изиграе в първия трик и става ваш партньор. Ако не остане съответстваща карта в ръцете на опонентите при по-късна преднина, продължете без партньор; само деклариращият се точкува като наддаващ. Играчите трябва да следват водения костюм, когато е възможно. Най-високият коз печели трик или най-високата карта в главния цвят, ако няма коз. Деклариращият и партньорът печелят офертата, когато я направят, или губят офертата, когато пропуснат; другите играчи печелят по една точка за всеки взет трик. Успешният американец печели 52 точки, а неуспешният губи 52. След рунда дилърът се движи наляво. След като резултатът достигне 52, най-високият резултат печели. Местните компютърни опоненти правят прости евристични избори; няма онлайн мултиплейър.","How many players can play?":"Колко играчи могат да играят?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Изберете три, четири, пет или шест места. Първи играч сте вие; другите места са местни компютърни опоненти.","How is the deck dealt?":"Как се раздава тестето?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Използвайте 52 карти без джокери. Отделете една двойка за трима играчи, нито една за четирима, две за петима и четирите двойки за шестима, така че всяка ръка да има еднакъв брой карти.","How do I find my partner?":"Как да намеря партньора си?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"След нормална оферта, водете карта, за да зададете коз и поискайте карта от този цвят, която не е във вашата ръка. Който го държи, трябва да го изиграе в първия трик и става ваш партньор.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Какво означава Американер?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Това е най-важният избор: опитайте се да спечелите всеки трик сам, без партньор и без коз. Успешно обаждане струва 52 точки; един неуспешен струва 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Как се оценява нормалната оферта?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Деклариращият и партньорът печелят офертата, ако комбинираните им трикове я изпълнят, или губят офертата, ако не успеят. Всички останали печелят по една точка на трик.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Тази игра качва ли моите карти или резултати?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Бр. Състоянието на играта и незадължителната запазена игра остават в този браузър на това устройство.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Това е дигитална практическа версия на един норвежки набор от правила, а не твърдение, че всички домашни правила са обхванати. Местните компютърни опоненти използват проста евристика, а не експертна стратегия. Няма онлайн мултиплейър, акаунт или качени данни за игра. Ако резултатите са равни на финала, инструментът отчита най-равностойните играчи, вместо да избира произволно един.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Безплатна игра. Картите, резултатите и незадължителното запазване остават на това устройство; нищо не е качено.","Play Amerikaner":"Играйте Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗПЛАТНО · ПУСКА ВЪВ ВАШИЯ БРАУЗЪР","Total players":"Общо играчи","New game":"Нова игра","Resume saved game":"Възобновяване на запазена игра","Delete saved game":"Изтриване на запазена игра","Export scores":"Експортиране на резултати","Spades":"Пика","Hearts":"Сърца","Diamonds":"Диаманти","Clubs":"Буха","Jack":"Джак","Queen":"Кралица","King":"Крал","Ace":"Асо","Choose your bid":"Изберете вашата оферта","Lead a card":"Поведете карта","Play a card":"Играйте карта","No trump":"Без коз","Not revealed":"Не е разкрито","No card has been played yet.":"Все още не е играна карта.","You passed.":"Ти премина.","Your lead is on the table.":"Вашето предимство е на масата.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} водеше и поиска партньорска карта.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} изигра {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Започнете игра или възобновете запазената на това устройство.","Player":"Играч","You":"Вие","Computer {number}":"Компютър {number}","Score":"резултат","Tricks":"Трикове","Round":"Кръгъл","Current bid":"Текуща оферта","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} избира оферта.","Turn":"Завъртете","Dealer":"Дилър","Trump":"Тръмп","Partner":"Партньор","Bid":"Наддаване","Number of tricks":"Брой трикове","Place bid":"Поставете оферта","Pass":"Пропуск","Call Amerikaner":"Обадете се на Amerikaner","Minimum":"Минимум","Maximum":"Максимум","Set trump and request your partner":"Задайте коз и поискайте своя партньор","Choose your lead card":"Изберете вашата водеща карта","Request a card in this suit":"Поискайте карта в тази боя","Lead and request this card":"Води и поискай тази карта","Play selected card":"Играйте избраната карта","Choose a card to play":"Изберете карта за игра","Current trick":"Текущ трик","Your hand":"Вашата ръка","Cards in hand":"Карти в ръка","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Следвайте светодиодния костюм, когато можете. Исканата партньорска карта трябва да бъде изиграна в първия трик.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Надложете поне половината от ръката си, закръглена нагоре и по-висока от текущата оферта, приемете за този търг или се обадете на Amerikaner, за да опитате всеки трик сам.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Вашият водещ костюм става коз. Поискайте карта в игра в тази боя, която не притежавате; притежателят му трябва да го изиграе първи.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"В ръцете на противниците не остава съвпадаща карта. Води без партньор; ще се оценява само вашата собствена оферта.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Играта започна. Играчът отляво на дилъра наддава първи.","{player} passed.":"{player} премина.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} наддава {count} трикове.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} наречен Amerikaner: всеки трик сам, без коз.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Всички минаха. Ръката беше прераздадена и дилърът се премести наляво.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} държи исканата карта и е ваш партньор.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} спечели трика.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Завършен кръг. {player} взе {count} трикове.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} спечели играта с {count} точки!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Играта завърши при равенство между {players} при {count} точки.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Направена оферта: всеки съотборник печели {count} точки.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Пропусната оферта: всеки съотборник губи {count} точки.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Успешен американец: 52 точки.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Неуспешен американец: −52 точки.","Game saved on this device.":"Играта е запазена на това устройство.","Saved game resumed.":"Запазената игра е възобновена.","Saved game deleted.":"Запазената игра е изтрита.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локалното запазване не е налично; тази игра ще остане отворена, докато не напуснете страницата.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Запазената игра не може да бъде прочетена. Започнете нова игра или изтрийте повреденото запазване.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Няма запазена игра на това устройство.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Едно стандартно тесте карти 52, без джокери. Раздайте равномерно за 3–6 играчи, като отделите достатъчно двойки. Обикновената оферта започва от половината ръка, закръглена нагоре, и трябва да надхвърля предишната оферта. Обадете се на Amerikaner да вземе всички трикове сам. При редовно наддаване водете до задаване на коз и поискайте партньорска карта. Следвайте примера, когато можете. Всеки отбор печели или губи офертата; други играчи печелят своя брой трикове. Най-високият резултат печели, след като резултатът достигне 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Норвежките правила са проверени 16 октомври 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Американер"},"bn":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"আমেরিকানার কার্ড গেম","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"আমেরিকানার কার্ড গেম অনলাইন — বিড করুন, একজন অংশীদার খুঁজুন এবং কৌশলগুলি জিতুন","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান আমেরিকান কার্ড গেমটি স্থানীয়ভাবে তিন থেকে ছয়জন খেলোয়াড়ের সাথে খেলুন। কৌশলের জন্য বিড করুন, ট্রাম্প নির্বাচন করুন, আপনার সঙ্গী খুঁজুন এবং এই ডিভাইসে স্কোর রাখুন।","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"নরওয়েজিয়ান আমেরিকান ট্রিক-টেকিং গেম শিখুন: আপনি এবং একজন অজানা অংশীদার কতগুলি কৌশল নিতে পারেন তা বিড করুন, আপনার নেতৃত্বের সাথে ট্রাম্প সেট করুন এবং আপনার সঙ্গীকে প্রকাশ করে এমন কার্ডের জন্য অনুরোধ করুন।","A quick example":"একটি দ্রুত উদাহরণ","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"চারজন খেলোয়াড়ের সাথে, 8-এর একটি বিড জিতবে যদি আপনি এবং আপনার অনুরোধকৃত কার্ডের মাধ্যমে প্রকাশ করা অংশীদার কমপক্ষে 8 কৌশলগুলি একসাথে নেন। প্রতিটি সতীর্থ তখন 8 পয়েন্ট অর্জন করে; একে অপরের খেলোয়াড় তাদের নিজস্ব কৌতুক গণনা উপার্জন.","How to play":"কিভাবে খেলতে হয়","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"এই স্থানীয় সংস্করণটি Norske kortspill-এর বিরুদ্ধে চেক করা নরওয়েজিয়ান আমেরিকান নিয়ম অনুসরণ করে। এটি একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড ডেক সহ তিন থেকে ছয়জন খেলোয়াড়কে সমর্থন করে এবং কোন জোকার নেই। সমানভাবে মোকাবেলা করার জন্য, তিন, পাঁচ বা ছয় খেলোয়াড়ের জন্য এক, দুই বা চারটি দুটি আলাদা করা হয়; চারজন খেলোয়াড় সমস্ত 52 কার্ড ব্যবহার করে। ডিলারের বাম খেলোয়াড়টি প্রথমে বিড করে। একটি নিয়মিত বিড অবশ্যই আপনার হাতের অর্ধেক গোলাকার এবং বর্তমান বিডের চেয়ে বেশি হতে হবে; আপনি একজন অংশীদার বা ট্রাম্প ছাড়াই একা প্রতিটি কৌশল চেষ্টা করার জন্য আমেরিকানকে পাস করতে বা কল করতে পারেন। আপনি যদি একটি নিয়মিত বিড জিতেন, তাহলে ট্রাম্প সেট করার জন্য প্রথম কার্ডটি নিয়ে যান এবং সেই স্যুটে একটি ইন-প্লে কার্ডের অনুরোধ করুন যা আপনার হাতে নেই। এর ধারককে অবশ্যই এটি প্রথম কৌশলে খেলতে হবে এবং আপনার অংশীদার হয়ে উঠবে। যদি পরবর্তী লিডের জন্য প্রতিপক্ষের হাতে কোনো মিলিত কার্ড না থাকে, তাহলে কোনো অংশীদার ছাড়াই চালিয়ে যান; শুধুমাত্র ঘোষণাকারী দরদাতা হিসাবে স্কোর করা হয়. সম্ভব হলে খেলোয়াড়দের অবশ্যই নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুট অনুসরণ করতে হবে। সর্বোচ্চ ট্রাম্প একটি কৌতুক জিতেছে, বা নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুটে সর্বোচ্চ কার্ড যদি ট্রাম্প না থাকে। ঘোষণাকারী এবং অংশীদার প্রত্যেকে বিড করার সময় লাভ করে, অথবা যখন তারা মিস করে বিড হারায়; অন্য খেলোয়াড়রা তাদের নেওয়া প্রতিটি কৌশলের জন্য এক পয়েন্ট লাভ করে। একজন সফল আমেরিকান 52 পয়েন্ট অর্জন করে এবং একজন ব্যর্থ একজন 52 হারায়। একটি রাউন্ডের পরে, ডিলার বাম দিকে চলে যায়। একবার একটি স্কোর 52 এ পৌঁছালে, সর্বোচ্চ স্কোর জয়ী হয়। স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার বিরোধীরা সহজ হিউরিস্টিক পছন্দ করে; কোনো অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার নেই।","How many players can play?":"কতজন খেলোয়াড় খেলতে পারে?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"তিন, চার, পাঁচ বা ছয়টি আসন বেছে নিন। খেলোয়াড় এক তুমি; অন্যান্য আসন স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার প্রতিপক্ষ।","How is the deck dealt?":"ডেকটি কিভাবে ডিল করা হয়?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"জোকার ছাড়া 52 কার্ড ব্যবহার করুন। তিনজন খেলোয়াড়ের জন্য এক দু'টি আলাদা করে রাখুন, চারজনের জন্য নয়, পাঁচের জন্য দুইটি, এবং ছয়জনের জন্য চারটি দু'টি আলাদা করুন যাতে প্রতিটি হাতে একই সংখ্যক কার্ড থাকে।","How do I find my partner?":"আমি আমার সঙ্গীকে কিভাবে খুঁজে পাব?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"একটি সাধারণ বিডের পরে, ট্রাম্প সেট করার জন্য একটি কার্ড নিয়ে যান এবং সেই স্যুটের একটি কার্ডের অনুরোধ করুন যা আপনার হাতে নেই। যে এটি ধরে রাখে তাকে অবশ্যই প্রথম কৌশলে এটি খেলতে হবে এবং আপনার সঙ্গী হবে।","What does Amerikaner mean?":"আমেরিকানার মানে কি?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"এটি শীর্ষ কল: প্রতিটি কৌশলে একা জয়ী হওয়ার চেষ্টা করুন, কোন অংশীদার এবং কোন ট্রাম্প ছাড়াই। একটি সফল কলের মূল্য 52 পয়েন্ট; একটি ব্যর্থ একটি খরচ 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"একটি সাধারণ বিড কীভাবে স্কোর করা হয়?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"ঘোষনাকারী এবং অংশীদার প্রত্যেকে বিড লাভ করে যদি তাদের সম্মিলিত কৌশলগুলি তা পূরণ করে, অথবা প্রত্যেকে বিড হারায় যদি তারা কম হয়। অন্য সবাই প্রতি কৌশলে এক পয়েন্ট লাভ করে।","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"এই গেমটি কি আমার কার্ড বা স্কোর আপলোড করে?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"না। গেমের অবস্থা এবং ঐচ্ছিক সংরক্ষিত গেম এই ডিভাইসে এই ব্রাউজারে থাকে।","Rules and limitations":"নিয়ম এবং সীমাবদ্ধতা","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"এটি একটি নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম সেটের একটি ডিজিটাল অনুশীলন সংস্করণ, এমন দাবি নয় যে প্রতিটি ঘরের নিয়ম কভার করা হয়েছে। স্থানীয় কম্পিউটার বিরোধীরা সাধারণ হিউরিস্টিক ব্যবহার করে, বিশেষজ্ঞ কৌশল নয়। কোনো অনলাইন মাল্টিপ্লেয়ার, অ্যাকাউন্ট বা আপলোড করা গেম ডেটা নেই। যদি ফিনিশিংয়ে স্কোর টাই হয়, টুলটি নির্বিচারে একজনকে বেছে না নিয়ে টাই সর্বোচ্চ খেলোয়াড়দের রিপোর্ট করে।","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"খেলতে বিনামূল্যে। কার্ড, স্কোর এবং ঐচ্ছিক সংরক্ষণ এই ডিভাইসে থাকে; কিছুই আপলোড করা হয় না।","Play Amerikaner":"আমেরিকানার খেলুন","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ফ্রি · আপনার ব্রাউজারে চলে","Total players":"মোট খেলোয়াড়","New game":"নতুন গেম","Resume saved game":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা পুনরায় শুরু করুন","Delete saved game":"সংরক্ষিত গেম মুছুন","Export scores":"রপ্তানি স্কোর","Spades":"স্পেডস","Hearts":"হার্টস","Diamonds":"হীরা","Clubs":"ক্লাব","Jack":"জ্যাক","Queen":"রাণী","King":"কিং","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"আপনার বিড বেছে নিন","Lead a card":"একটি কার্ডের নেতৃত্ব দিন","Play a card":"একটি কার্ড খেলুন","No trump":"না ট্রাম্প","Not revealed":"প্রকাশ করা হয়নি","No card has been played yet.":"এখনো কোনো কার্ড খেলা হয়নি।","You passed.":"আপনি পাস করেছেন।","Your lead is on the table.":"আপনার নেতৃত্ব টেবিলের উপর আছে.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} নেতৃত্বে এবং একটি অংশীদার কার্ডের অনুরোধ করেছে৷","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} খেলেছে।","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"একটি গেম শুরু করুন বা এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত একটি পুনরায় শুরু করুন৷","Player":"প্লেয়ার","You":"আপনি","Computer {number}":"কম্পিউটার {number}","Score":"স্কোর","Tricks":"কৌশল","Round":"গোলাকার","Current bid":"বর্তমান বিড","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} একটি বিড বেছে নিচ্ছে৷","Turn":"বাঁক","Dealer":"ডিলার","Trump":"ট্রাম্প","Partner":"অংশীদার","Bid":"বিড","Number of tricks":"কৌশলের সংখ্যা","Place bid":"স্থান বিড","Pass":"পাস","Call Amerikaner":"আমেরিকানারকে কল করুন","Minimum":"সর্বনিম্ন","Maximum":"সর্বোচ্চ","Set trump and request your partner":"ট্রাম্প সেট করুন এবং আপনার সঙ্গীকে অনুরোধ করুন","Choose your lead card":"আপনার লিড কার্ড বেছে নিন","Request a card in this suit":"এই স্যুটে একটি কার্ডের অনুরোধ করুন","Lead and request this card":"এই কার্ডের নেতৃত্ব দিন এবং অনুরোধ করুন","Play selected card":"নির্বাচিত কার্ড খেলুন","Choose a card to play":"খেলার জন্য একটি কার্ড বেছে নিন","Current trick":"বর্তমান কৌশল","Your hand":"আপনার হাত","Cards in hand":"হাতে কার্ড","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"আপনি যখন পারেন তখন নেতৃত্বাধীন স্যুটটি অনুসরণ করুন। অনুরোধ করা অংশীদার কার্ডটি অবশ্যই প্রথম কৌশলে খেলতে হবে।","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"নিম্নপক্ষে অর্ধেক আপনার হাত গোলাকার এবং বর্তমান বিডের চেয়ে বেশি বিড করুন, এই নিলামের জন্য পাস করুন, অথবা একা প্রতিটি কৌশল চেষ্টা করার জন্য আমেরিকানকে কল করুন।","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"আপনার লিড স্যুট ট্রাম্প হয়ে যায়। সেই স্যুটে একটি ইন-প্লে কার্ডের অনুরোধ করুন যা আপনি ধরে রাখেন না; এর ধারককে প্রথমে এটি খেলতে হবে।","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"প্রতিপক্ষের হাতে কোনো ম্যাচিং কার্ড অবশিষ্ট নেই। একটি অংশীদার ছাড়া নেতৃত্ব; শুধুমাত্র আপনার নিজের বিড স্কোর করা হবে.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"খেলা শুরু হল। ডিলারের বাম খেলোয়াড়টি প্রথমে বিড করে।","{player} passed.":"{player} পাস হয়েছে।","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} বিড {count} কৌশল।","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} আমেরিকানকে বলে: প্রতিটি কৌশল একা, কোন ট্রাম্প নয়।","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"সবাই পাস করেছে। হাত পুনরায় ডিল করা হয়েছিল এবং ডিলার বাম দিকে সরে গেছে।","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} অনুরোধ করা কার্ড ধারণ করেছে এবং আপনার অংশীদার।","{player} won the trick.":"{player} কৌশল জিতেছে।","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"রাউন্ড সম্পূর্ণ। {player} {count} কৌশল নিয়েছে।","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} {count} পয়েন্ট নিয়ে গেম জিতেছে!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"{players}-এর মধ্যে {count} পয়েন্টে টাই শেষ হয়েছে।","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"বিড করা হয়েছে: প্রতিটি সতীর্থ {count} পয়েন্ট লাভ করে।","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"বিড মিস: প্রতিটি সতীর্থ {count} পয়েন্ট হারায়।","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"সফল আমেরিকান: 52 পয়েন্ট।","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"ব্যর্থ আমেরিকান: −52 পয়েন্ট।","Game saved on this device.":"গেমটি এই ডিভাইসে সংরক্ষিত।","Saved game resumed.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা আবার শুরু হয়েছে৷","Saved game deleted.":"সংরক্ষিত খেলা মুছে ফেলা হয়েছে।","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"স্থানীয় সঞ্চয় অনুপলব্ধ; আপনি পৃষ্ঠাটি ছেড়ে না যাওয়া পর্যন্ত এই গেমটি খোলা থাকবে।","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"সংরক্ষিত গেম পড়া যাবে না। একটি নতুন গেম শুরু করুন বা ক্ষতিগ্রস্ত সেভ মুছে দিন।","There is no saved game on this device.":"এই ডিভাইসে কোনো সংরক্ষিত গেম নেই।","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"একটি স্ট্যান্ডার্ড 52-কার্ড ডেক, কোন জোকার নেই। 3–6 প্লেয়ারদের জন্য পর্যাপ্ত দুটি আলাদা করে সমানভাবে ডিল করুন। একটি নিয়মিত বিড হাতের অর্ধেক থেকে শুরু হয় এবং পূর্ববর্তী বিডের উপরে অবশ্যই থাকতে হবে। একা সব কৌশল নিতে আমেরিকানকে কল করুন। নিয়মিত দরপত্রে, ট্রাম্প সেট করতে নেতৃত্ব দিন এবং একটি অংশীদার কার্ডের অনুরোধ করুন। সম্ভব হলে স্যুট অনুসরণ করুন. দল প্রতিটি বিড লাভ বা হারায়; অন্যান্য খেলোয়াড়রা তাদের কৌতুক গণনা লাভ করে। একটি স্কোর 52 এ পৌঁছালে সর্বোচ্চ স্কোর জেতে।","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"নরওয়েজিয়ান নিয়ম চেক করা হয়েছে 16 অক্টোবর 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"নর্স্ক কোর্টসপিল · আমেরিকান"},"ca":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Joc de cartes nord-americà","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Joc de cartes Amerikaner en línia — Ofereix, troba un soci i guanya trucs","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Juga localment al joc de cartes de l'Americà noruec amb de tres a sis jugadors. Fes una oferta per trucs, tria trump, troba la teva parella i mantén la puntuació en aquest dispositiu.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Aprèn el joc de trucs de l'americà noruec: proposa quants trucs pots fer tu i un company desconegut, marca l'avantatge amb el teu avantatge i demana la targeta que revela la teva parella.","A quick example":"Un exemple ràpid","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Amb quatre jugadors, una oferta de 8 guanya si tu i el company revelat per la teva targeta sol·licitada prens almenys 8 trucs junts. Aleshores, cada company d'equip guanya 8 punts; cada altre jugador guanya el seu propi recompte de trucs.","How to play":"Com jugar","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Aquesta versió local segueix les regles americanes noruegues contrastades amb Norske kortspill. Admet de tres a sis jugadors amb una baralla estàndard i sense bromistas. Per repartir de manera igualada, es reserven un, dos o quatre dos per a tres, cinc o sis jugadors; quatre jugadors utilitzen totes les targetes 52. El jugador que queda del distribuïdor puja primer. Una oferta normal ha de ser almenys la meitat de la mà arrodonida i més alta que l'oferta actual; també pots passar o trucar a Amerikaner per provar tots els trucs sols sense parella ni triomf. Si guanyes una oferta normal, lidera la primera carta per marcar el triomf i sol·licita una carta en joc amb aquest pal que no estigui a la teva mà. El seu titular l'ha de jugar a la primera jugada i es converteix en el teu company. Si no queda cap carta coincident a les mans dels oponents en un avantatge posterior, continua sense company; només el declarant es puntua com a licitador. Els jugadors han de seguir el vestit led sempre que sigui possible. El triomf més alt guanya una baza, o la carta més alta del pal led si no hi ha triomf. El declarant i el soci guanyen l'oferta quan la fan, o cadascú perden l'oferta quan no la fan; els altres jugadors guanyen un punt per cada truc que prenen. Un americà amb èxit guanya 52 punts i un que ha fallat perd 52. Després d'una ronda, el repartidor es mou cap a l'esquerra. Quan una puntuació arriba a 52, guanya la puntuació més alta. Els oponents d'ordinadors locals fan eleccions heurístiques senzilles; no hi ha multijugador en línia.","How many players can play?":"Quants jugadors poden jugar?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Trieu tres, quatre, cinc o sis seients. El primer jugador ets tu; els altres seients són oponents informàtics locals.","How is the deck dealt?":"Com es tracta la baralla?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Feu servir targetes 52 sense bromes. Deixeu un dos per tres jugadors, cap per quatre, dos per cinc i els quatre dos per sis perquè cada mà tingui el mateix nombre de cartes.","How do I find my partner?":"Com trobo la meva parella?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Després d'una oferta normal, condueix una carta per posar l'atout i sol·licita una carta d'aquest pal que no estigui a la teva mà. Qui l'agafi l'ha de jugar a la primera jugada i es converteix en la teva parella.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Què vol dir Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"És la millor convocatòria: intenta guanyar tots els trucs sol, sense parella ni triomf. Una trucada reeixida val 52 punts; una fallada costa 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Com es puntua una oferta normal?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"El declarant i el soci guanyen l'oferta si els seus trucs combinats la compleixen, o cadascú perden l'oferta si es queden curts. Tots els altres guanyen un punt per truc.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Aquest joc penja les meves cartes o puntuacions?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Núm. L'estat del joc i el joc opcional desat es mantenen en aquest navegador en aquest dispositiu.","Rules and limitations":"Normes i limitacions","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Aquesta és una versió de pràctica digital d'un conjunt de regles noruecs, no una afirmació que totes les normes domèstiques estiguin cobertes. Els oponents d'ordinadors locals utilitzen heurística simple, no estratègia experta. No hi ha dades multijugador en línia, comptes o jocs penjats. Si les puntuacions empaten al final, l'eina informa dels jugadors més alts empatats en lloc d'escollir-ne un arbitràriament.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Jugar gratuït. Les targetes, les puntuacions i el desat opcional es mantenen en aquest dispositiu; no es carrega res.","Play Amerikaner":"Play Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUÏT · EXECUCIÓ AL TEU NAVEGADOR","Total players":"Jugadors totals","New game":"Joc nou","Resume saved game":"Reprèn la partida desada","Delete saved game":"Suprimeix la partida desada","Export scores":"Exporta puntuacions","Spades":"Piques","Hearts":"Cors","Diamonds":"Diamants","Clubs":"Clubs","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Reina","King":"Rei","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Trieu la vostra oferta","Lead a card":"Condueix una targeta","Play a card":"Juga una carta","No trump":"Sense triomf","Not revealed":"No revelat","No card has been played yet.":"Encara no s'ha jugat cap carta.","You passed.":"Vas passar.","Your lead is on the table.":"El teu avantatge està sobre la taula.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} va dirigir i va demanar una targeta de soci.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} va jugar a {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Inicia un joc o reprèn el desat en aquest dispositiu.","Player":"Jugador","You":"tu","Computer {number}":"Ordinador {number}","Score":"Puntuació","Tricks":"Trucs","Round":"Ronda","Current bid":"Oferta actual","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} està escollint una oferta.","Turn":"Gira","Dealer":"Distribuïdor","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Soci","Bid":"Oferta","Number of tricks":"Nombre de trucs","Place bid":"Posa oferta","Pass":"Passa","Call Amerikaner":"Truqueu a l'Americà","Minimum":"Mínim","Maximum":"Màxim","Set trump and request your partner":"Poseu trump i demaneu la vostra parella","Choose your lead card":"Trieu la vostra targeta principal","Request a card in this suit":"Demaneu una targeta amb aquest vestit","Lead and request this card":"Condueix i sol·licita aquesta targeta","Play selected card":"Reprodueix la targeta seleccionada","Choose a card to play":"Tria una carta per jugar","Current trick":"Truc actual","Your hand":"La teva mà","Cards in hand":"Targetes a la mà","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Seguiu el vestit de led quan pugueu. La carta de soci sol·licitada s'ha de jugar a la primera jugada.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Ofereix almenys la meitat de la mà arrodonida i més que l'oferta actual, passa per aquesta subhasta o truca a Amerikaner per provar tots els trucs sol.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"El teu vestit de plom es converteix en un triomf. Demaneu una carta en joc amb aquest vestit que no teniu; el seu titular l'ha de jugar primer.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"No queda cap targeta coincident a les mans dels oponents. Liderar sense parella; només es puntuarà la teva pròpia oferta.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"El joc va començar. El jugador que queda del distribuïdor puja primer.","{player} passed.":"{player} aprovat.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} oferta {count} trucs.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} anomenat Amerikaner: cada truc sol, sense triomf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Tothom va passar. Es va tornar a repartir la mà i el repartidor es va moure cap a l'esquerra.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} tenia la targeta sol·licitada i és la vostra parella.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} va guanyar el truc.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Ronda completa. {player} va fer trucs de {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} va guanyar el joc amb {count} punts!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"El joc va acabar amb un empat entre {players} a {count} punts.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Oferta feta: cada company d'equip guanya {count} punts.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Oferta perduda: cada company perd {count} punts.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Usuari d'èxit: 52 punts.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Americà fallit: −52 punts.","Game saved on this device.":"El joc s'ha desat en aquest dispositiu.","Saved game resumed.":"S'ha reprès la partida desada.","Saved game deleted.":"S'ha suprimit el joc desat.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"L'emmagatzematge local no està disponible; aquest joc romandrà obert fins que abandonis la pàgina.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No s'ha pogut llegir el joc desat. Comença un joc nou o suprimeix el desat danyat.","There is no saved game on this device.":"No hi ha cap joc desat en aquest dispositiu.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Una baralla de targetes 52 estàndard, sense bromes. Reparteix de manera uniforme per als jugadors de 3–6 deixant de banda prou dos. Una oferta normal comença a la meitat de la mà arrodonida cap amunt i ha de superar l'oferta anterior. Truca a Amerikaner per fer tots els trucs sol. En una oferta regular, condueix a marcar l'avantatge i sol·licita una targeta de soci. Seguiu el mateix quan sigui possible. Cada equip guanya o perd l'oferta; altres jugadors guanyen el seu recompte de trucs. La puntuació més alta guanya quan una puntuació arriba a 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regles noruegues verificades 16 Octubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Americaner"},"de":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner-Kartenspiel","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner-Kartenspiel online – Bieten, Partner finden und Tricks gewinnen","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Spielen Sie das norwegisch-amerikanische Kartenspiel lokal mit drei bis sechs Spielern. Bieten Sie auf Stiche, wählen Sie Trumpf, finden Sie Ihren Partner und behalten Sie den Punktestand auf diesem Gerät.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Lernen Sie das norwegisch-amerikanische Stichspiel: Bieten Sie, wie viele Stiche Sie und ein unbekannter Partner ausführen können, setzen Sie mit Ihrem Ausspiel einen Trumpf und fordern Sie die Karte an, die Ihren Partner enthüllt.","A quick example":"Ein kurzes Beispiel","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Bei vier Spielern gewinnt ein Gebot von 8, wenn Sie und der durch Ihre angeforderte Karte aufgedeckte Partner zusammen mindestens 8 Stiche machen. Jeder Teamkollege erhält dann 8-Punkte; Jeder andere Spieler erhält seine eigene Stichzahl.","How to play":"Wie man spielt","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Diese lokale Version folgt den norwegisch-amerikanischen Regeln, die mit Norske kortspill verglichen wurden. Es unterstützt drei bis sechs Spieler mit einem Standarddeck und ohne Joker. Um eine gleichmäßige Verteilung zu gewährleisten, werden ein, zwei oder vier Zweier für drei, fünf oder sechs Spieler reserviert; Vier Spieler nutzen alle 52-Karten. Der Spieler links vom Dealer bietet zuerst. Ein reguläres Gebot muss mindestens die Hälfte Ihrer aufgerundeten Hand betragen und höher als das aktuelle Gebot sein. Sie können auch passen oder Amerikaner anrufen, um jeden Trick alleine ohne Partner oder Trumpf auszuprobieren. Wenn Sie ein reguläres Gebot gewinnen, führen Sie die erste Karte aus, um den Trumpf zu setzen, und fordern Sie eine im Spiel befindliche Karte in dieser Farbe an, die nicht auf Ihrer Hand ist. Sein Besitzer muss ihn im ersten Stich spielen und wird Ihr Partner. Wenn bei einer späteren Ausspielung keine passende Karte mehr in den Händen der Gegner verbleibt, fahren Sie ohne Partner fort; Nur der Alleinspieler wird als Bieter gewertet. Die Spieler müssen nach Möglichkeit der angeführten Farbe folgen. Der höchste Trumpf gewinnt einen Stich, oder die höchste Karte in der ausgespielten Farbe, wenn es keinen Trumpf gibt. Der Alleinspieler und der Partner gewinnen jeweils das Gebot, wenn sie es machen, oder verlieren jeweils das Gebot, wenn sie es verfehlen. Andere Spieler erhalten für jeden Stich, den sie machen, einen Punkt. Ein erfolgreicher Amerikaner erhält 52-Punkte und ein gescheiterter Amerikaner verliert 52. Nach einer Runde bewegt sich der Dealer nach links. Sobald eine Punktzahl 52 erreicht, gewinnt die höchste Punktzahl. Lokale Computergegner treffen einfache heuristische Entscheidungen; Es gibt keinen Online-Multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Wie viele Spieler können spielen?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Wählen Sie drei, vier, fünf oder sechs Sitze. Spieler eins bist du; Die anderen Sitze sind lokale Computergegner.","How is the deck dealt?":"Wie wird das Deck ausgeteilt?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Verwenden Sie 52-Karten ohne Joker. Legen Sie eine Zwei für drei Spieler beiseite, keine für vier, zwei für fünf und alle vier Zweien für sechs, sodass jede Hand die gleiche Anzahl an Karten hat.","How do I find my partner?":"Wie finde ich meinen Partner?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Führen Sie nach einem normalen Gebot eine Karte aus, um den Trumpf zu setzen, und fordern Sie eine Karte dieser Farbe an, die sich nicht auf Ihrer Hand befindet. Wer es hält, muss es im ersten Stich spielen und wird Ihr Partner.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Was bedeutet Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Es ist die oberste Priorität: Versuchen Sie, jeden Stich alleine zu gewinnen, ohne Partner und ohne Trumpf. Ein erfolgreicher Anruf ist 52 Punkte wert; ein fehlgeschlagener kostet 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Wie wird ein normales Gebot bewertet?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Der Alleinspieler und der Partner gewinnen jeweils das Gebot, wenn ihre kombinierten Stiche das Gebot erfüllen, oder verlieren jeweils das Gebot, wenn sie zu kurz kommen. Alle anderen erhalten einen Punkt pro Stich.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Ladet dieses Spiel meine Karten oder Punkte hoch?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Der Spielstatus und das optional gespeicherte Spiel bleiben in diesem Browser auf diesem Gerät.","Rules and limitations":"Regeln und Einschränkungen","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Dies ist eine digitale Übungsversion eines norwegischen Regelsatzes und kein Anspruch darauf, dass alle Hausregeln abgedeckt sind. Lokale Computergegner nutzen einfache Heuristiken, keine Expertenstrategie. Es gibt keinen Online-Multiplayer, kein Konto oder keine hochgeladenen Spieldaten. Wenn es im Ziel einen Gleichstand gibt, meldet das Tool die Spieler mit dem höchsten Gleichstand, anstatt willkürlich einen auszuwählen.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Kostenlos spielbar. Karten, Spielstände und die optionale Speicherung bleiben auf diesem Gerät; Es wird nichts hochgeladen.","Play Amerikaner":"Amerikaner spielen","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KOSTENLOS · LÄUFT IN IHREM BROWSER","Total players":"Spieler insgesamt","New game":"Neues Spiel","Resume saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel fortsetzen","Delete saved game":"Gespeichertes Spiel löschen","Export scores":"Ergebnisse exportieren","Spades":"Spaten","Hearts":"Herzen","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Clubs":"Schläger","Jack":"Buchse","Queen":"Königin","King":"König","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Wählen Sie Ihr Gebot","Lead a card":"Eine Karte führen","Play a card":"Spielen Sie eine Karte","No trump":"Kein Trumpf","Not revealed":"Nicht bekannt gegeben","No card has been played yet.":"Es wurde noch keine Karte gespielt.","You passed.":"Du hast bestanden.","Your lead is on the table.":"Ihr Vorsprung liegt auf dem Tisch.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} geführt und eine Partnerkarte angefordert.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} gespielt {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Starten Sie ein Spiel oder setzen Sie das auf diesem Gerät gespeicherte Spiel fort.","Player":"Spieler","You":"Du","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","Score":"Punktzahl","Tricks":"Tricks","Round":"Runden","Current bid":"Aktuelles Gebot","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} wählt ein Gebot aus.","Turn":"Drehen","Dealer":"Händler","Trump":"Trumpf","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Gebot","Number of tricks":"Anzahl der Tricks","Place bid":"Gebot abgeben","Pass":"Bestanden","Call Amerikaner":"Amerikaner anrufen","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maximum","Set trump and request your partner":"Setze Trumpf und fordere deinen Partner auf","Choose your lead card":"Wählen Sie Ihre Lead-Karte","Request a card in this suit":"Fordern Sie eine Karte in dieser Farbe an","Lead and request this card":"Diese Karte führen und anfordern","Play selected card":"Ausgewählte Karte spielen","Choose a card to play":"Wählen Sie eine Karte zum Spielen","Current trick":"Aktueller Trick","Your hand":"Deine Hand","Cards in hand":"Karten in der Hand","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Folgen Sie dem LED-Anzug, wenn Sie können. Im ersten Stich muss die gewünschte Partnerkarte gespielt werden.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Bieten Sie mindestens die Hälfte Ihrer Hand aufgerundet und höher als das aktuelle Gebot, nehmen Sie an dieser Auktion teil oder rufen Sie die Amerikaner an, um jeden Trick einzeln auszuprobieren.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Ihre Hauptfarbe wird Trumpf. Fordern Sie eine im Spiel befindliche Karte in dieser Farbe an, die Sie nicht besitzen; Sein Besitzer muss es zuerst spielen.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Es verbleibt keine passende Karte in den Händen des Gegners. Ohne Partner führen; Nur Ihr eigenes Gebot wird gewertet.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Das Spiel hat begonnen. Der Spieler links vom Dealer bietet zuerst.","{player} passed.":"{player} bestanden.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bieten {count} Tricks.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} rief die Amerikaner: Jeder Trick allein, kein Trumpf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Alle haben bestanden. Die Hand wurde erneut ausgeteilt und der Dealer bewegte sich nach links.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} war Inhaber der angeforderten Karte und ist Ihr Partner.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} hat den Stich gewonnen.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Runde abgeschlossen. {player} hat {count} Stiche gemacht.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} hat das Spiel mit {count} Punkten gewonnen!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Das Spiel endete mit einem Unentschieden zwischen {players} und {count} Punkten.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Gebot abgegeben: Jeder Teamkollege erhält {count} Punkte.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Gebot verpasst: Jeder Teamkollege verliert {count} Punkte.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Erfolgreiche Amerikaner: 52 Punkte.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Fehlgeschlagene Amerikaner: −52 Punkte.","Game saved on this device.":"Spiel auf diesem Gerät gespeichert.","Saved game resumed.":"Das gespeicherte Spiel wird fortgesetzt.","Saved game deleted.":"Gespeichertes Spiel gelöscht.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokales Speichern ist nicht verfügbar; Dieses Spiel bleibt geöffnet, bis Sie die Seite verlassen.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Das gespeicherte Spiel konnte nicht gelesen werden. Starten Sie ein neues Spiel oder löschen Sie den beschädigten Speicher.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Auf diesem Gerät ist kein gespeichertes Spiel vorhanden.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Ein Standard-Kartenspiel 52, keine Joker. Teilen Sie die Spieler gleichmäßig auf die Spieler 3–6 aus, indem Sie genügend Zweier beiseite legen. Ein reguläres Gebot beginnt mit der Hälfte der aufgerundeten Hand und muss das vorherige Gebot übersteigen. Rufen Sie die Amerikaner an, alle Tricks alleine zu meistern. Führen Sie bei einem regulären Gebot den Trumpf aus und fordern Sie eine Partnerkarte an. Folgen Sie dem Beispiel, wenn möglich. Das Team gewinnt oder verliert jeweils das Gebot. Andere Spieler erhalten ihre Stichanzahl. Der höchste Punktestand gewinnt, sobald der Punktestand 52 erreicht.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norwegische Regeln überprüft 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Nordische Karte · Amerikaner"},"el":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Παιχνίδι καρτών Amerikaner","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner παιχνίδι καρτών στο Διαδίκτυο — Προσφορά, Βρείτε έναν συνεργάτη και κερδίστε κόλπα","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Παίξτε το παιχνίδι με κάρτες Norwegian Amerikaner τοπικά με τρεις έως έξι παίκτες. Κάντε προσφορά για κόλπα, επιλέξτε ατού, βρείτε τον σύντροφό σας και διατηρήστε τη βαθμολογία σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Μάθετε το νορβηγικό παιχνίδι κόλπας Amerikaner: υποβάλετε προσφορά για πόσα κόλπα μπορείτε να κάνετε εσείς και ένας άγνωστος συνεργάτης, ορίστε ατού με το προβάδισμά σας και ζητήστε την κάρτα που αποκαλύπτει τον σύντροφό σας.","A quick example":"Ένα γρήγορο παράδειγμα","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Με τέσσερις παίκτες, μια προσφορά 8 κερδίζει εάν εσείς και ο συνεργάτης που αποκαλύπτεται από την κάρτα που ζητήσατε κάνετε τουλάχιστον 8 κόλπα μαζί. Στη συνέχεια, κάθε συμπαίκτης κερδίζει 8 πόντους. κάθε άλλος παίκτης κερδίζει τον δικό του αριθμό κόλπων.","How to play":"Πώς να παίξετε","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Αυτή η τοπική έκδοση ακολουθεί τους νορβηγικούς κανόνες Amerikaner που έχουν ελεγχθεί έναντι του Norske kortspill. Υποστηρίζει τρεις έως έξι παίκτες με τυπική τράπουλα και χωρίς τζόκερ. Για να μοιράζεστε ομοιόμορφα, ένα, δύο ή τέσσερα δίδυμα προορίζονται για τρεις, πέντε ή έξι παίκτες. τέσσερις παίκτες χρησιμοποιούν όλες τις κάρτες 52. Ο παίκτης που έφυγε από τον ντίλερ κάνει προσφορές πρώτος. Μια κανονική προσφορά πρέπει να είναι τουλάχιστον το ήμισυ του χεριού σας στρογγυλεμένο προς τα πάνω και υψηλότερη από την τρέχουσα προσφορά. Μπορείτε επίσης να περάσετε ή να καλέσετε τον Amerikaner για να δοκιμάσετε κάθε κόλπο μόνος σας χωρίς σύντροφο ή ατού. Εάν κερδίσετε μια κανονική προσφορά, οδηγήστε το πρώτο φύλλο για να ορίσετε ατού και ζητήστε ένα φύλλο εντός παιχνιδιού σε αυτό το χρώμα που δεν είναι στο χέρι σας. Ο κάτοχός του πρέπει να το παίξει στο πρώτο κόλπο και να γίνει σύντροφός σας. Εάν δεν μείνει κανένα αντίστοιχο φύλλο στα χέρια των αντιπάλων σε επόμενο προβάδισμα, συνεχίστε χωρίς συνεργάτη. ως πλειοδότης βαθμολογείται μόνο ο δηλών. Οι παίκτες πρέπει να ακολουθούν το κοστούμι led όταν είναι δυνατόν. Ο υψηλότερος ατού κερδίζει ένα κόλπο ή το υψηλότερο φύλλο στο led αν δεν υπάρχει ατού. Ο δηλών και ο εταίρος κερδίζουν την προσφορά όταν την υποβάλουν, ή ο καθένας χάνει την προσφορά όταν χάνει. άλλοι παίκτες κερδίζουν έναν πόντο για κάθε κόλπο που κάνουν. Ένας επιτυχημένος Amerikaner κερδίζει 52 πόντους και ένας αποτυχημένος χάνει 52. Μετά από έναν γύρο, ο ντίλερ μετακινείται αριστερά. Μόλις μια βαθμολογία φτάσει στο 52, η υψηλότερη βαθμολογία κερδίζει. Οι αντίπαλοι των τοπικών υπολογιστών κάνουν απλές ευρετικές επιλογές. δεν υπάρχει online multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Πόσοι παίκτες μπορούν να παίξουν;","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Επιλέξτε τρεις, τέσσερις, πέντε ή έξι θέσεις. Παίκτης ένα είσαι εσύ. οι άλλες θέσεις είναι αντίπαλοι τοπικών υπολογιστών.","How is the deck dealt?":"Πώς αντιμετωπίζεται η τράπουλα;","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Χρησιμοποιήστε κάρτες 52 χωρίς τζόκερ. Αφήστε κατά μέρος ένα δύο για τρεις παίκτες, κανένα για τέσσερις, δύο για πέντε και τα τέσσερα δύο για έξι, ώστε κάθε χέρι να έχει τον ίδιο αριθμό φύλλων.","How do I find my partner?":"Πώς μπορώ να βρω τον σύντροφό μου;","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Μετά από μια κανονική προσφορά, οδηγήστε ένα φύλλο για να ορίσετε ατού και ζητήστε ένα φύλλο αυτού του χρώματος που δεν είναι στο χέρι σας. Όποιος το κρατήσει πρέπει να το παίξει στο πρώτο κόλπο και να γίνει σύντροφός σου.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Τι σημαίνει Amerikaner;","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Είναι η κορυφαία έκκληση: προσπαθήστε να κερδίσετε κάθε κόλπο μόνος σας, χωρίς συνεργάτη και χωρίς ατού. Μια επιτυχημένη κλήση αξίζει 52 πόντους. ένα αποτυχημένο κοστίζει 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Πώς βαθμολογείται μια κανονική προσφορά;","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Ο δηλών και ο συνεργάτης κερδίζουν ο καθένας την προσφορά εάν τα συνδυασμένα κόλπα τους ανταποκρίνονται σε αυτήν, ή ο καθένας χάνει την προσφορά εάν δεν ανταποκρίνεται. Όλοι οι άλλοι κερδίζουν έναν πόντο ανά κόλπο.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Αυτό το παιχνίδι ανεβάζει τις κάρτες ή τα σκορ μου;","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Αρ. Η κατάσταση του παιχνιδιού και το προαιρετικό αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι παραμένουν σε αυτό το πρόγραμμα περιήγησης σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Rules and limitations":"Κανόνες και περιορισμοί","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Πρόκειται για μια έκδοση ψηφιακής πρακτικής ενός συνόλου νορβηγικών κανόνων, όχι για έναν ισχυρισμό ότι καλύπτεται κάθε οικιακός κανόνας. Οι αντίπαλοι των τοπικών υπολογιστών χρησιμοποιούν απλές ευρετικές μεθόδους, όχι εξειδικευμένη στρατηγική. Δεν υπάρχουν δεδομένα για πολλούς παίκτες στο διαδίκτυο, λογαριασμός ή μεταφορτωμένα δεδομένα παιχνιδιού. Εάν οι βαθμολογίες ισοδυναμούν στον τερματισμό, το εργαλείο αναφέρει τους παίκτες που ισοβαθμούν με την υψηλότερη βαθμολογία αντί να επιλέξει έναν αυθαίρετα.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Δωρεάν παιχνίδι. Κάρτες, βαθμολογίες και η προαιρετική αποθήκευση σε αυτήν τη συσκευή. τίποτα δεν έχει ανέβει.","Play Amerikaner":"Παίξτε Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ΔΩΡΕΑΝ · ΕΚΤΕΛΕΙΤΑΙ ΣΤΟ BROWSER ΣΑΣ","Total players":"Σύνολο παικτών","New game":"Νέο παιχνίδι","Resume saved game":"Συνέχιση αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Delete saved game":"Διαγραφή αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού","Export scores":"Βαθμολογίες εξαγωγής","Spades":"Μπαστούνια","Hearts":"Καρδιές","Diamonds":"Διαμάντια","Clubs":"Συλλόγους","Jack":"Βύσμα","Queen":"Βασίλισσα","King":"Βασιλιάς","Ace":"Άσσος","Choose your bid":"Επιλέξτε την προσφορά σας","Lead a card":"Δώστε μια κάρτα","Play a card":"Παίξτε μια κάρτα","No trump":"Χωρίς ατού","Not revealed":"Δεν αποκαλύπτεται","No card has been played yet.":"Δεν έχει παιχτεί ακόμη κάρτα.","You passed.":"Πέρασες.","Your lead is on the table.":"Το προβάδισμά σας είναι στο τραπέζι.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"Το {player} οδήγησε και ζήτησε μια κάρτα συνεργάτη.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} έπαιξε {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Ξεκινήστε ένα παιχνίδι ή συνεχίστε αυτό που είναι αποθηκευμένο σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Player":"Παίχτης","You":"Εσείς","Computer {number}":"Υπολογιστής {number}","Score":"Σκορ","Tricks":"Κόλπα","Round":"Γύρω","Current bid":"Τρέχουσα προσφορά","{player} is choosing a bid.":"Το {player} επιλέγει μια προσφορά.","Turn":"Σειρά","Dealer":"Εμπορος","Trump":"Ατού","Partner":"Εταίρος","Bid":"Προσφορά","Number of tricks":"Αριθμός τεχνασμάτων","Place bid":"Τοποθετήστε προσφορά","Pass":"Πασ","Call Amerikaner":"Καλέστε τον Amerikaner","Minimum":"Ελάχιστο","Maximum":"Μέγ","Set trump and request your partner":"Ρυθμίστε ατού και ζητήστε από τον σύντροφό σας","Choose your lead card":"Επιλέξτε την κάρτα μολύβδου σας","Request a card in this suit":"Ζητήστε μια κάρτα σε αυτό το κοστούμι","Lead and request this card":"Οδηγήστε και ζητήστε αυτήν την κάρτα","Play selected card":"Παίξτε επιλεγμένη κάρτα","Choose a card to play":"Επιλέξτε μια κάρτα για να παίξετε","Current trick":"Τρέχον κόλπο","Your hand":"Το χέρι σου","Cards in hand":"Κάρτες στο χέρι","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Ακολουθήστε το κοστούμι led όταν μπορείτε. Η κάρτα συνεργάτη που ζητήθηκε πρέπει να παιχτεί στο πρώτο κόλπο.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Προσφέρετε τουλάχιστον το μισό χέρι σας στρογγυλεμένο προς τα πάνω και υψηλότερα από την τρέχουσα προσφορά, περάστε για αυτήν τη δημοπρασία ή καλέστε την Amerikaner για να δοκιμάσετε κάθε κόλπο μόνος σας.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Το μολύβδινο σου κοστούμι γίνεται ατού. Ζητήστε μια κάρτα στο παιχνίδι με αυτό το κοστούμι που δεν κρατάτε. ο κάτοχός του πρέπει να το παίξει πρώτα.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Δεν υπάρχει αντίστοιχο φύλλο στα χέρια των αντιπάλων. Οδηγήστε χωρίς συνεργάτη. μόνο η δική σας προσφορά θα βαθμολογηθεί.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Το παιχνίδι ξεκίνησε. Ο παίκτης που έφυγε από τον ντίλερ κάνει προσφορές πρώτος.","{player} passed.":"{player} πέρασε.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} προσφορά {count} κόλπα.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} που ονομάζεται Amerikaner: κάθε κόλπο μόνο του, χωρίς ατού.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Πέρασαν όλοι. Το χέρι ξαναμοιράστηκε και ο ντίλερ μετακινήθηκε αριστερά.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"Ο {player} κράτησε την κάρτα που ζητήσατε και είναι ο συνεργάτης σας.","{player} won the trick.":"Ο {player} κέρδισε το κόλπο.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Στρογγυλή πλήρης. Ο {player} πήρε {count} κόλπα.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"Ο {player} κέρδισε το παιχνίδι με {count} πόντους!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Το παιχνίδι έληξε με ισοπαλία μεταξύ {players} σε {count} πόντους.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Υποβλήθηκε προσφορά: κάθε συμπαίκτης κερδίζει {count} πόντους.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Προσφορά που χάθηκε: κάθε συμπαίκτης χάνει {count} πόντους.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Επιτυχημένος Amerikaner: 52 πόντοι.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Αποτυχία Amerikaner: −52 πόντοι.","Game saved on this device.":"Το παιχνίδι αποθηκεύτηκε σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","Saved game resumed.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι συνεχίστηκε.","Saved game deleted.":"Το αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι διαγράφηκε.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Η τοπική αποθήκευση δεν είναι διαθέσιμη. αυτό το παιχνίδι θα παραμείνει ανοιχτό μέχρι να φύγετε από τη σελίδα.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Δεν ήταν δυνατή η ανάγνωση του αποθηκευμένου παιχνιδιού. Ξεκινήστε ένα νέο παιχνίδι ή διαγράψτε την κατεστραμμένη αποθήκευση.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Δεν υπάρχει αποθηκευμένο παιχνίδι σε αυτήν τη συσκευή.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Μια τυπική τράπουλα 52, χωρίς τζόκερ. Διαχειριστείτε ομοιόμορφα για παίκτες 3–6, αφήνοντας στην άκρη αρκετά δύο. Μια κανονική προσφορά ξεκινά με το μισό του χεριού στρογγυλοποιημένο προς τα πάνω και πρέπει να είναι πάνω από την προηγούμενη προσφορά. Καλέστε τον Amerikaner να κάνει όλα τα κόλπα μόνος. Σε μια κανονική προσφορά, οδηγήστε σε ορισμό ατού και ζητήστε μια κάρτα συνεργάτη. Ακολουθήστε το παράδειγμα όταν μπορείτε. Η κάθε ομάδα κερδίζει ή χάνει την προσφορά. άλλοι παίκτες κερδίζουν τα κόλπα τους. Η υψηλότερη βαθμολογία κερδίζει μόλις μια βαθμολογία φτάσει σε 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Οι νορβηγικοί κανόνες έχουν ελεγχθεί 16 Οκτώβριος 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"es":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Juego de cartas americano","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Juego de cartas Amerikaner en línea: apuesta, busca pareja y gana bazas","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Juega localmente al juego de cartas noruego Amerikaner con tres a seis jugadores. Puja por trucos, elige triunfo, encuentra a tu compañero y lleva la puntuación en este dispositivo.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Juega al Amerikaner noruego, un juego de bazas: apuesta cuántas bazas puedes ganar junto con una pareja aún desconocida, establece el triunfo al salir y pide la carta que revela quién es tu pareja.","A quick example":"Un ejemplo rápido","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Con cuatro jugadores, una oferta de 8 gana si usted y el compañero revelado por la carta solicitada realizan al menos 8 trucos juntos. Luego, cada compañero de equipo gana puntos 8; Cada uno de los demás jugadores gana su propio recuento de trucos.","How to play":"Cómo jugar","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Esta versión local sigue las reglas noruegas americanas comparadas con Norske kortspill. Admite de tres a seis jugadores con un mazo estándar y sin comodines. Para repartir equitativamente, se reservan uno, dos o cuatro doses para tres, cinco o seis jugadores; cuatro jugadores usan todas las cartas 52. El jugador a la izquierda del crupier puja primero. Una oferta normal debe ser al menos la mitad de su mano redondeada hacia arriba y mayor que la oferta actual; También puedes pasar o igualar a Amerikaner para probar cada truco solo sin compañero ni triunfo. Si gana una oferta normal, salga con la primera carta para establecer triunfo y solicite una carta en juego de ese palo que no esté en su mano. Su poseedor debe jugarlo en la primera baza y se convierte en su compañero. Si no queda ninguna carta igual en las manos de los oponentes en una salida posterior, continúa sin compañero; sólo el declarante es puntuado como postor. Los jugadores deben seguir el ejemplo liderado cuando sea posible. El triunfo más alto gana una baza, o la carta más alta del palo liderado si no hay triunfo. El declarante y el socio ganan cada uno la oferta cuando la hacen, o cada uno pierde la oferta cuando fallan; otros jugadores ganan un punto por cada truco que realizan. Un americano exitoso gana puntos 52 y uno fallido pierde 52. Después de una ronda, el crupier se mueve hacia la izquierda. Una vez que una puntuación alcanza 52, gana la puntuación más alta. Los oponentes de las computadoras locales toman decisiones heurísticas simples; no hay multijugador en línea.","How many players can play?":"¿Cuántos jugadores pueden jugar?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Elige tres, cuatro, cinco o seis asientos. El jugador uno eres tú; los otros asientos son oponentes informáticos locales.","How is the deck dealt?":"¿Cómo se reparte la baraja?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Usa tarjetas 52 sin comodines. Reserve uno, dos para tres jugadores, ninguno para cuatro, dos para cinco y los cuatro dos para seis, de modo que cada mano tenga la misma cantidad de cartas.","How do I find my partner?":"¿Cómo encuentro a mi pareja?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Después de una oferta normal, salga una carta para establecer triunfo y solicite una carta de ese palo que no esté en su mano. Quien lo tenga deberá jugarlo en la primera baza y se convertirá en su compañero.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"¿Qué significa americano?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Es la decisión principal: intenta ganar cada baza solo, sin pareja y sin triunfo. Una llamada exitosa vale puntos 52; uno fallido cuesta 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"¿Cómo se califica una oferta normal?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"El declarante y su socio ganan cada uno la oferta si sus bazas combinadas la cumplen, o ambos pierden la oferta si se quedan cortos. Todos los demás ganan un punto por truco.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"¿Este juego carga mis cartas o puntuaciones?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"No. El estado del juego y el juego guardado opcional permanecen en este navegador en este dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Reglas y limitaciones","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Esta es una versión de práctica digital de un conjunto de reglas noruego, no una afirmación de que todas las reglas de la casa estén cubiertas. Los oponentes informáticos locales utilizan heurísticas simples, no estrategias expertas. No hay multijugador en línea, cuenta ni datos de juegos cargados. Si las puntuaciones empatan al final, la herramienta informa los jugadores más empatados en lugar de elegir uno arbitrariamente.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis para jugar. Las tarjetas, las puntuaciones y el guardado opcional permanecen en este dispositivo; no se sube nada.","Play Amerikaner":"Reproducir americano","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · SE EJECUTA EN TU NAVEGADOR","Total players":"Total de jugadores","New game":"Nuevo juego","Resume saved game":"Reanudar partida guardada","Delete saved game":"Eliminar partida guardada","Export scores":"Exportar puntuaciones","Spades":"Espadas","Hearts":"Corazones","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Clubs":"Palos","Jack":"Conector","Queen":"Reina","King":"Rey","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Elige tu oferta","Lead a card":"Liderar una tarjeta","Play a card":"jugar una carta","No trump":"sin triunfo","Not revealed":"No revelado","No card has been played yet.":"Aún no se ha jugado ninguna carta.","You passed.":"Pasaste.","Your lead is on the table.":"Tu ventaja está sobre la mesa.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} lideró y solicitó una tarjeta de socio.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} jugó {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Inicia un juego o reanuda el guardado en este dispositivo.","Player":"Jugador","You":"Tú","Computer {number}":"Computadora {number}","Score":"Puntaje","Tricks":"Engaños","Round":"Redondo","Current bid":"Oferta actual","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} está eligiendo una oferta.","Turn":"Doblar","Dealer":"Distribuidor","Trump":"Triunfo","Partner":"Pareja","Bid":"Licitación","Number of tricks":"numero de trucos","Place bid":"Realizar una oferta","Pass":"Pase","Call Amerikaner":"Llame a americano","Minimum":"Mínimo","Maximum":"Máximo","Set trump and request your partner":"Pon triunfo y solicita a tu pareja","Choose your lead card":"Elige tu tarjeta principal","Request a card in this suit":"Solicitar una tarjeta en este palo","Lead and request this card":"Liderar y solicitar esta tarjeta","Play selected card":"Jugar la carta seleccionada","Choose a card to play":"Elige una carta para jugar","Current trick":"Truco actual","Your hand":"Tu mano","Cards in hand":"Tarjetas en mano","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Sigue el traje LED cuando puedas. La carta de socio solicitada debe jugarse en la primera baza.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Puja al menos la mitad de tu mano redondeada hacia arriba y por encima de la puja actual, pasa a esta subasta o llama a Amerikaner para probar todos los trucos solo.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Su palo principal se convierte en triunfo. Solicite una carta en juego de ese palo que no tiene; su poseedor debe jugarlo primero.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"No queda ninguna carta igual en las manos de los oponentes. Liderar sin pareja; sólo se puntuará su propia oferta.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"El juego comenzó. El jugador a la izquierda del crupier puja primero.","{player} passed.":"{player} pasó.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} oferta {count} trucos.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} llamado Amerikaner: cada baza sola, sin triunfo.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Todos pasaron. La mano se volvió a repartir y el crupier se movió hacia la izquierda.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} tenía la tarjeta solicitada y es su socio.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ganó el truco.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Ronda completa. {player} tomó trucos {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"¡{player} ganó el juego con puntos {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"El juego terminó en empate entre {players} a puntos {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Oferta realizada: cada compañero de equipo gana {count} puntos.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Oferta fallida: cada compañero de equipo pierde puntos {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Americano exitoso: puntos 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Americano fallido: −52 puntos.","Game saved on this device.":"Juego guardado en este dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"Se reanudó la partida guardada.","Saved game deleted.":"Juego guardado eliminado.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"El guardado local no está disponible; este juego permanecerá abierto hasta que abandones la página.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"No se pudo leer el juego guardado. Comienza un nuevo juego o elimina el guardado dañado.","There is no saved game on this device.":"No hay ninguna partida guardada en este dispositivo.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Una baraja de cartas estándar 52, sin comodines. Reparta equitativamente para los jugadores 3–6 reservando suficientes doses. Una oferta normal comienza con la mitad de la mano redondeada hacia arriba y debe superar la oferta anterior. Llame a Amerikaner para que haga todos los trucos solo. En una oferta normal, salga para establecer triunfo y solicite una carta de socio. Haga lo mismo cuando pueda. Cada equipo gana o pierde la oferta; otros jugadores aumentan su número de trucos. La puntuación más alta gana una vez que la puntuación alcanza 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Reglas noruegas comprobadas 16 Octubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Americano"},"fa":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"بازی با ورق آمریکایی","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"بازی آنلاین با ورق آمریکایی - پیشنهاد، یافتن شریک و ترفندهای برنده","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"بازی کارت نروژی Amerikaner را به صورت محلی با سه تا شش بازیکن انجام دهید. برای ترفندها پیشنهاد دهید، ترامپ را انتخاب کنید، شریک زندگی خود را پیدا کنید و امتیاز را در این دستگاه حفظ کنید.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"بازی حقه‌بازی Amerikaner نروژی را بیاموزید: پیشنهاد دهید که شما و یک شریک ناشناخته چند ترفند می‌توانید انجام دهید، سرنخ خود را به عنوان ترامپ تنظیم کنید و کارتی را درخواست کنید که شریک زندگی شما را نشان دهد.","A quick example":"یک مثال سریع","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"با چهار بازیکن، یک پیشنهاد 8 برنده می شود اگر شما و شریکی که توسط کارت درخواستی شما فاش شده است حداقل ترفندهای 8 را با هم انجام دهید. سپس هر هم تیمی 8 امتیاز کسب می کند. هر بازیکن دیگری تعداد ترفندهای خود را بدست می آورد.","How to play":"نحوه بازی","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"این نسخه محلی از قوانین نروژی Amerikaner پیروی می کند که در برابر Norske kortspill بررسی شده است. از سه تا شش بازیکن با عرشه استاندارد و بدون جوکر پشتیبانی می کند. برای انجام یکنواخت، یک، دو یا چهار دوتایی برای سه، پنج یا شش بازیکن در نظر گرفته شده است. چهار بازیکن از تمام کارت های 52 استفاده می کنند. بازیکن سمت چپ فروشنده ابتدا پیشنهاد می دهد. یک پیشنهاد معمولی باید حداقل نصف دست شما گرد و بالاتر از پیشنهاد فعلی باشد. همچنین می‌توانید از آمریکانر عبور کنید یا با آن تماس بگیرید تا هر ترفندی را به تنهایی بدون شریک یا ترامپ امتحان کنید. اگر در یک پیشنهاد معمولی برنده شدید، اولین کارت را هدایت کنید تا ترامپ را تنظیم کند و یک کارت در بازی در آن لباسی که در دست شما نیست درخواست کنید. دارنده آن باید در اولین ترفند آن را بازی کند و شریک شما شود. اگر کارت تطبیقی ​​در دستان حریف با برتری بعدی باقی نماند، بدون شریک ادامه دهید. فقط اظهار کننده به عنوان پیشنهاد دهنده امتیازدهی می شود. بازیکنان باید در صورت امکان از لباس led پیروی کنند. بالاترین ترامپ برنده یک ترفند یا بالاترین کارت در لباس led اگر ترامپ نباشد. اعلان کننده و شریک هر کدام زمانی که پیشنهاد را انجام می دهند، پیشنهاد را به دست می آورند، یا زمانی که پیشنهاد را از دست می دهند، آن را از دست می دهند. سایر بازیکنان برای هر ترفندی که انجام می دهند یک امتیاز کسب می کنند. یک Americaner موفق 52 امتیاز کسب می کند و یک آمریکایی شکست خورده 52 را از دست می دهد. پس از یک دور، فروشنده به سمت چپ حرکت می کند. هنگامی که یک امتیاز به 52 رسید، بالاترین امتیاز برنده می شود. مخالفان رایانه محلی انتخاب های اکتشافی ساده ای انجام می دهند. بازی چند نفره آنلاین وجود ندارد.","How many players can play?":"چند بازیکن می توانند بازی کنند؟","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"سه، چهار، پنج یا شش صندلی را انتخاب کنید. بازیکن یک شما هستید. صندلی های دیگر مخالفان کامپیوتر محلی هستند.","How is the deck dealt?":"دک چگونه است؟","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"از کارتهای 52 بدون جوکر استفاده کنید. یکی دو به ازای سه بازیکن، هیچ کدام برای چهار، دو تا برای پنج، و هر چهار دو تا برای شش بازیکن کنار بگذارید تا هر دست تعداد کارت های یکسانی داشته باشد.","How do I find my partner?":"چگونه شریک زندگی خود را پیدا کنم؟","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"بعد از یک پیشنهاد عادی، یک کارت را برای تنظیم ترامپ هدایت کنید و یک کارت از آن لباس را که در دست شما نیست درخواست کنید. هر کسی که آن را دارد باید در اولین ترفند آن را بازی کند و شریک شما شود.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Americaner یعنی چه؟","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"این فراخوان برتر است: سعی کنید هر ترفندی را به تنهایی برنده شوید، بدون شریک و بدون ترامپ. یک تماس موفق ارزش 52 امتیاز دارد. قیمت ناموفق 52 است.","How is a normal bid scored?":"یک پیشنهاد عادی چگونه امتیاز می گیرد؟","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"اعلام‌کننده و شریک هر کدام در صورتی که ترفندهای ترکیبی‌شان برآورده شود، پیشنهاد را به دست می‌آورند، یا اگر کوتاهی کنند، پیشنهاد را از دست می‌دهند. بقیه در هر ترفند یک امتیاز کسب می کنند.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"آیا این بازی کارت ها یا امتیازهای من را آپلود می کند؟","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"شماره. وضعیت بازی و بازی ذخیره شده اختیاری در این مرورگر در این دستگاه باقی می مانند.","Rules and limitations":"قوانین و محدودیت ها","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"این یک نسخه تمرین دیجیتال از یک مجموعه قوانین نروژی است، نه ادعایی مبنی بر اینکه همه قوانین خانه پوشش داده شده است. مخالفان رایانه محلی از روش های اکتشافی ساده استفاده می کنند، نه از استراتژی متخصص. هیچ داده بازی چند نفره آنلاین، حساب کاربری یا آپلود شده ای وجود ندارد. اگر امتیازات در پایان مساوی شود، این ابزار به جای انتخاب خودسرانه یکی، بالاترین بازیکنان را گزارش می‌کند.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"بازی رایگان. کارت‌ها، امتیازات و ذخیره اختیاری در این دستگاه. چیزی آپلود نمی شود","Play Amerikaner":"بازی Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"رایگان · در مرورگر شما اجرا می شود","Total players":"کل بازیکن","New game":"بازی جدید","Resume saved game":"بازی ذخیره شده را از سر بگیرید","Delete saved game":"حذف بازی ذخیره شده","Export scores":"نمرات صادرات","Spades":"بیل","Hearts":"قلب","Diamonds":"الماس","Clubs":"باشگاه ها","Jack":"جک","Queen":"ملکه","King":"پادشاه","Ace":"آس","Choose your bid":"پیشنهاد خود را انتخاب کنید","Lead a card":"کارت را هدایت کنید","Play a card":"کارت بازی کن","No trump":"بدون ترامپ","Not revealed":"فاش نشده است","No card has been played yet.":"هنوز هیچ کارتی بازی نشده است.","You passed.":"گذشتی","Your lead is on the table.":"پیشتاز شما روی میز است.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} رهبری کرد و یک کارت شریک درخواست کرد.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} بازی {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"یک بازی را شروع کنید یا بازی ذخیره شده در این دستگاه را از سر بگیرید.","Player":"بازیکن","You":"شما","Computer {number}":"کامپیوتر {number}","Score":"امتیاز","Tricks":"ترفندها","Round":"گرد","Current bid":"پیشنهاد فعلی","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} در حال انتخاب یک پیشنهاد است.","Turn":"بپیچید","Dealer":"فروشنده","Trump":"ترامپ","Partner":"شریک","Bid":"مناقصه","Number of tricks":"تعداد ترفندها","Place bid":"پیشنهاد مکان","Pass":"پاس","Call Amerikaner":"با امریکانر تماس بگیرید","Minimum":"حداقل","Maximum":"حداکثر","Set trump and request your partner":"ترامپ را تنظیم کرده و از شریک زندگی خود درخواست کنید","Choose your lead card":"کارت سرب خود را انتخاب کنید","Request a card in this suit":"درخواست کارت در این لباس","Lead and request this card":"این کارت را هدایت و درخواست کنید","Play selected card":"بازی کارت انتخابی","Choose a card to play":"یک کارت را برای بازی انتخاب کنید","Current trick":"ترفند فعلی","Your hand":"دست تو","Cards in hand":"کارت در دست","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"تا جایی که می توانید لباس LED را دنبال کنید. کارت شریک درخواستی باید در اولین ترفند بازی شود.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"حداقل نصف دست خود را گرد و بالاتر از پیشنهاد فعلی پیشنهاد دهید، در این حراج بگذرید، یا با Amerikaner تماس بگیرید تا هر ترفندی را به تنهایی امتحان کنید.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"لباس سربی شما برنده می شود. درخواست یک کارت در بازی با آن لباس که در دست ندارید. دارنده آن باید ابتدا آن را بازی کند.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"هیچ کارت مشابهی در دست حریف باقی نمی ماند. رهبری بدون شریک؛ فقط پیشنهاد شما امتیاز خواهد گرفت.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"بازی شروع شد بازیکن سمت چپ فروشنده ابتدا پیشنهاد می دهد.","{player} passed.":"{player} گذشت.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"ترفندهای {player} پیشنهاد {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} به نام Amerikaner: هر حقه به تنهایی، بدون ترامپ.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"همه گذشتند. دست دوباره معامله شد و فروشنده به سمت چپ حرکت کرد.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} کارت درخواستی را نگه داشته و شریک شماست.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} این ترفند را برد.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"گرد کامل {player} ترفندهای {count} را انجام داد.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} بازی را با امتیاز {count} برد!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"بازی با تساوی بین {players} در امتیاز {count} به پایان رسید.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"پیشنهاد ارائه شده: هر هم تیمی {count} امتیاز کسب می کند.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"پیشنهاد از دست رفته: هر هم تیمی {count} امتیاز از دست می دهد.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Amerikaner موفق: امتیاز 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerikaner ناموفق: −52 امتیاز.","Game saved on this device.":"بازی در این دستگاه ذخیره شده است.","Saved game resumed.":"بازی ذخیره شده از سر گرفته شد.","Saved game deleted.":"بازی ذخیره شده حذف شد.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"ذخیره محلی در دسترس نیست. این بازی تا زمانی که صفحه را ترک نکنید باز خواهد ماند.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"بازی ذخیره شده قابل خواندن نیست. یک بازی جدید شروع کنید یا ذخیره آسیب دیده را حذف کنید.","There is no saved game on this device.":"هیچ بازی ذخیره شده ای در این دستگاه وجود ندارد.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"یک کارت استاندارد 52، بدون جوکر. با کنار گذاشتن دو تا به اندازه کافی با بازیکنان 3–6 به طور مساوی معامله کنید. یک پیشنهاد معمولی از نیمی از دست به بالا شروع می شود و باید بالاتر از پیشنهاد قبلی باشد. با Amerikaner تماس بگیرید تا تمام ترفندها را به تنهایی انجام دهد. در یک پیشنهاد معمولی، منجر به تنظیم ترامپ و درخواست کارت شریک شوید. در صورت امکان از همین روش پیروی کنید. هر تیمی پیشنهاد را می برد یا می بازد. سایر بازیکنان تعداد ترفندهای خود را به دست می آورند. بالاترین امتیاز زمانی برنده می شود که یک امتیاز به 52 برسد.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"قوانین نروژی بررسی شد 16 اکتبر 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"fr":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Jeu de cartes Americaner","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Jeu de cartes Americaner en ligne — Enchérissez, trouvez un partenaire et gagnez des tours","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Jouez localement au jeu de cartes Norwegian Amerikaner avec trois à six joueurs. Enchérissez pour des tours, choisissez Trump, trouvez votre partenaire et conservez le score sur cet appareil.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Apprenez le jeu de levées norvégien Amerikaner : enchérissez sur le nombre de levées que vous et un partenaire inconnu pouvez réaliser, placez l'atout avec votre avance et demandez la carte qui révèle votre partenaire.","A quick example":"Un exemple rapide","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"À quatre joueurs, une enchère de 8 est gagnante si vous et le partenaire révélé par la carte demandée effectuez au moins des tours de 8 ensemble. Chaque coéquipier gagne alors des points 8 ; chaque autre joueur gagne son propre nombre de tours.","How to play":"Comment jouer","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Cette version locale suit les règles norvégiennes Amerikaner vérifiées par rapport à Norske kortspill. Il prend en charge trois à six joueurs avec un deck standard et sans jokers. Pour distribuer équitablement, un, deux ou quatre deux sont réservés pour trois, cinq ou six joueurs ; quatre joueurs utilisent toutes les cartes 52. Le joueur à gauche du croupier enchérit en premier. Une enchère régulière doit être au moins la moitié de votre main arrondie et supérieure à l'enchère actuelle ; vous pouvez également passer ou appeler Amerikaner pour essayer chaque tour seul, sans partenaire ni atout. Si vous remportez une enchère normale, dirigez la première carte vers l'atout et demandez une carte en jeu dans cette couleur qui n'est pas dans votre main. Son détenteur doit le jouer dès le premier pli et devient votre partenaire. Si aucune carte correspondante ne reste dans les mains des adversaires lors d’une avance ultérieure, continuez sans partenaire ; seul le déclarant est considéré comme l'enchérisseur. Les joueurs doivent suivre le mouvement mené lorsque cela est possible. L'atout le plus élevé remporte un pli, ou la carte la plus haute de la couleur menée s'il n'y a pas d'atout. Le déclarant et le partenaire remportent chacun l'enchère lorsqu'ils la font, ou chacun la perdent lorsqu'ils la ratent ; les autres joueurs gagnent un point pour chaque pli qu'ils réalisent. Un Amerikaner qui réussit gagne des points 52 et un échec perd 52. Après un tour, le croupier se déplace vers la gauche. Une fois qu'un score atteint 52, le score le plus élevé l'emporte. Les adversaires informatiques locaux font des choix heuristiques simples ; il n'y a pas de multijoueur en ligne.","How many players can play?":"Combien de joueurs peuvent jouer ?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Choisissez trois, quatre, cinq ou six sièges. Le premier joueur, c'est vous ; les autres sièges sont des opposants informatiques locaux.","How is the deck dealt?":"Comment le jeu est-il distribué ?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Utilisez des cartes 52 sans jokers. Mettez de côté un deux pour trois joueurs, aucun pour quatre, deux pour cinq et les quatre deux pour six afin que chaque main ait le même nombre de cartes.","How do I find my partner?":"Comment trouver mon partenaire ?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Après une enchère normale, dirigez une carte vers l'atout et demandez une carte de cette couleur qui n'est pas dans votre main. Celui qui le détient doit le jouer dès le premier pli et devient votre partenaire.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Que signifie Amerikaner ?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"C'est la décision la plus importante : essayez de gagner chaque pli seul, sans partenaire ni atout. Un appel réussi vaut des points 52 ; un échec coûte 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Comment une offre normale est-elle évaluée ?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Le déclarant et son partenaire remportent chacun l'enchère si leurs levées combinées la satisfont, ou perdent chacun l'enchère s'ils échouent. Tous les autres gagnent un point par tour.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Ce jeu télécharge-t-il mes cartes ou mes scores ?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Non. L'état du jeu et la partie sauvegardée facultative restent dans ce navigateur sur cet appareil.","Rules and limitations":"Règles et limitations","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Il s'agit d'une version pratique numérique d'un ensemble de règles norvégiennes, et non d'une affirmation selon laquelle toutes les règles internes sont couvertes. Les adversaires informatiques locaux utilisent des heuristiques simples et non une stratégie experte. Il n'y a pas de multijoueur en ligne, de compte ou de données de jeu téléchargées. En cas d'égalité à la fin, l'outil signale les joueurs les plus à égalité au lieu d'en choisir un arbitrairement.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Jeu gratuit. Les cartes, les scores et la sauvegarde facultative restent sur cet appareil ; rien n'est téléchargé.","Play Amerikaner":"Jouer à Americaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUIT · FONCTIONNE DANS VOTRE NAVIGATEUR","Total players":"Joueurs totaux","New game":"Nouveau jeu","Resume saved game":"Reprendre la partie sauvegardée","Delete saved game":"Supprimer la partie sauvegardée","Export scores":"Exporter les scores","Spades":"Pique","Hearts":"Cœurs","Diamonds":"Diamants","Clubs":"Clubs","Jack":"Prise","Queen":"Reine","King":"Très grand lit","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Choisissez votre enchère","Lead a card":"Diriger une carte","Play a card":"Jouer une carte","No trump":"Pas d'atout","Not revealed":"Non révélé","No card has been played yet.":"Aucune carte n'a encore été jouée.","You passed.":"Vous avez réussi.","Your lead is on the table.":"Votre avance est sur la table.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} a dirigé et demandé une carte partenaire.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} a joué {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Démarrez une partie ou reprenez celle enregistrée sur cet appareil.","Player":"Joueur","You":"Toi","Computer {number}":"Ordinateur {number}","Score":"Score","Tricks":"Astuces","Round":"Rond","Current bid":"Enchère actuelle","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} choisit une offre.","Turn":"Tourner","Dealer":"Revendeur","Trump":"Atout","Partner":"Partenaire","Bid":"Offre","Number of tricks":"Nombre de tours","Place bid":"Placer une enchère","Pass":"Réussi","Call Amerikaner":"Appeler Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maximum","Set trump and request your partner":"Définissez l'atout et demandez à votre partenaire","Choose your lead card":"Choisissez votre carte principale","Request a card in this suit":"Demander une carte dans cette couleur","Lead and request this card":"Diriger et demander cette carte","Play selected card":"Jouer la carte sélectionnée","Choose a card to play":"Choisissez une carte à jouer","Current trick":"Astuce actuelle","Your hand":"Votre main","Cards in hand":"Cartes en main","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Suivez la combinaison LED lorsque vous le pouvez. La carte partenaire demandée doit être jouée lors du premier pli.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Enchérissez au moins la moitié de votre main arrondie et supérieure à l'enchère actuelle, participez à cette enchère ou appelez Amerikaner pour essayer chaque tour seul.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Votre costume principal devient un atout. Demandez une carte en jeu dans cette couleur que vous ne détenez pas ; son détenteur doit le jouer en premier.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Aucune carte correspondante ne reste dans les mains des adversaires. Diriger sans partenaire ; seule votre propre offre sera notée.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Le jeu a commencé. Le joueur à gauche du croupier enchérit en premier.","{player} passed.":"{player} a réussi.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} offre des astuces {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} appelé Amerikaner : chaque tour seul, sans atout.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Tout le monde est passé. La main a été redistribuée et le croupier s'est déplacé vers la gauche.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} détenait la carte demandée et est votre partenaire.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} a remporté le pli.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Tour terminé. {player} a pris des astuces {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} a gagné la partie avec des points {count} !","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Le jeu s'est terminé par une égalité entre {players} à {count} points.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Enchère faite : chaque coéquipier gagne des points {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Enchère manquée : chaque coéquipier perd des points {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Amerikaner réussi : points 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerikaner en échec : −52 points.","Game saved on this device.":"Jeu enregistré sur cet appareil.","Saved game resumed.":"La partie sauvegardée a repris.","Saved game deleted.":"Partie sauvegardée supprimée.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"L'enregistrement local n'est pas disponible ; ce jeu restera ouvert jusqu'à ce que vous quittiez la page.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"La partie enregistrée n'a pas pu être lue. Démarrez une nouvelle partie ou supprimez la sauvegarde endommagée.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Il n'y a aucune partie sauvegardée sur cet appareil.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Un jeu de cartes 52 standard, sans joker. Répartissez équitablement les joueurs 3 – 6 en mettant de côté suffisamment de deux. Une enchère normale commence à la moitié de la main arrondie et doit être supérieure à l'enchère précédente. Appelez Amerikaner pour prendre toutes les astuces seul. Sur une enchère régulière, menez à mettre l'atout et demandez une carte de partenaire. Faites de même lorsque vous le pouvez. L'équipe gagne ou perd chacune l'enchère ; les autres joueurs gagnent leur nombre de plis. Le score le plus élevé gagne une fois qu'un score atteint 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Règles norvégiennes vérifiées 16 octobre 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"gu":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"અમેરિકન પત્તાની રમત","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"અમેરિકન કાર્ડ ગેમ ઓનલાઇન — બિડ કરો, પાર્ટનર શોધો અને યુક્તિઓ જીતો","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"ત્રણથી છ ખેલાડીઓ સાથે સ્થાનિક રીતે નોર્વેજીયન અમેરિકનર કાર્ડ ગેમ રમો. યુક્તિઓ માટે બિડ કરો, ટ્રમ્પ પસંદ કરો, તમારા જીવનસાથીને શોધો અને આ ઉપકરણ પર સ્કોર રાખો.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"નોર્વેજીયન અમેરિકનર ટ્રીક-ટેકિંગ ગેમ શીખો: તમે અને અજાણ્યા ભાગીદાર કેટલી યુક્તિઓ લઈ શકો છો, તમારી આગેવાની સાથે ટ્રમ્પ સેટ કરો અને તમારા પાર્ટનરને જાહેર કરતા કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો.","A quick example":"એક ઝડપી ઉદાહરણ","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"ચાર ખેલાડીઓ સાથે, જો તમે અને તમારા વિનંતી કરેલ કાર્ડ દ્વારા જાહેર કરાયેલ ભાગીદાર ઓછામાં ઓછી 8 યુક્તિઓ સાથે લે તો 8 ની બિડ જીતે છે. દરેક ટીમ સાથી પછી 8 પોઈન્ટ કમાય છે; દરેક અન્ય ખેલાડી તેમની પોતાની યુક્તિ ગણતરી કમાય છે.","How to play":"કેવી રીતે રમવું","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"આ સ્થાનિક સંસ્કરણ નોર્વેજિયન અમેરિકેનરના નિયમોને અનુસરે છે જે નોર્સ્કે કોર્ટસ્પિલ સામે તપાસવામાં આવે છે. તે સ્ટાન્ડર્ડ ડેક અને જોકર્સ વિના ત્રણથી છ ખેલાડીઓને સપોર્ટ કરે છે. સમાન રીતે વ્યવહાર કરવા માટે, ત્રણ, પાંચ અથવા છ ખેલાડીઓ માટે એક, બે અથવા ચાર બે અલગ રાખવામાં આવે છે; ચાર ખેલાડીઓ બધા 52 કાર્ડનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. ડીલરના બાકીના ખેલાડીએ પહેલા બોલી લગાવી. નિયમિત બિડ ઓછામાં ઓછી અડધી તમારા હાથની ગોળાકાર અને વર્તમાન બિડ કરતા વધારે હોવી જોઈએ; તમે પાર્ટનર અથવા ટ્રમ્પ વિના એકલા દરેક યુક્તિ અજમાવવા માટે અમેરિકાનેરને પાસ કરી શકો છો અથવા કૉલ કરી શકો છો. જો તમે નિયમિત બિડ જીતો છો, તો ટ્રમ્પને સેટ કરવા માટે પ્રથમ કાર્ડની આગેવાની કરો અને તે સૂટમાં ઇન-પ્લે કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો જે તમારા હાથમાં નથી. તેના ધારકએ તેને પ્રથમ યુક્તિમાં રમવું જોઈએ અને તે તમારો ભાગીદાર બને છે. જો પછીની લીડ પર વિરોધીઓના હાથમાં કોઈ મેળ ખાતું કાર્ડ રહેતું નથી, તો ભાગીદાર વિના ચાલુ રાખો; માત્ર ઘોષણા કરનારને બિડર તરીકે સ્કોર કરવામાં આવે છે. જ્યારે શક્ય હોય ત્યારે ખેલાડીઓએ આગેવાની હેઠળના સૂટને અનુસરવું આવશ્યક છે. સર્વોચ્ચ ટ્રમ્પ યુક્તિ જીતે છે, અથવા જો ટ્રમ્પ ન હોય તો લીડ સૂટમાં સૌથી વધુ કાર્ડ જીતે છે. ઘોષણાકર્તા અને ભાગીદાર દરેક જ્યારે બિડ કરે છે ત્યારે તે મેળવે છે, અથવા જ્યારે તેઓ ચૂકી જાય છે ત્યારે દરેક બિડ ગુમાવે છે; અન્ય ખેલાડીઓ દરેક યુક્તિ માટે એક પોઈન્ટ મેળવે છે. એક સફળ અમેરિકન 52 પોઈન્ટ કમાય છે અને નિષ્ફળ વ્યક્તિ 52 ગુમાવે છે. એક રાઉન્ડ પછી, વેપારી ડાબે ખસે છે. એકવાર સ્કોર 52 પર પહોંચી જાય, સૌથી વધુ સ્કોર જીતે છે. સ્થાનિક કોમ્પ્યુટર વિરોધીઓ સરળ સંશોધનાત્મક પસંદગીઓ કરે છે; ત્યાં કોઈ ઑનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર નથી.","How many players can play?":"કેટલા ખેલાડીઓ રમી શકે છે?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"ત્રણ, ચાર, પાંચ કે છ બેઠકો પસંદ કરો. ખેલાડી એક તમે છો; અન્ય બેઠકો સ્થાનિક કમ્પ્યુટર વિરોધીઓ છે.","How is the deck dealt?":"ડેક કેવી રીતે વ્યવહાર કરવામાં આવે છે?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"જોકર વગર 52 કાર્ડનો ઉપયોગ કરો. ત્રણ ખેલાડીઓ માટે એક બે, ચાર માટે કોઈ નહીં, પાંચ માટે બે અને છ માટે ચારેય બેને અલગ રાખો જેથી દરેક હાથમાં સમાન સંખ્યામાં કાર્ડ હોય.","How do I find my partner?":"હું મારા જીવનસાથીને કેવી રીતે શોધી શકું?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"સામાન્ય બિડ પછી, ટ્રમ્પને સેટ કરવા માટે એક કાર્ડ દોરો અને તે સૂટના કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો જે તમારા હાથમાં નથી. જેણે તેને પકડી રાખ્યું છે તેણે તેને પ્રથમ યુક્તિમાં રમવું જોઈએ અને તમારો ભાગીદાર બને છે.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner નો અર્થ શું છે?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"તે સર્વોચ્ચ કૉલ છે: દરેક યુક્તિ એકલા જીતવાનો પ્રયાસ કરો, કોઈ ભાગીદાર અને કોઈ ટ્રમ્પ વિના. એક સફળ કૉલ 52 પોઈન્ટ્સનો છે; નિષ્ફળ એકની કિંમત 52 છે.","How is a normal bid scored?":"સામાન્ય બિડ કેવી રીતે સ્કોર કરવામાં આવે છે?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"ઘોષણાકર્તા અને ભાગીદાર દરેક બિડ મેળવે છે જો તેમની સંયુક્ત યુક્તિઓ તેને પૂરી કરે છે, અથવા જો તેઓ ઓછી પડે તો દરેક બિડ ગુમાવે છે. બાકીના દરેકને યુક્તિ દીઠ એક પોઈન્ટ મળે છે.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"શું આ રમત મારા કાર્ડ્સ અથવા સ્કોર્સ અપલોડ કરે છે?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"નંબર. ગેમ સ્ટેટ અને વૈકલ્પિક સાચવેલ ગેમ આ ઉપકરણ પર આ બ્રાઉઝરમાં રહે છે.","Rules and limitations":"નિયમો અને મર્યાદાઓ","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"આ એક નોર્વેજીયન નિયમ સેટનું ડિજિટલ પ્રેક્ટિસ વર્ઝન છે, એવો દાવો નથી કે દરેક ગૃહ નિયમ આવરી લેવામાં આવે છે. સ્થાનિક કોમ્પ્યુટર વિરોધીઓ નિષ્ણાત વ્યૂહરચના નહીં, પરંતુ સરળ હ્યુરિસ્ટિક્સનો ઉપયોગ કરે છે. ત્યાં કોઈ ઑનલાઇન મલ્ટિપ્લેયર, એકાઉન્ટ અથવા અપલોડ કરેલ ગેમ ડેટા નથી. જો સ્કોર્સ પૂર્ણાહુતિ પર ટાઈ જાય છે, તો ટૂલ મનસ્વી રીતે પસંદ કરવાને બદલે ટાઈ સર્વોચ્ચ ખેલાડીઓની જાણ કરે છે.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"રમવા માટે મફત. કાર્ડ્સ, સ્કોર્સ અને વૈકલ્પિક બચત આ ઉપકરણ પર રહે છે; કંઈપણ અપલોડ નથી.","Play Amerikaner":"અમેરિકાનેર રમો","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"મફત · તમારા બ્રાઉઝરમાં ચાલે છે","Total players":"કુલ ખેલાડીઓ","New game":"નવી રમત","Resume saved game":"સેવ કરેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ કરો","Delete saved game":"સેવ કરેલી રમત કાઢી નાખો","Export scores":"નિકાસ સ્કોર્સ","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"હાર્ટ્સ","Diamonds":"હીરા","Clubs":"ક્લબ્સ","Jack":"જેક","Queen":"ક્વીન","King":"કિંગ","Ace":"એસ","Choose your bid":"તમારી બિડ પસંદ કરો","Lead a card":"કાર્ડનું નેતૃત્વ કરો","Play a card":"કાર્ડ રમો","No trump":"ના ટ્રમ્પ","Not revealed":"જાહેર નથી","No card has been played yet.":"હજુ સુધી કોઈ કાર્ડ રમાયું નથી.","You passed.":"તમે પાસ થયા.","Your lead is on the table.":"તમારી લીડ ટેબલ પર છે.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} એ પાર્ટનર કાર્ડની આગેવાની કરી અને વિનંતી કરી.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} રમ્યું.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"રમત શરૂ કરો અથવા આ ઉપકરણ પર સાચવેલ રમતને ફરી શરૂ કરો.","Player":"પ્લેયર","You":"તમે","Computer {number}":"કમ્પ્યુટર {number}","Score":"સ્કોર","Tricks":"યુક્તિઓ","Round":"રાઉન્ડ","Current bid":"વર્તમાન બિડ","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} બિડ પસંદ કરી રહ્યું છે.","Turn":"વળો","Dealer":"વેપારી","Trump":"ટ્રમ્પ","Partner":"જીવનસાથી","Bid":"બોલી","Number of tricks":"યુક્તિઓની સંખ્યા","Place bid":"બિડ મૂકો","Pass":"પાસ","Call Amerikaner":"અમેરિકનેરને કૉલ કરો","Minimum":"ન્યૂનતમ","Maximum":"મહત્તમ","Set trump and request your partner":"ટ્રમ્પ સેટ કરો અને તમારા પાર્ટનરને વિનંતી કરો","Choose your lead card":"તમારું લીડ કાર્ડ પસંદ કરો","Request a card in this suit":"આ સૂટમાં કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો","Lead and request this card":"આ કાર્ડની આગેવાની કરો અને વિનંતી કરો","Play selected card":"પસંદ કરેલ કાર્ડ રમો","Choose a card to play":"રમવા માટે કાર્ડ પસંદ કરો","Current trick":"વર્તમાન યુક્તિ","Your hand":"તમારો હાથ","Cards in hand":"હાથમાં કાર્ડ્સ","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"જ્યારે તમે કરી શકો ત્યારે લેડ સૂટને અનુસરો. વિનંતી કરેલ ભાગીદાર કાર્ડ પ્રથમ યુક્તિમાં રમવું આવશ્યક છે.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"ઓછામાં ઓછા અડધા તમારા હાથને ગોળાકાર અને વર્તમાન બિડ કરતા વધારે બિડ કરો, આ હરાજી માટે પાસ કરો, અથવા દરેક યુક્તિ એકલા અજમાવવા માટે અમેરિકનરને કૉલ કરો.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"તમારો લીડ સૂટ ટ્રમ્પ બને છે. તે પોશાકમાં ઇન-પ્લે કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો જે તમારી પાસે ન હોય; તેના ધારકે તેને પહેલા વગાડવું જોઈએ.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"વિરોધીઓના હાથમાં કોઈ મેળ ખાતું કાર્ડ રહેતું નથી. જીવનસાથી વિના લીડ; ફક્ત તમારી પોતાની બિડ ફટકારવામાં આવશે.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"રમત શરૂ થઈ. ડીલરના બાકીના ખેલાડીએ પહેલા બોલી લગાવી.","{player} passed.":"{player} પાસ.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} બિડ {count} યુક્તિઓ.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} અમેરિકાનેર કહેવાય છે: દરેક યુક્તિ એકલી, કોઈ ટ્રમ્પ નહીં.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"બધા પાસ થયા. હાથ ફરીથી ડીલ કરવામાં આવ્યો અને વેપારી ડાબી બાજુએ ગયો.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} વિનંતી કરેલ કાર્ડ ધરાવે છે અને તે તમારો ભાગીદાર છે.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} યુક્તિ જીતી.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"રાઉન્ડ પૂર્ણ. {player}એ {count} યુક્તિઓ લીધી.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} એ {count} પોઈન્ટ સાથે ગેમ જીતી લીધી!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"રમત {players} વચ્ચે {count} પોઈન્ટ પર ટાઈમાં સમાપ્ત થઈ.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"બિડ કરવામાં આવી: દરેક ટીમના સાથી {count} પોઈન્ટ મેળવે છે.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"બિડ ચૂકી ગઈ: દરેક ટીમ સાથી {count} પોઈન્ટ ગુમાવે છે.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"સફળ અમેરિકન: 52 પોઈન્ટ.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"નિષ્ફળ અમેરિકન: −52 પોઈન્ટ.","Game saved on this device.":"ગેમ આ ઉપકરણ પર સાચવવામાં આવી છે.","Saved game resumed.":"સાચવેલી રમત ફરી શરૂ થઈ.","Saved game deleted.":"સાચવેલી રમત કાઢી નાખી.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"સ્થાનિક બચત અનુપલબ્ધ છે; જ્યાં સુધી તમે પૃષ્ઠ છોડશો નહીં ત્યાં સુધી આ રમત ખુલ્લી રહેશે.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"સાચવેલી રમત વાંચી શકાતી નથી. નવી રમત શરૂ કરો અથવા ક્ષતિગ્રસ્ત સેવ કાઢી નાખો.","There is no saved game on this device.":"આ ઉપકરણ પર કોઈ સાચવેલ રમત નથી.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"એક પ્રમાણભૂત 52-કાર્ડ ડેક, કોઈ જોકર નથી. 3–6 ખેલાડીઓ માટે પર્યાપ્ત બેને અલગ રાખીને સમાનરૂપે ડીલ કરો. નિયમિત બિડ અડધા હાથથી શરૂ થાય છે અને અગાઉની બિડમાં ટોચ પર હોવી જોઈએ. તમામ યુક્તિઓ એકલા લેવા માટે અમેરિકનરને કૉલ કરો. નિયમિત બિડ પર, ટ્રમ્પને સેટ કરવા તરફ દોરી જાઓ અને ભાગીદાર કાર્ડની વિનંતી કરો. જ્યારે સક્ષમ હોય ત્યારે તેને અનુસરો. દરેક ટીમ બિડ મેળવે છે અથવા ગુમાવે છે; અન્ય ખેલાડીઓ તેમની યુક્તિ ગણતરીઓ મેળવે છે. એકવાર સ્કોર 52 સુધી પહોંચે ત્યારે સૌથી વધુ સ્કોર જીતે છે.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"નોર્વેજીયન નિયમો 16 ઓક્ટોબર 2026 ચકાસાયેલ","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"નોર્સ્કે કોર્ટસ્પિલ · અમેરિકાનેર"},"ha":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Wasan Katin Amerikaner","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Wasan Katin Amerikaner akan layi - Bidi, Nemo Abokin Hulɗa da Lashe Dabaru","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Kunna wasan katin Amurkaner na Norway a cikin gida tare da 'yan wasa uku zuwa shida. Yi neman dabaru, zaɓi trump, nemo abokin tarayya kuma ci gaba da maki akan wannan na'urar.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Koyi wasan yaudarar Amurkaner na Norwegian: ba da dabaru nawa da ku da abokin tarayya wanda ba a sani ba za ku iya ɗauka, saita trump tare da gubar ku, kuma nemi katin da zai bayyana abokin tarayya.","A quick example":"Misali mai sauri","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Tare da 'yan wasa hudu, tayin 8 yayi nasara idan ku da abokin tarayya da aka bayyana ta katin da kuka nema ku ɗauki aƙalla dabarun 8 tare. Kowane abokin aiki sai ya sami maki 8; kowanne dan wasa yana samun nasu dabara count.","How to play":"Yadda ake wasa","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Wannan sigar gida tana bin ka'idodin Amurkan na Norway da aka bincika akan Norske kortspill. Yana goyan bayan 'yan wasa uku zuwa shida tare da madaidaicin bene kuma babu masu barkwanci. Don yin mu'amala daidai, ana keɓe ɗaya, biyu ko huɗu biyu don 'yan wasa uku, biyar ko shida; 'yan wasa hudu suna amfani da duk katunan 52. Mai kunnawa ya bar dila yayi tayin farko. Tilas ne ya zama aƙalla rabin hannunka a tattara sama kuma sama da abin da ake nema na yanzu; Hakanan kuna iya wucewa ko kiran Amurkaner don gwada kowace dabara ita kaɗai ba tare da abokin tarayya ko trump ba. Idan kun ci nasara akai-akai, jagoranci katin farko don saita trump kuma nemi katin wasan-ciki a waccan kwat ɗin da ba a hannunku ba. Dole ne mai riƙe shi ya kunna ta a farkon dabara kuma ya zama abokin tarayya. Idan babu katin da ya rage a hannun abokan adawar akan jagorar gaba, ci gaba ba tare da abokin tarayya ba; kawai mai sanarwa ne aka samu maki a matsayin mai bayarwa. Dole ne 'yan wasa su bi tsarin da aka jagoranta idan zai yiwu. Babban trump yana samun dabara, ko mafi girman kati a cikin kwat da wando idan babu trump. Mai ba da sanarwar da abokin tarayya kowanne yana samun kuɗin lokacin da suka yi, ko kuma kowanne ya rasa lokacin da ya ɓace; sauran 'yan wasan suna samun maki ɗaya ga kowane dabarar da suka ɗauka. Wani dan Amurka mai nasara yana samun maki 52 kuma wanda ya gaza ya rasa 52. Bayan zagaye, dillalin ya koma hagu. Da zarar maki ya kai 52, mafi girman maki yana samun nasara. Abokan hamayyar kwamfuta na gida suna yin zaɓi mai sauƙi na heuristic; babu kan layi multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"'Yan wasa nawa ne za su iya taka leda?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Zabi kujeru uku, huɗu, biyar ko shida. Dan wasa daya shine ku; sauran kujerun abokan adawar kwamfuta ne na gida.","How is the deck dealt?":"Yaya ake mu'amala da bene?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Yi amfani da katunan 52 ba tare da masu barkwanci ba. A kebe daya biyu don 'yan wasa uku, babu na hudu, biyu na biyar, kuma duka biyun guda hudu don shida don haka kowane hannu yana da adadin katunan iri ɗaya.","How do I find my partner?":"Ta yaya zan sami abokin zama na?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Bayan tayin al'ada, jagoranci kati don saita trump kuma nemi katin waccan kwat din da ba a hannunka ba. Duk wanda ya rike shi dole ne ya buga ta a dabara ta farko kuma ya zama abokin tarayya.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Menene Amerikaner ke nufi?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Shi ne babban kira: yi ƙoƙarin cin nasara kowane dabara shi kaɗai, ba tare da abokin tarayya ba kuma ba bu ƙaho. Kira mai nasara yana da darajar maki 52; wanda ya gaza ya biya 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Yaya ake ci na yau da kullun?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Kowa yana samun maki ɗaya a kowace dabara.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Shin wannan wasan yana loda katunana ko maki?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"No. Yanayin wasan da kuma wasan da aka ajiye na zaɓin suna zama a cikin wannan mai binciken akan wannan na'urar.","Rules and limitations":"Dokoki da iyakancewa","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Wannan sigar aikin dijital ce ta saitin ƙa'idar Yaren mutanen Norway, ba da'awar cewa an rufe kowace dokar gida ba. Abokan hamayyar kwamfuta na gida suna amfani da ilimin lissafi mai sauƙi, ba dabarun ƙwararru ba. Babu mahaɗan kan layi, lissafi ko bayanan wasan da aka ɗora. Idan maki sun yi kunnen doki a ƙarshe, kayan aikin suna ba da rahoton ƙwararrun ƴan wasan da aka ɗaure maimakon zaɓi ɗaya ba bisa ka'ida ba.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Yin wasa kyauta. Katuna, maki da zaɓin ajiyewa tsayawa akan wannan na'urar; babu abin da aka ɗora.","Play Amerikaner":"Kunna Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"KYAUTA · GUDU A CIKIN browsing","Total players":"Jimillar 'yan wasa","New game":"Sabon wasa","Resume saved game":"Ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye","Delete saved game":"Share wasan da aka ajiye","Export scores":"Fitar da maki","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"Zukatai","Diamonds":"Diamonds","Clubs":"Kungiyoyi","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Sarauniya","King":"Sarki","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Zaɓi tayin ku","Lead a card":"Jagora katin","Play a card":"Kunna kati","No trump":"Babu trump","Not revealed":"Ba a bayyana ba","No card has been played yet.":"Ba a buga kati ba tukuna.","You passed.":"Kun wuce.","Your lead is on the table.":"Jagorar ku yana kan tebur.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ya jagoranci kuma ya nemi katin abokin tarayya.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} ya buga {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Fara wasa ko ci gaba da wanda aka ajiye akan wannan na'urar.","Player":"Mai kunnawa","You":"Kai","Computer {number}":"Kwamfuta {number}","Score":"Ci","Tricks":"Dabaru","Round":"Zagaye","Current bid":"tayin yanzu","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} yana zabar tayi.","Turn":"Juyawa","Dealer":"Dila","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Abokin tarayya","Bid":"Bid","Number of tricks":"Yawan dabaru","Place bid":"Sanya tayin","Pass":"Shiga","Call Amerikaner":"Kira Amurkaner","Minimum":"Mafi ƙarancin","Maximum":"Mafi girman","Set trump and request your partner":"Saita trump kuma nemi abokin tarayya","Choose your lead card":"Zaɓi katin jagoran ku","Request a card in this suit":"Nemi kati a cikin wannan kwat ɗin","Lead and request this card":"Jagora kuma nemi wannan katin","Play selected card":"Kunna katin da aka zaɓa","Choose a card to play":"Zaɓi katin don kunna","Current trick":"Dabaru na yanzu","Your hand":"Hannunku","Cards in hand":"Katuna a hannu","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Bi jagoran jagora lokacin da za ku iya. Dole ne a buga katin abokin tarayya da ake nema a cikin dabara ta farko.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Ka ba da aƙalla rabin hannunka sama da abin da ake nema na yanzu, ba da wannan gwanjon, ko kira Amerikaner don gwada kowace dabara ita kaɗai.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Katin jagoran ku ya zama trump. Nemi katin wasan-cikin wannan kwat ɗin wanda ba ku riƙe ba; Dole ne mariƙinsa ya fara buga shi.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Babu katin da ya rage a hannun abokan hamayya. Jagoranci ba tare da abokin tarayya ba; Naku tayin ne kawai za a ci.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"An fara wasan. Mai kunnawa ya bar dila yayi tayin farko.","{player} passed.":"{player} ya wuce.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} tayi tayin {count} dabaru.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} da ake kira Amerikaner: kowane dabara shi kaɗai, ba trump.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Kowa ya wuce. Hannu ya sake yi, dillalin kuma ya koma hagu.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} ya riƙe katin da aka nema kuma abokin tarayya ne.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ya ci dabarar.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Zagaye cikakke. {player} ya ɗauki dabarun {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ya lashe wasan da maki {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Wasan ya ƙare a kunnen doki tsakanin {players} a maki {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"An yi tayin: kowane abokin wasan ya sami maki {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Ba a rasa damar yin takara: kowane abokin wasan ya rasa maki {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Ba'amurke mai nasara: maki 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Baturen Amurkan da ya gaza: -52 maki.","Game saved on this device.":"An ajiye wasan akan wannan na'urar.","Saved game resumed.":"An ci gaba da wasan da aka ajiye.","Saved game deleted.":"An share wasan da aka ajiye.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Babu ajiyar gida; wannan wasan zai kasance a bude har sai kun bar shafin.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Wasan da aka ajiye ba a iya karantawa ba. Fara sabon wasa ko share lalacewa da aka lalace.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Babu ajiyan wasa akan wannan na'urar.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"52 ma'auni na katin bene, babu masu wasa. Yi ma'amala daidai da ƴan wasan 3–6 ta hanyar ware isassun biyu. Kudi na yau da kullun yana farawa ne daga rabin hannun da aka tattara kuma dole ne ya wuce abin da ya gabata. Kira Amerikaner don ɗaukar duk dabaru shi kaɗai. A karo na yau da kullun, kai ga saita trump kuma nemi katin abokin tarayya. Bi tsari lokacin da za a iya. Tawagar kowacce ta samu ko ta yi rashin nasara; sauran 'yan wasan suna samun kirga dabarun su. Maki mafi girma yana samun nasara da zarar maki ya kai 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Dokokin Norwegian sun duba 16 Oktoba 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"hi":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"अमेरिकन कार्ड गेम","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"अमेरिकन कार्ड गेम ऑनलाइन - बोली लगाएं, एक साथी खोजें और जीत के गुर","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"तीन से छह खिलाड़ियों के साथ स्थानीय स्तर पर नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकन कार्ड गेम खेलें। तरकीबों के लिए बोली लगाएं, ट्रम्प चुनें, अपना साथी ढूंढें और स्कोर इस डिवाइस पर रखें।","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकन ट्रिक-टेकिंग गेम सीखें: बोली लगाएं कि आप और एक अज्ञात साथी कितनी चालें चल सकते हैं, अपनी बढ़त के साथ ट्रम्प सेट करें, और उस कार्ड का अनुरोध करें जो आपके साथी को प्रकट करता है।","A quick example":"एक त्वरित उदाहरण","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"चार खिलाड़ियों के साथ, 8 की बोली जीत जाती है यदि आप और आपके अनुरोधित कार्ड से पता चला भागीदार कम से कम 8 ट्रिक्स एक साथ लेते हैं। प्रत्येक टीम का साथी तब 8 अंक अर्जित करता है; प्रत्येक दूसरा खिलाड़ी अपनी चाल गिनती अर्जित करता है।","How to play":"कैसे खेलें","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"यह स्थानीय संस्करण नॉर्स्के कॉर्टस्पिल के विरुद्ध जांचे गए नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकी नियमों का पालन करता है। यह एक मानक डेक और बिना जोकर वाले तीन से छह खिलाड़ियों का समर्थन करता है। समान रूप से निपटने के लिए, तीन, पांच या छह खिलाड़ियों के लिए एक, दो या चार दो अलग रखे जाते हैं; चार खिलाड़ी सभी 52 कार्ड का उपयोग करते हैं। डीलर के पास से बचा हुआ खिलाड़ी पहले बोली लगाता है। एक नियमित बोली कम से कम आपके हाथ की आधी होनी चाहिए और वर्तमान बोली से अधिक होनी चाहिए; आप किसी साथी या ट्रम्प के बिना अकेले हर चाल को आज़माने के लिए अमेरिकानर को पास या कॉल कर सकते हैं। यदि आप नियमित बोली जीतते हैं, तो ट्रम्प सेट करने के लिए पहले कार्ड का नेतृत्व करें और उस सूट में इन-प्ले कार्ड का अनुरोध करें जो आपके हाथ में नहीं है। इसके धारक को इसे पहली चाल में खेलना होगा और आपका भागीदार बनना होगा। यदि बाद में बढ़त पर कोई मिलान कार्ड विरोधियों के हाथ में नहीं रहता है, तो बिना किसी साथी के जारी रखें; केवल घोषणाकर्ता को ही बोलीदाता माना जाता है। जब भी संभव हो खिलाड़ियों को एलईडी सूट का पालन करना चाहिए। यदि कोई ट्रम्प नहीं है तो उच्चतम ट्रम्प एक चाल जीतता है, या एलईडी सूट में उच्चतम कार्ड जीतता है। घोषणाकर्ता और भागीदार प्रत्येक बोली लगाने पर लाभ प्राप्त करते हैं, या चूकने पर प्रत्येक बोली हार जाते हैं; अन्य खिलाड़ी अपनी प्रत्येक चाल के लिए एक अंक प्राप्त करते हैं। एक सफल अमेरिकी 52 अंक अर्जित करता है और एक असफल व्यक्ति 52 खो देता है। एक राउंड के बाद, डीलर बाईं ओर चला जाता है। एक बार जब स्कोर 52 तक पहुंच जाता है, तो उच्चतम स्कोर जीत जाता है। स्थानीय कंप्यूटर विरोधी सरल अनुमानी विकल्प चुनते हैं; कोई ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर नहीं है.","How many players can play?":"कितने खिलाड़ी खेल सकते हैं?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"तीन, चार, पांच या छह सीटें चुनें। खिलाड़ी एक आप हैं; अन्य सीटें स्थानीय कंप्यूटर प्रतिद्वंद्वी हैं।","How is the deck dealt?":"डेक का निपटान कैसे किया जाता है?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"जोकर के बिना 52 कार्ड का उपयोग करें। तीन खिलाड़ियों के लिए एक दो, चार के लिए एक भी नहीं, पाँच के लिए दो और छह के लिए सभी चार दो अलग रखें ताकि प्रत्येक हाथ में समान संख्या में कार्ड हों।","How do I find my partner?":"मैं अपना पार्टनर कैसे ढूंढूं?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"सामान्य बोली के बाद, ट्रम्प सेट करने के लिए एक कार्ड का नेतृत्व करें और उस सूट के कार्ड का अनुरोध करें जो आपके हाथ में नहीं है। जो कोई भी इसे धारण करता है उसे इसे पहली चाल में खेलना होगा और आपका साथी बन जाएगा।","What does Amerikaner mean?":"अमेरिकानेर का क्या मतलब है?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"यह शीर्ष कॉल है: हर चाल को अकेले जीतने का प्रयास करें, बिना किसी साथी और बिना किसी ट्रम्प के। एक सफल कॉल का मूल्य 52 अंक है; एक असफल की कीमत 52 है।","How is a normal bid scored?":"सामान्य बोली कैसे लगाई जाती है?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"घोषणाकर्ता और भागीदार दोनों को बोली मिलती है यदि उनकी संयुक्त चालें इसे पूरा करती हैं, या यदि वे कम पड़ते हैं तो प्रत्येक बोली हार जाते हैं। बाकी सभी को प्रति चाल एक अंक मिलता है।","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"क्या यह गेम मेरे कार्ड या स्कोर अपलोड करता है?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"नहीं। गेम की स्थिति और वैकल्पिक रूप से सहेजा गया गेम इस डिवाइस पर इस ब्राउज़र में रहता है।","Rules and limitations":"नियम और सीमाएँ","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"यह एक नॉर्वेजियन नियम सेट का डिजिटल अभ्यास संस्करण है, यह दावा नहीं है कि हर घर का नियम इसमें शामिल है। स्थानीय कंप्यूटर विरोधी सरल अनुमानों का उपयोग करते हैं, विशेषज्ञ रणनीति का नहीं। कोई ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेयर, खाता या अपलोड किया गया गेम डेटा नहीं है। यदि अंत में स्कोर बराबर हो जाता है, तो टूल मनमाने ढंग से किसी एक को चुनने के बजाय बराबरी वाले उच्चतम खिलाड़ियों की रिपोर्ट करता है।","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"खेलने के लिए निःशुल्क। कार्ड, स्कोर और वैकल्पिक सेव इस डिवाइस पर रहते हैं; कुछ भी अपलोड नहीं किया गया है.","Play Amerikaner":"अमेरिकानेर खेलें","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"मुफ़्त · आपके ब्राउज़र में चलता है","Total players":"कुल खिलाड़ी","New game":"नया गेम","Resume saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू करें","Delete saved game":"सहेजा गया गेम हटाएं","Export scores":"निर्यात स्कोर","Spades":"हुकुम","Hearts":"दिल","Diamonds":"हीरे","Clubs":"क्लब","Jack":"जैक","Queen":"रानी","King":"राजा","Ace":"ऐस","Choose your bid":"अपनी बोली चुनें","Lead a card":"एक कार्ड ले जाएँ","Play a card":"एक कार्ड खेलें","No trump":"कोई ट्रम्प नहीं","Not revealed":"खुलासा नहीं हुआ","No card has been played yet.":"अभी तक कोई कार्ड नहीं खेला गया है.","You passed.":"आपने पारित किया।","Your lead is on the table.":"आपका नेतृत्व मेज पर है.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ने नेतृत्व किया और एक भागीदार कार्ड का अनुरोध किया।","{player} played {card}.":"{player} ने {card} चलाया।","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"कोई गेम शुरू करें या इस डिवाइस पर सेव किया गया गेम फिर से शुरू करें।","Player":"खिलाड़ी","You":"आप","Computer {number}":"कंप्यूटर {number}","Score":"अंक","Tricks":"चाल","Round":"गोल","Current bid":"वर्तमान बोली","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} एक बोली चुन रहा है।","Turn":"मोड़","Dealer":"विक्रेता","Trump":"तुस्र्प","Partner":"साथी","Bid":"बोली","Number of tricks":"तरकीबों की संख्या","Place bid":"बोली लगाना","Pass":"पास","Call Amerikaner":"अमेरिकानर को कॉल करें","Minimum":"न्यूनतम","Maximum":"अधिकतम","Set trump and request your partner":"ट्रम्प सेट करें और अपने साथी से अनुरोध करें","Choose your lead card":"अपना लीड कार्ड चुनें","Request a card in this suit":"इस सूट में एक कार्ड का अनुरोध करें","Lead and request this card":"लीड करें और इस कार्ड का अनुरोध करें","Play selected card":"चयनित कार्ड चलायें","Choose a card to play":"खेलने के लिए एक कार्ड चुनें","Current trick":"वर्तमान चाल","Your hand":"आपका हाथ","Cards in hand":"हाथ में कार्ड","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"जब संभव हो तो एलईडी सूट का पालन करें। अनुरोधित पार्टनर कार्ड को पहली चाल में खेला जाना चाहिए।","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"कम से कम अपने हाथ की आधी बोली लगाएं और वर्तमान बोली से अधिक की बोली लगाएं, इस नीलामी के लिए पास हों, या हर चाल को अकेले आज़माने के लिए अमेरिकानेर को कॉल करें।","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"आपका लीड सूट ट्रम्प बन जाता है। उस सूट में एक इन-प्ले कार्ड का अनुरोध करें जो आपके पास नहीं है; इसके धारक को पहले इसे खेलना होगा।","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"विरोधियों के हाथ में कोई मिलान कार्ड नहीं रहता। बिना किसी साथी के नेतृत्व करना; केवल आपकी अपनी बोली ही स्कोर की जाएगी।","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"खेल शुरू हुआ. डीलर के पास से बचा हुआ खिलाड़ी पहले बोली लगाता है।","{player} passed.":"{player} उत्तीर्ण हुआ।","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} बोली {count} युक्तियाँ।","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} को अमेरिकी कहा जाता है: हर चाल अकेली, कोई तुरुप नहीं।","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"सब पास हो गए. हाथ का पुनर्वितरण किया गया और डीलर बाईं ओर चला गया।","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} के पास अनुरोधित कार्ड है और वह आपका भागीदार है।","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ने ट्रिक जीत ली।","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"गोल पूरा. {player} ने {count} ट्रिक अपनाई।","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ने {count} अंकों के साथ गेम जीता!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"खेल {players} के बीच {count} अंकों पर बराबरी पर समाप्त हुआ।","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"बोली लगाई गई: प्रत्येक टीम के साथी को {count} अंक प्राप्त होते हैं।","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"बोली चूक गई: प्रत्येक टीम के साथी को {count} अंक का नुकसान हुआ।","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"सफल अमेरिकी: 52 अंक।","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"असफल अमेरिकी: −52 अंक।","Game saved on this device.":"गेम इस डिवाइस पर सहेजा गया.","Saved game resumed.":"सहेजा गया गेम फिर से शुरू हुआ.","Saved game deleted.":"सहेजा गया गेम हटा दिया गया।","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"स्थानीय बचत अनुपलब्ध है; यह गेम तब तक खुला रहेगा जब तक आप पेज नहीं छोड़ देते।","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सहेजा गया गेम पढ़ा नहीं जा सका। एक नया गेम शुरू करें या क्षतिग्रस्त सेव को हटा दें।","There is no saved game on this device.":"इस डिवाइस पर कोई सहेजा गया गेम नहीं है।","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक, कोई जोकर नहीं। पर्याप्त दो को अलग करके 3–6 खिलाड़ियों के लिए समान रूप से डील करें। एक नियमित बोली आधे हाथ से शुरू होती है और पिछली बोली के शीर्ष पर होनी चाहिए। अकेले ही सारी तरकीबें अपनाने के लिए अमेरिकानर को बुलाओ। एक नियमित बोली पर, ट्रम्प सेट करें और पार्टनर कार्ड का अनुरोध करें। सक्षम होने पर इसका पालन करें। प्रत्येक टीम बोली जीतती या हारती है; अन्य खिलाड़ी अपनी चाल संख्या हासिल कर लेते हैं। एक बार स्कोर 52 तक पहुंचने पर उच्चतम स्कोर जीत जाता है।","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"नार्वेजियन नियमों की जाँच की गई 16 अक्टूबर 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"नॉर्स्के कॉर्टस्पिल · अमेरिकी"},"id":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Permainan Kartu Amerika","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online — Menawar, Menemukan Mitra, dan Menangkan Trik","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Mainkan permainan kartu Norwegia Amerikaner secara lokal dengan tiga hingga enam pemain. Tawaran untuk trik, pilih truf, temukan pasangan Anda dan simpan skor di perangkat ini.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Pelajari permainan pengambilan trik orang Amerika Norwegia: tawar berapa banyak trik yang dapat dilakukan oleh Anda dan pasangan yang tidak dikenal, tentukan keunggulan Anda, dan minta kartu yang mengungkapkan pasangan Anda.","A quick example":"Contoh singkat","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Dengan empat pemain, tawaran 8 menang jika Anda dan partner yang ditunjukkan oleh kartu yang Anda minta melakukan setidaknya trik 8 bersama-sama. Setiap rekan satu tim kemudian mendapatkan poin 8; setiap pemain lain mendapatkan jumlah triknya sendiri.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Versi lokal ini mengikuti peraturan Amerikaner Norwegia yang diperiksa terhadap Norske kortspill. Ini mendukung tiga hingga enam pemain dengan dek standar dan tanpa pelawak. Untuk menangani secara merata, satu, dua atau empat dua disisihkan untuk tiga, lima atau enam pemain; empat pemain menggunakan semua kartu 52. Pemain di kiri dealer menawar terlebih dahulu. Tawaran reguler setidaknya harus setengah dari hasil pembulatan tangan Anda dan lebih tinggi dari tawaran saat ini; Anda juga dapat melewati atau menghubungi Amerikaner untuk mencoba setiap trik sendirian tanpa rekan atau truf. Jika Anda memenangkan tawaran reguler, pimpin kartu pertama yang memasang kartu truf dan minta kartu dalam permainan dengan jenis yang tidak ada di tangan Anda. Pemegangnya harus memainkannya pada trik pertama dan menjadi partner Anda. Jika tidak ada kartu yang cocok yang tersisa di tangan lawan pada keunggulan selanjutnya, lanjutkan tanpa pasangan; hanya deklarasi yang dinilai sebagai penawar. Pemain harus mengikuti setelan yang dipimpin jika memungkinkan. Kartu truf tertinggi memenangkan sebuah trik, atau kartu tertinggi dalam setelan yang dipimpin jika tidak ada kartu truf. Declarer dan partner masing-masing memperoleh tawaran ketika mereka berhasil, atau masing-masing kehilangan tawaran ketika mereka gagal; pemain lain mendapatkan satu poin untuk setiap trik yang mereka lakukan. Orang Amerika yang sukses mendapatkan poin 52 dan orang Amerika yang gagal kehilangan 52. Setelah satu putaran, dealer bergerak ke kiri. Setelah skor mencapai 52, skor tertinggi menang. Lawan komputer lokal membuat pilihan heuristik sederhana; tidak ada multipemain daring.","How many players can play?":"Berapa banyak pemain yang bisa bermain?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Pilih tiga, empat, lima atau enam kursi. Pemain pertama adalah Anda; kursi lainnya adalah lawan komputer lokal.","How is the deck dealt?":"Bagaimana cara pembagian dek?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Gunakan kartu 52 tanpa pelawak. Sisihkan satu dua untuk tiga pemain, tidak ada untuk empat, dua untuk lima, dan keempat dua untuk enam sehingga masing-masing tangan memiliki jumlah kartu yang sama.","How do I find my partner?":"Bagaimana cara menemukan pasangan saya?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Setelah tawaran normal, arahkan kartu untuk memasang kartu truf dan minta kartu dengan jenis yang tidak ada di tangan Anda. Siapapun yang memegangnya harus memainkannya pada trik pertama dan menjadi partner Anda.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Apa yang dimaksud dengan Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Ini adalah panggilan teratas: cobalah untuk memenangkan setiap trik sendirian, tanpa mitra dan tanpa truf. Panggilan yang berhasil bernilai poin 52; yang gagal berharga 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Bagaimana penilaian tawaran normal?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Declaimer dan partner masing-masing mendapatkan tawaran jika kombinasi trik mereka memenuhinya, atau masing-masing kehilangan tawaran jika gagal. Semua orang mendapat satu poin per trik.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Apakah game ini mengunggah kartu atau skor saya?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Tidak. Status permainan dan permainan simpanan opsional tetap ada di browser pada perangkat ini.","Rules and limitations":"Aturan dan batasan","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Ini adalah versi praktik digital dari satu set peraturan Norwegia, bukan klaim bahwa setiap peraturan rumah tercakup. Lawan komputer lokal menggunakan heuristik sederhana, bukan strategi ahli. Tidak ada multipemain online, akun, atau data game yang diunggah. Jika skornya sama di akhir, alat akan melaporkan pemain tertinggi yang memiliki nilai sama, alih-alih memilih satu secara sembarangan.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis dimainkan. Kartu, skor, dan penyimpanan opsional tetap ada di perangkat ini; tidak ada yang diunggah.","Play Amerikaner":"Mainkan Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · BERJALAN DI BROWSER ANDA","Total players":"Jumlah pemain","New game":"Permainan baru","Resume saved game":"Lanjutkan permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Hapus permainan yang disimpan","Export scores":"Ekspor skor","Spades":"Sekop","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Clubs":"Klub","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Ratu","King":"Raja","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Pilih tawaran Anda","Lead a card":"Pimpin kartu","Play a card":"Mainkan kartu","No trump":"Tidak ada truf","Not revealed":"Tidak terungkap","No card has been played yet.":"Belum ada kartu yang dimainkan.","You passed.":"Anda lulus.","Your lead is on the table.":"Petunjuk Anda ada di atas meja.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} memimpin dan meminta kartu mitra.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} memainkan {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Mulai permainan atau lanjutkan permainan yang disimpan di perangkat ini.","Player":"Pemain","You":"Anda","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","Score":"Skor","Tricks":"Trik","Round":"Bulat","Current bid":"Tawaran saat ini","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} sedang memilih tawaran.","Turn":"Berbelok","Dealer":"Pedagang","Trump":"Truf","Partner":"Mitra","Bid":"Penawaran","Number of tricks":"Jumlah trik","Place bid":"Tempatkan tawaran","Pass":"Lulus","Call Amerikaner":"Hubungi Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimal","Maximum":"Maksimal","Set trump and request your partner":"Tetapkan truf dan minta pasangan Anda","Choose your lead card":"Pilih kartu utama Anda","Request a card in this suit":"Minta kartu dengan setelan ini","Lead and request this card":"Pimpin dan minta kartu ini","Play selected card":"Mainkan kartu yang dipilih","Choose a card to play":"Pilih kartu untuk dimainkan","Current trick":"Trik kekinian","Your hand":"Tanganmu","Cards in hand":"Kartu di tangan","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Ikuti setelan led bila Anda bisa. Kartu partner yang diminta harus dimainkan pada trik pertama.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Tawar setidaknya setengah dari hasil bulatan tangan Anda dan lebih tinggi dari tawaran saat ini, lolos untuk lelang ini, atau hubungi Amerikaner untuk mencoba setiap trik sendirian.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Setelan utama Anda menjadi truf. Minta kartu dalam permainan dengan jenis yang tidak Anda miliki; pemegangnya harus memainkannya terlebih dahulu.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Tidak ada kartu yang cocok tersisa di tangan lawan. Memimpin tanpa pasangan; hanya tawaran Anda sendiri yang akan dinilai.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Permainan dimulai. Pemain di kiri dealer menawar terlebih dahulu.","{player} passed.":"{player} lulus.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} menawar trik {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} disebut Amerikaner: setiap trik saja, tanpa truf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Semua orang lulus. Tangannya ditarik kembali dan dealer bergerak ke kiri.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} memegang kartu yang diminta dan merupakan mitra Anda.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} memenangkan triknya.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Putaran selesai. {player} mengambil trik {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} memenangkan pertandingan dengan poin {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Pertandingan berakhir seri antara {players} dengan poin {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Tawaran dibuat: setiap rekan satu tim memperoleh poin {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Tawaran terlewat: setiap rekan satu tim kehilangan poin {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Amerikaner yang sukses: poin 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerikaner yang gagal: −52 poin.","Game saved on this device.":"Game disimpan di perangkat ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan dilanjutkan.","Saved game deleted.":"Game yang disimpan dihapus.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Tabungan lokal tidak tersedia; permainan ini akan tetap terbuka sampai Anda meninggalkan halaman.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Game yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulai permainan baru atau hapus simpanan yang rusak.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Tidak ada game tersimpan di perangkat ini.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Satu setumpuk kartu 52 standar, tidak ada pelawak. Menangani secara merata untuk pemain 3–6 dengan menyisihkan cukup dua. Tawaran reguler dimulai dari separuh tangan yang dibulatkan ke atas dan harus melebihi tawaran sebelumnya. Hubungi Amerikaner untuk melakukan semua trik sendirian. Pada tawaran reguler, arahkan ke set truf dan minta kartu mitra. Ikuti jika bisa. Masing-masing tim mendapatkan atau kalah tawaran; pemain lain mendapatkan jumlah triknya. Skor tertinggi menang setelah skor mencapai 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Peraturan Norwegia diperiksa 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Kortspill Norwegia · Amerika"},"it":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Gioco di carte americano","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online: fai offerte, trova un partner e vinci prese","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Gioca localmente al gioco di carte Norwegian Amerikaner con da tre a sei giocatori. Fai un'offerta per le prese, scegli la briscola, trova il tuo partner e mantieni il punteggio su questo dispositivo.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Impara il gioco delle prese norvegesi amerikaner: dichiara quante prese tu e un partner sconosciuto potete effettuare, imposta la briscola con il tuo vantaggio e richiedi la carta che rivela il tuo partner.","A quick example":"Un rapido esempio","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Con quattro giocatori, una puntata di 8 vince se tu e il partner rivelato dalla carta richiesta prendete insieme almeno 8 prese. Ogni compagno di squadra guadagna quindi 8 punti; ogni altro giocatore guadagna il proprio conteggio di prese.","How to play":"Come si gioca","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Questa versione locale segue le regole norvegesi Amerikaner confrontate con Norske kortspill. Supporta da tre a sei giocatori con un mazzo standard e senza jolly. Per distribuire equamente, uno, due o quattro due vengono riservati a tre, cinque o sei giocatori; quattro giocatori utilizzano tutte le carte 52. Il giocatore alla sinistra del mazziere punta per primo. Un'offerta regolare deve essere almeno la metà della tua mano arrotondata per eccesso e superiore all'offerta corrente; puoi anche passare o chiamare Amerikaner per provare ogni trucco da solo senza un partner o una briscola. Se vinci un'offerta regolare, gioca con la prima carta per impostare la briscola e richiedi una carta in gioco di quel seme che non è nella tua mano. Il suo possessore deve giocarlo nella prima presa e diventa il tuo partner. Se nessuna carta corrispondente rimane nelle mani degli avversari nell'attacco successivo, continua senza un partner; solo il dichiarante viene conteggiato come offerente. I giocatori devono seguire il seme guidato quando possibile. La briscola più alta vince una presa, o la carta più alta nel seme principale se non c'è briscola. Il dichiarante e il partner guadagnano ciascuno la dichiarazione quando la fanno, oppure perdono ciascuno la dichiarazione quando mancano; gli altri giocatori guadagnano un punto per ogni presa che eseguono. Un americano di successo guadagna 52 punti e uno fallito perde 52. Dopo un giro, il mazziere si sposta a sinistra. Una volta che il punteggio raggiunge 52, vince il punteggio più alto. Gli avversari computerizzati locali fanno semplici scelte euristiche; non esiste il multiplayer online.","How many players can play?":"Quanti giocatori possono giocare?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Scegli tre, quattro, cinque o sei posti. Il giocatore uno sei tu; gli altri posti sono avversari computerizzati locali.","How is the deck dealt?":"Come viene distribuito il mazzo?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Utilizza le carte 52 senza jolly. Metti da parte un due per tre giocatori, nessuno per quattro, due per cinque e tutti e quattro due per sei, in modo che ogni mano abbia lo stesso numero di carte.","How do I find my partner?":"Come trovo il mio partner?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Dopo una dichiarazione normale, gioca una carta per impostare la briscola e richiedi una carta di quel seme che non è nella tua mano. Chi lo tiene deve giocarlo nella prima presa e diventa il tuo partner.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Cosa significa Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"È la scelta migliore: provare a vincere ogni presa da solo, senza partner e senza briscola. Una chiamata andata a buon fine vale 52 punti; uno fallito costa 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Come viene valutata un'offerta normale?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Il dichiarante e il partner guadagnano ciascuno la dichiarazione se le loro prese combinate la soddisfano, oppure perdono ciascuno la dichiarazione se non sono all'altezza. Tutti gli altri guadagnano un punto per presa.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Questo gioco carica le mie carte o i miei punteggi?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"N. Lo stato del gioco e il gioco salvato opzionale rimangono in questo browser su questo dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regole e limitazioni","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Questa è una versione pratica digitale di un set di regole norvegesi, non un'affermazione che ogni regola della casa sia coperta. Gli avversari computerizzati locali utilizzano euristiche semplici, non strategie esperte. Non sono presenti multiplayer online, account o dati di gioco caricati. Se i punteggi sono in parità al traguardo, lo strumento segnala i giocatori con il punteggio più alto in parità invece di sceglierne uno arbitrariamente.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Giocare gratuitamente. Le carte, i punteggi e il salvataggio opzionale rimangono su questo dispositivo; non viene caricato nulla.","Play Amerikaner":"Gioca all'Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATUITO · FUNZIONA NEL TUO BROWSER","Total players":"Giocatori totali","New game":"Nuovo gioco","Resume saved game":"Riprendi la partita salvata","Delete saved game":"Elimina la partita salvata","Export scores":"Esporta punteggi","Spades":"Picche","Hearts":"Cuori","Diamonds":"Diamanti","Clubs":"Club","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Regina","King":"Re","Ace":"Asso","Choose your bid":"Scegli la tua offerta","Lead a card":"Prima di una carta","Play a card":"Gioca una carta","No trump":"Nessuna briscola","Not revealed":"Non rivelato","No card has been played yet.":"Nessuna carta è stata ancora giocata.","You passed.":"Sei passato.","Your lead is on the table.":"Il tuo vantaggio è sul tavolo.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ha condotto e richiesto una carta partner.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} ha giocato {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Avvia un gioco o riprendi quello salvato su questo dispositivo.","Player":"Giocatore","You":"Voi","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","Score":"Punto","Tricks":"Trucchi","Round":"Girare","Current bid":"Offerta attuale","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} sta scegliendo un'offerta.","Turn":"Giro","Dealer":"Rivenditore","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Offerta","Number of tricks":"Numero di trucchi","Place bid":"Fai un'offerta","Pass":"Passato","Call Amerikaner":"Chiama Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimo","Maximum":"Massimo","Set trump and request your partner":"Dai briscola e richiedi il tuo partner","Choose your lead card":"Scegli la tua carta principale","Request a card in this suit":"Richiedi una carta di questo seme","Lead and request this card":"Conduci e richiedi questa carta","Play selected card":"Gioca la carta selezionata","Choose a card to play":"Scegli una carta da giocare","Current trick":"Trucco attuale","Your hand":"La tua mano","Cards in hand":"Carte in mano","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Segui la tuta a led quando puoi. La carta partner richiesta deve essere giocata nella prima presa.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Offri almeno metà della tua mano arrotondata per eccesso e superiore all'offerta corrente, passa per quest'asta o chiama Amerikaner per provare ogni trucco da solo.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Il tuo seme principale diventa briscola. Richiedi una carta in gioco di quel seme che non possiedi; il suo possessore deve prima giocarlo.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Nessuna carta corrispondente rimane nelle mani degli avversari. Condurre senza un partner; verrà valutata solo la tua offerta.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Il gioco è iniziato. Il giocatore alla sinistra del mazziere punta per primo.","{player} passed.":"{player} superato.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} punta {count} trucchi.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} chiamato Amerikaner: ogni trucco da solo, niente briscola.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Sono passati tutti. La mano è stata ridistribuita e il mazziere si è spostato a sinistra.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} possiede la carta richiesta ed è il tuo partner.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ha vinto il trucco.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Giro completato. {player} ha preso {count} trucchi.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ha vinto la partita con {count} punti!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"La partita si è conclusa con un pareggio tra {players} con punti {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Offerta fatta: ogni compagno di squadra guadagna {count} punti.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Offerta mancata: ogni compagno di squadra perde {count} punti.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Americano di successo: 52 punti.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Americano fallito: −52 punti.","Game saved on this device.":"Gioco salvato su questo dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"La partita salvata è ripresa.","Saved game deleted.":"Gioco salvato eliminato.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Il salvataggio locale non è disponibile; questo gioco rimarrà aperto finché non lascerai la pagina.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"La partita salvata non può essere letta. Inizia una nuova partita o elimina il salvataggio danneggiato.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Non sono presenti giochi salvati su questo dispositivo.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Un mazzo di carte standard 52, senza jolly. Distribuisci equamente i giocatori 3–6 mettendo da parte un numero sufficiente di due. Una puntata regolare inizia a metà della mano arrotondata per eccesso e deve superare la puntata precedente. Chiama Amerikaner per fare tutti i trucchi da solo. In un'offerta regolare, condurre per impostare la briscola e richiedere una carta partner. Segui l'esempio quando puoi. Ciascuna squadra guadagna o perde l'offerta; gli altri giocatori ottengono il conteggio delle prese. Il punteggio più alto vince quando il punteggio raggiunge 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regole norvegesi controllate 16 Ottobre 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Americano"},"ja":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"アメリカナー カード ゲーム","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"アメリカナー カード ゲーム オンライン — 入札してパートナーを見つけてトリックを勝ち取りましょう","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"ノルウェー アメリカン カード ゲームをローカルで 3 ～ 6 人のプレイヤーでプレイします。トリックを入札し、切り札を選択し、パートナーを見つけて、このデバイスにスコアを保存します。","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"ノルウェーのアメリカン トリックテイキング ゲームを学びましょう。あなたと未知のパートナーが何回トリックを取れるかを入札し、リードでトランプを設定し、パートナーを明らかにするカードを要求します。","A quick example":"簡単な例","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"プレイヤーが 4 人の場合、あなたとリクエストしたカードで公開されたパートナーが一緒に少なくとも 8 トリックを実行した場合、8 の入札が勝ちます。各チームメイトは 8 ポイントを獲得します。他のプレイヤーはそれぞれ自分のトリック数を獲得します。","How to play":"遊び方","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"このローカル バージョンは、Norske kortspill に対してチェックされたノルウェー アメリカ航空のルールに従っています。標準デッキを使用し、ジョーカーなしで 3 人から 6 人のプレイヤーをサポートします。均等に対処するには、3 人、5 人、または 6 人のプレイヤーに対して 1、2、または 4 つの 2 が取っておかれます。 4 人のプレイヤーがすべての 52 カードを使用します。ディーラーの左のプレイヤーが最初に入札します。通常の入札は、少なくとも手持ちの半分を切り上げ、現在の入札より高くなければなりません。また、パートナーや切り札なしで、アメリカナーをパスするか電話して、一人であらゆるトリックを試すこともできます。通常の入札に勝った場合は、最初のカードをリードして切り札をセットし、手札にないそのスートのインプレイ カードをリクエストします。その所有者は最初のトリックでそれをプレイしなければならず、あなたのパートナーになります。その後のリードで対戦相手の手に一致するカードが残っていない場合は、パートナーなしで続行します。宣言者のみが入札者として得点されます。プレイヤーは可能な限り、先導されたスーツに従わなければなりません。最も高いトランプがトリックを獲得します。または、切り札がない場合は、リードされたスートの最も高いカードが勝ちます。宣言者とパートナーはそれぞれ、入札を行うと入札を獲得し、入札を逃すと入札を失います。他のプレイヤーはトリックごとに 1 ポイントを獲得します。成功したアメリカナーは 52 ポイントを獲得し、失敗したアメリカナーは 52 を失います。ラウンド後、ディーラーは左に移動します。スコアが 52 に達すると、最も高いスコアが勝ちとなります。ローカルコンピュータの敵対者は単純なヒューリスティックな選択をします。オンラインマルチプレイヤーはありません。","How many players can play?":"何人のプレイヤーがプレイできますか?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"3、4、5、または 6 席をお選びください。プレイヤー 1 はあなたです。他の席は地元のコンピューターの対戦相手です。","How is the deck dealt?":"デッキはどのように配られますか?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"ジョーカーなしの 52 カードを使用します。 3 人のプレーヤーの場合は 2 を 1 枚、4 人の場合は 2 枚、5 人の場合は 2 枚、6 人の場合は 4 つの 2 をすべて取っておき、各ハンドに同じ枚数のカードが残るようにします。","How do I find my partner?":"パートナーを見つけるにはどうすればよいですか?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"通常の入札の後、カードをリードして切り札を設定し、手札にないそのスーツのカードを要求します。それを持っている人は誰でも最初のトリックでそれをプレイしなければならず、あなたのパートナーになります。","What does Amerikaner mean?":"アメリカナーとはどういう意味ですか?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"これが一番の要求です。パートナーや切り札を使わずに、一人ですべてのトリックに勝つように努めてください。通話が成功すると、52 ポイントの価値があります。失敗した場合の費用は 52 です。","How is a normal bid scored?":"通常の入札はどのように採点されますか?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"宣言者とパートナーは、組み合わせたトリックが入札額に達した場合は入札を獲得し、下回った場合は入札を失います。他の全員はトリックごとに 1 ポイントを獲得します。","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"このゲームは私のカードやスコアをアップロードしますか?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"いいえ。ゲームの状態とオプションの保存されたゲームは、このデバイス上のこのブラウザーに残ります。","Rules and limitations":"ルールと制限事項","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"これは、ノルウェーのルールセットのデジタル実践バージョンであり、すべてのハウスルールがカバーされていると主張するものではありません。ローカル コンピュータの敵対者は、専門的な戦略ではなく、単純なヒューリスティックを使用します。オンライン マルチプレイヤー、アカウント、アップロードされたゲーム データはありません。終了時にスコアが同点の場合、ツールは任意に 1 人を選択するのではなく、最も同点のプレイヤーを報告します。","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"無料でプレイできます。カード、スコア、およびオプションの保存はこのデバイスに残ります。何もアップロードされていません。","Play Amerikaner":"プレイ アメリカナー","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"無料 · ブラウザで実行可能","Total players":"合計プレイヤー数","New game":"新しいゲーム","Resume saved game":"保存したゲームを再開","Delete saved game":"保存されたゲームを削除","Export scores":"スコアのエクスポート","Spades":"スペード","Hearts":"ハート","Diamonds":"ダイヤモンド","Clubs":"クラブ","Jack":"ジャック","Queen":"女王","King":"キング","Ace":"エース","Choose your bid":"入札額を選択してください","Lead a card":"カードをリードする","Play a card":"カードをプレイする","No trump":"切り札はありません","Not revealed":"明らかにされていない","No card has been played yet.":"まだカードがプレイされていません。","You passed.":"あなたは合格しました。","Your lead is on the table.":"あなたのリードはテーブルの上にあります。","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} が主導し、パートナー カードをリクエストしました。","{player} played {card}.":"{player} は {card} をプレイしました。","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ゲームを開始するか、このデバイスに保存されているゲームを再開します。","Player":"プレーヤー","You":"あなた","Computer {number}":"コンピューター {number}","Score":"スコア","Tricks":"トリック","Round":"ラウンド","Current bid":"現在の入札額","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} は入札を選択しています。","Turn":"振り向く","Dealer":"ディーラー","Trump":"トランプ","Partner":"パートナー","Bid":"入札","Number of tricks":"トリックの数","Place bid":"入札する","Pass":"パス","Call Amerikaner":"アメリカナーに電話する","Minimum":"最小値","Maximum":"最大値","Set trump and request your partner":"切り札を設定してパートナーを要求する","Choose your lead card":"リード カードを選択してください","Request a card in this suit":"このスーツのカードをリクエストする","Lead and request this card":"リードしてこのカードをリクエストする","Play selected card":"選択したカードをプレイする","Choose a card to play":"プレイするカードを選択してください","Current trick":"現在のトリック","Your hand":"あなたの手","Cards in hand":"手持ちのカード","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"可能な限り、LED スーツに従ってください。要求されたパートナー カードは最初のトリックでプレイされなければなりません。","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"手持ちの少なくとも半分を切り上げて現在の入札額より高く入札するか、このオークションにパスするか、Americaner に電話してすべてのトリックを単独で試してください。","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"あなたのリードスーツが切り札になります。あなたが持っていないそのスーツのインプレイカードをリクエストします。その所有者は最初にそれをプレイする必要があります。","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"対戦相手の手札には一致するカードが残っていない。パートナーなしでリードする。あなた自身の入札のみが採点されます。","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"ゲームが始まりました。ディーラーの左のプレイヤーが最初に入札します。","{player} passed.":"{player} 合格しました。","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} 入札 {count} トリック。","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} はアメリカナーに電話しました。すべてのトリックだけで、切り札はありません。","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"全員が合格しました。ハンドが再ディールされ、ディーラーは左に移動しました。","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} は要求されたカードを保持しており、あなたのパートナーです。","{player} won the trick.":"{player} がトリックを獲得しました。","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"ラウンド完了。 {player} は {count} トリックを実行しました。","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} が {count} ポイントで勝利しました!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"試合は{count}ポイントで{players}の引き分けで終了した。","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"入札が行われた場合: 各チームメイトは {count} ポイントを獲得します。","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"入札失敗: 各チームメイトは {count} ポイントを失います。","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"成功したアメリカ人: 52 ポイント。","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"失敗したアメリカナー: −52 ポイント。","Game saved on this device.":"ゲームはこのデバイスに保存されています。","Saved game resumed.":"保存したゲームが再開されました。","Saved game deleted.":"保存されたゲームが削除されました。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"ローカル保存は使用できません。このゲームは、ページを離れるまで開いたままになります。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"保存されたゲームを読み取れませんでした。新しいゲームを開始するか、破損したセーブデータを削除してください。","There is no saved game on this device.":"このデバイスには保存されたゲームがありません。","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"標準 52 カード デッキ 1 枚、ジョーカーなし。十分な 2 つを確保して、3 ～ 6 プレイヤーに均等に対処します。通常の入札はハンドの半分を切り上げた額から始まり、前の入札を上回る必要があります。すべてのトリックを一人で引き受けるためにアメリカナーに電話してください。通常の入札では、切り札をセットしてパートナー カードをリクエストします。可能な場合はそれに従いましょう。チームはそれぞれ入札に勝つか負けます。他のプレイヤーはトリック数を獲得します。スコアが 52 に達すると、最も高いスコアが勝ちとなります。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"ノルウェーのルールをチェック済み 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"ノルスケ コルツピル · アメリカナー"},"ko":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"아메리카너 카드 게임","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner 카드 게임 온라인 — 입찰, 파트너 찾기 및 트릭 획득","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"3~6명의 플레이어와 함께 노르웨이 아메리카너 카드 게임을 로컬에서 플레이하세요. 트릭에 입찰하고, 트럼프를 선택하고, 파트너를 찾고, 이 장치에 점수를 보관하세요.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"노르웨이계 미국인 트릭 테이킹 게임을 배우세요. 당신과 알려지지 않은 파트너가 얼마나 많은 트릭을 취할 수 있는지 입찰하고, 리드로 트럼프를 설정하고, 파트너를 공개하는 카드를 요청하세요.","A quick example":"빠른 예","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"4명의 플레이어가 함께 요청한 카드에 표시된 파트너와 함께 최소 8 트릭을 수행하면 8의 입찰이 승리합니다. 그러면 각 팀원은 8 포인트를 얻습니다. 각 플레이어는 자신의 트릭 카운트를 얻습니다.","How to play":"플레이 방법","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"이 로컬 버전은 Norske kortspill에 대해 검사된 노르웨이 Amerikaner 규칙을 따릅니다. 표준 데크를 사용하고 조커 없이 3~6명의 플레이어를 지원합니다. 균등하게 처리하기 위해 3, 5 또는 6명의 플레이어를 위해 1, 2 또는 4개의 2가 따로 설정됩니다. 4명의 플레이어가 52 카드를 모두 사용합니다. 딜러의 왼쪽 플레이어가 먼저 입찰합니다. 일반 입찰가는 최소한 반올림한 금액이어야 하며 현재 입찰가보다 높아야 합니다. 파트너나 트럼프 없이 혼자 모든 트릭을 시도하기 위해 Amerikaner를 통과하거나 전화할 수도 있습니다. 일반 입찰에서 이기면 첫 번째 카드를 트럼프로 설정하고 손에 있지 않은 해당 슈트의 인플레이 카드를 요청합니다. 그 보유자는 첫 번째 트릭에서 그것을 플레이해야 하며 당신의 파트너가 됩니다. 나중 리드에서 상대방의 손에 일치하는 카드가 남아 있지 않으면 파트너 없이 계속합니다. 신고자만이 입찰자로 평가됩니다. 플레이어는 가능하면 LED 슈트를 따라야 합니다. 가장 높은 트럼프가 트릭을 얻거나, 트럼프가 없으면 리드 슈트에서 가장 높은 카드를 얻습니다. 선언자와 파트너는 입찰에 성공하면 각각 입찰을 얻거나 실패하면 입찰을 잃습니다. 다른 플레이어는 자신이 취하는 트릭마다 1점을 얻습니다. 성공적인 Amerikaner는 52 포인트를 획득하고 실패한 Amerikaner는 52 포인트를 잃습니다. 라운드가 끝나면 딜러는 왼쪽으로 이동합니다. 점수가 52에 도달하면 가장 높은 점수가 승리합니다. 로컬 컴퓨터 상대는 간단한 경험적 선택을 합니다. 온라인 멀티플레이어가 없습니다.","How many players can play?":"몇 명의 플레이어가 플레이할 수 있나요?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"3개, 4개, 5개 또는 6개 좌석을 선택하세요. 플레이어 1은 당신입니다. 다른 좌석은 로컬 컴퓨터 상대입니다.","How is the deck dealt?":"덱은 어떻게 처리되나요?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"조커 없이 52 카드를 사용하세요. 3명의 플레이어는 1개 2개, 4명은 없음, 5명은 2개, 6명은 4개 2개를 모두 따로 보관하여 각 손에 동일한 수의 카드가 있도록 합니다.","How do I find my partner?":"내 파트너를 어떻게 찾나요?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"일반적인 입찰 후 카드를 리드하여 트럼프를 설정하고 손에 없는 해당 슈트의 카드를 요청하세요. 그것을 가진 사람은 누구나 첫 번째 트릭을 플레이해야 하며 파트너가 되어야 합니다.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner는 무엇을 의미합니까?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"그것은 최고의 부름입니다: 파트너나 트럼프 없이 혼자서 모든 트릭을 이기도록 노력하십시오. 성공적인 통화는 52 포인트의 가치가 있습니다. 실패한 것의 비용은 52입니다.","How is a normal bid scored?":"일반 입찰은 어떻게 점수가 매겨지나요?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"선언자와 파트너는 결합된 트릭이 충족되면 각각 입찰을 얻거나, 부족하면 입찰을 잃습니다. 다른 사람들은 트릭당 1점을 얻습니다.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"이 게임은 내 카드나 점수를 업로드합니까?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"아니요. 게임 상태와 선택적으로 저장된 게임은 이 장치의 브라우저에 유지됩니다.","Rules and limitations":"규칙 및 제한 사항","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"이것은 노르웨이 규칙 세트의 디지털 실습 버전이며 모든 가정 규칙이 적용된다는 주장은 아닙니다. 로컬 컴퓨터 상대는 전문가 전략이 아닌 단순한 경험적 방법을 사용합니다. 온라인 멀티플레이어, 계정 또는 업로드된 게임 데이터가 없습니다. 결승점에서 점수가 동점인 경우 도구는 임의로 한 명을 선택하는 대신 동률이 가장 높은 플레이어를 보고합니다.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"무료로 플레이할 수 있습니다. 카드, 점수 및 선택적 저장은 이 장치에 유지됩니다. 아무것도 업로드되지 않았습니다.","Play Amerikaner":"Amerikaner 플레이","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"무료 · 브라우저에서 실행","Total players":"총 플레이어 수","New game":"새 게임","Resume saved game":"저장된 게임 재개","Delete saved game":"저장된 게임 삭제","Export scores":"점수 내보내기","Spades":"스페이드","Hearts":"하트","Diamonds":"다이아몬드","Clubs":"클럽","Jack":"잭","Queen":"여왕","King":"킹","Ace":"에이스","Choose your bid":"입찰가를 선택하세요","Lead a card":"카드를 리드하세요","Play a card":"카드 놀이","No trump":"트럼프는 안돼","Not revealed":"공개되지 않음","No card has been played yet.":"아직 플레이된 카드가 없습니다.","You passed.":"합격하셨습니다.","Your lead is on the table.":"귀하의 리드가 테이블 위에 있습니다.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player}가 주도하여 파트너 카드를 요청했습니다.","{player} played {card}.":"{player}가 {card}를 플레이했습니다.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"게임을 시작하거나 이 장치에 저장된 게임을 다시 시작하세요.","Player":"플레이어","You":"너","Computer {number}":"컴퓨터 {number}","Score":"점수","Tricks":"트릭","Round":"둥근","Current bid":"현재 입찰","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player}님이 입찰을 선택하고 있습니다.","Turn":"회전하다","Dealer":"상인","Trump":"지우다","Partner":"파트너","Bid":"매기다","Number of tricks":"트릭의 수","Place bid":"입찰하기","Pass":"패스","Call Amerikaner":"아메리카너에게 전화해","Minimum":"최소","Maximum":"최대","Set trump and request your partner":"트럼프를 설정하고 파트너를 요청하세요","Choose your lead card":"리드 카드를 선택하세요","Request a card in this suit":"이 슈트의 카드를 요청하세요","Lead and request this card":"이 카드를 안내하고 요청하세요","Play selected card":"선택한 카드 재생","Choose a card to play":"플레이할 카드를 선택하세요","Current trick":"현재 트릭","Your hand":"당신의 손","Cards in hand":"손에 카드","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"할 수 있으면 LED 슈트를 따르세요. 요청한 파트너 카드는 첫 번째 트릭에 사용되어야 합니다.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"적어도 반올림하여 현재 입찰가보다 높게 입찰하거나, 이 경매를 통과하거나, Amerikaner에 전화하여 모든 트릭을 단독으로 시도해보세요.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"당신의 리드 슈트가 트럼프가 됩니다. 귀하가 보유하지 않은 해당 슈트의 인플레이 카드를 요청하십시오. 소유자가 먼저 플레이해야 합니다.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"상대방의 손에 일치하는 카드가 남아 있지 않습니다. 파트너 없이 리드하세요. 귀하의 입찰가만 평가됩니다.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"게임이 시작되었습니다. 딜러의 왼쪽 플레이어가 먼저 입찰합니다.","{player} passed.":"{player}가 통과되었습니다.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} 입찰 {count} 트릭.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"Amerikaner라고 불리는 {player}: 모든 트릭은 단독이며 트럼프는 없습니다.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"모두가 통과했습니다. 손이 다시 딜링되었고 딜러는 왼쪽으로 이동했습니다.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player}가 요청한 카드를 보유하고 있으며 귀하의 파트너입니다.","{player} won the trick.":"{player}가 트릭에서 승리했습니다.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"라운드가 완료되었습니다. {player}는 {count} 트릭을 사용했습니다.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player}가 {count} 포인트로 게임에서 승리했습니다!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"게임은 {count} 포인트에서 {players} 사이의 동점으로 끝났습니다.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"입찰 완료: 각 팀원은 {count} 포인트를 얻습니다.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"입찰 실패: 각 팀원은 {count} 포인트를 잃습니다.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"성공적인 미국인: 52 포인트.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"실패한 Amerikaner: −52 포인트.","Game saved on this device.":"이 기기에 게임이 저장되었습니다.","Saved game resumed.":"저장된 게임이 재개되었습니다.","Saved game deleted.":"저장된 게임이 삭제되었습니다.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"로컬 저장을 사용할 수 없습니다. 이 게임은 귀하가 페이지를 떠날 때까지 계속 열려 있습니다.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"저장된 게임을 읽을 수 없습니다. 새 게임을 시작하거나 손상된 저장 파일을 삭제하세요.","There is no saved game on this device.":"이 장치에는 저장된 게임이 없습니다.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"표준 52 카드 데크 1개, 조커 없음. 충분한 2개를 따로 확보하여 3–6 플레이어에게 균등하게 딜을 제공합니다. 일반 입찰은 반올림된 손의 절반부터 시작하며 이전 입찰보다 높아야 합니다. 모든 트릭을 혼자서 수행하려면 Amerikaner에 전화하십시오. 일반 입찰에서는 트럼프를 설정하고 파트너 카드를 요청합니다. 가능하다면 따라하세요. 팀은 각각 입찰을 얻거나 잃습니다. 다른 플레이어는 트릭 카운트를 얻습니다. 점수가 52에 도달하면 가장 높은 점수가 승리합니다.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"노르웨이 규칙 확인됨 16 10월 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"mr":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner कार्ड गेम","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner कार्ड गेम ऑनलाइन — बोली लावा, भागीदार शोधा आणि युक्त्या जिंका","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"तीन ते सहा खेळाडूंसह स्थानिक पातळीवर नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकन कार्ड गेम खेळा. युक्तीसाठी बोली लावा, ट्रम्प निवडा, तुमचा जोडीदार शोधा आणि या डिव्हाइसवर स्कोअर ठेवा.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकनेर ट्रिक-टेकिंग गेम जाणून घ्या: तुम्ही आणि अज्ञात भागीदार किती युक्त्या घेऊ शकता, तुमची आघाडी घेऊन ट्रंप सेट करा आणि तुमच्या जोडीदाराला उघड करणाऱ्या कार्डची विनंती करा.","A quick example":"एक द्रुत उदाहरण","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"चार खेळाडूंसह, तुम्ही आणि तुमच्या विनंती केलेल्या कार्डद्वारे उघड झालेल्या भागीदाराने किमान 8 युक्त्या एकत्र घेतल्यास 8 ची बोली जिंकली जाते. प्रत्येक टीममेट नंतर 8 गुण मिळवतो; प्रत्येक इतर खेळाडू त्यांच्या स्वत: च्या युक्तीची संख्या कमावतात.","How to play":"कसे खेळायचे","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"ही स्थानिक आवृत्ती Norske kortspill विरुद्ध तपासलेल्या नॉर्वेजियन अमेरिकन नियमांचे पालन करते. हे मानक डेक आणि कोणतेही जोकर नसलेल्या तीन ते सहा खेळाडूंना समर्थन देते. समान रीतीने व्यवहार करण्यासाठी, तीन, पाच किंवा सहा खेळाडूंसाठी एक, दोन किंवा चार दोन बाजूला ठेवले जातात; चार खेळाडू सर्व 52 कार्ड वापरतात. डीलरच्या डावीकडील खेळाडूने प्रथम बोली लावली. नियमित बिड तुमच्या हाताने कमीत कमी अर्धी आणि सध्याच्या बोलीपेक्षा जास्त असणे आवश्यक आहे; जोडीदार किंवा ट्रम्पशिवाय प्रत्येक युक्ती एकट्याने करून पाहण्यासाठी तुम्ही अमेरिकानेरला पास करू शकता किंवा कॉल करू शकता. तुम्ही नियमित बोली जिंकल्यास, ट्रम्प सेट करण्यासाठी पहिले कार्ड घ्या आणि तुमच्या हातात नसलेल्या सूटमध्ये इन-प्ले कार्डची विनंती करा. त्याच्या धारकाने ती पहिल्या युक्तीत खेळली पाहिजे आणि तुमचा भागीदार बनला पाहिजे. नंतरच्या आघाडीवर विरोधकांच्या हातात कोणतेही जुळणारे कार्ड राहिल्यास, भागीदाराशिवाय सुरू ठेवा; फक्त घोषणा करणाऱ्याला बोलीदार म्हणून गुण दिले जातात. जेव्हा शक्य असेल तेव्हा खेळाडूंनी नेतृत्व केलेल्या सूटचे अनुसरण करणे आवश्यक आहे. ट्रंप नसल्यास सर्वोच्च ट्रंपने युक्ती जिंकली किंवा नेतृत्वाखालील सूटमध्ये सर्वोच्च कार्ड जिंकले. घोषणाकर्ता आणि भागीदार प्रत्येकाने बोली लावल्यावर ते मिळवतात किंवा प्रत्येकजण चुकल्यावर बोली गमावतो; इतर खेळाडू प्रत्येक युक्तीसाठी एक गुण मिळवतात. एक यशस्वी अमेरिकन 52 गुण मिळवतो आणि अयशस्वी झालेला 52 गमावतो. एका फेरीनंतर, विक्रेता डावीकडे जातो. एकदा स्कोअर 52 वर पोहोचला की, सर्वोच्च स्कोअर जिंकतो. स्थानिक संगणक विरोधक साध्या ह्युरिस्टिक निवडी करतात; कोणतेही ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर नाही.","How many players can play?":"किती खेळाडू खेळू शकतात?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"तीन, चार, पाच किंवा सहा जागा निवडा. खेळाडू एक तुम्ही आहात; इतर जागा स्थानिक संगणक विरोधक आहेत.","How is the deck dealt?":"डेक कसा हाताळला जातो?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"जोकर्सशिवाय 52 कार्ड वापरा. तीन खेळाडूंसाठी एक दोन बाजूला ठेवा, चारसाठी नाही, पाचसाठी दोन आणि सहासाठी चारही दोन बाजूला ठेवा जेणेकरून प्रत्येकाच्या हातात समान संख्या असेल.","How do I find my partner?":"मी माझा जोडीदार कसा शोधू?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"सामान्य बोलीनंतर, ट्रम्प सेट करण्यासाठी कार्ड घेऊन जा आणि तुमच्या हातात नसलेल्या सूटच्या कार्डची विनंती करा. ज्याने ते धरले आहे त्याने ते पहिल्या युक्तीने खेळले पाहिजे आणि आपला भागीदार बनला पाहिजे.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner चा अर्थ काय?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"हा सर्वात वरचा कॉल आहे: प्रत्येक युक्ती एकट्याने जिंकण्याचा प्रयत्न करा, कोणत्याही भागीदाराशिवाय आणि ट्रम्पशिवाय. एक यशस्वी कॉल 52 पॉइंट्सचा आहे; अयशस्वी झालेल्याची किंमत 52 आहे.","How is a normal bid scored?":"सामान्य बोली कशी स्कोअर केली जाते?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"घोषणाकर्ते आणि भागीदार प्रत्येकाने त्यांच्या एकत्रित युक्त्या पूर्ण झाल्यास बोली मिळविली किंवा प्रत्येकजण कमी पडल्यास बोली गमावेल. इतर प्रत्येकाला प्रति युक्ती एक गुण मिळतो.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"हा गेम माझी कार्डे किंवा स्कोअर अपलोड करतो का?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"नं. गेम स्थिती आणि पर्यायी सेव्ह केलेला गेम या डिव्हाइसवर या ब्राउझरमध्ये राहतो.","Rules and limitations":"नियम आणि मर्यादा","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"हे एका नॉर्वेजियन नियम संचाची डिजिटल सराव आवृत्ती आहे, प्रत्येक घरातील नियम समाविष्ट असल्याचा दावा नाही. स्थानिक संगणक विरोधक साध्या ह्युरिस्टिक्सचा वापर करतात, तज्ञ धोरण नाही. ऑनलाइन मल्टीप्लेअर, खाते किंवा अपलोड केलेला गेम डेटा नाही. जर स्कोअर बरोबरीत सुटला तर, टूल अनियंत्रितपणे एक निवडण्याऐवजी बरोबरीत सर्वात जास्त खेळाडूंचा अहवाल देतो.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"खेळण्यासाठी विनामूल्य. कार्ड, स्कोअर आणि पर्यायी बचत या डिव्हाइसवर राहते; काहीही अपलोड केलेले नाही.","Play Amerikaner":"अमेरिकनेर खेळा","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"विनामूल्य · तुमच्या ब्राउझरमध्ये चालते","Total players":"एकूण खेळाडू","New game":"नवीन गेम","Resume saved game":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा","Delete saved game":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम हटवा","Export scores":"स्कोअर निर्यात करा","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"हृदय","Diamonds":"हिरे","Clubs":"क्लब","Jack":"जॅक","Queen":"राणी","King":"राजा","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"तुमची बोली निवडा","Lead a card":"कार्ड लीड करा","Play a card":"एक कार्ड खेळा","No trump":"ट्रम्प नाही","Not revealed":"उघड झाले नाही","No card has been played yet.":"अद्याप कोणतेही कार्ड खेळले गेले नाही.","You passed.":"तुम्ही पास झालात.","Your lead is on the table.":"तुमची आघाडी टेबलवर आहे.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ने भागीदार कार्डचे नेतृत्व केले आणि विनंती केली.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} खेळला.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"गेम सुरू करा किंवा या डिव्हाइसवर सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू करा.","Player":"खेळाडू","You":"आपण","Computer {number}":"संगणक {number}","Score":"स्कोअर","Tricks":"युक्त्या","Round":"गोलाकार","Current bid":"सध्याची बोली","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} एक बोली निवडत आहे.","Turn":"वळणे","Dealer":"डीलर","Trump":"ट्रम्प","Partner":"जोडीदार","Bid":"बोली","Number of tricks":"युक्त्यांची संख्या","Place bid":"बोली लावा","Pass":"पास","Call Amerikaner":"अमेरिकनेरला कॉल करा","Minimum":"किमान","Maximum":"जास्तीत जास्त","Set trump and request your partner":"ट्रम्प सेट करा आणि तुमच्या जोडीदाराला विनंती करा","Choose your lead card":"तुमचे लीड कार्ड निवडा","Request a card in this suit":"या सूटमध्ये कार्डची विनंती करा","Lead and request this card":"लीड करा आणि या कार्डची विनंती करा","Play selected card":"निवडलेले कार्ड खेळा","Choose a card to play":"प्ले करण्यासाठी कार्ड निवडा","Current trick":"सध्याची युक्ती","Your hand":"तुमचा हात","Cards in hand":"हातात कार्ड","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"जेव्हा शक्य असेल तेव्हा एलईडी सूटचे अनुसरण करा. विनंती केलेले भागीदार कार्ड पहिल्या युक्तीत खेळले जाणे आवश्यक आहे.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"किमान अर्धा हात गोळा करून आणि सध्याच्या बोलीपेक्षा जास्त बोली लावा, या लिलावासाठी पास व्हा किंवा प्रत्येक युक्ती एकट्याने करून पाहण्यासाठी Amerikaner ला कॉल करा.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"तुमचा लीड सूट ट्रम्प बनतो. त्या सूटमधील इन-प्ले कार्डची विनंती करा जी तुम्ही धरू नका; त्याच्या धारकाने प्रथम ते प्ले केले पाहिजे.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"विरोधकांच्या हातात कोणतेही जुळणारे कार्ड राहिलेले नाही. जोडीदाराशिवाय आघाडी; फक्त तुमची स्वतःची बोली स्कोअर केली जाईल.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"खेळ सुरू झाला. डीलरच्या डावीकडील खेळाडूने प्रथम बोली लावली.","{player} passed.":"{player} उत्तीर्ण झाले.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} बोली {count} युक्त्या.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} ज्याला अमेरिकनेर म्हणतात: प्रत्येक युक्ती एकटी, ट्रम्प नाही.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"सगळे पास झाले. हात पुन्हा डील केला गेला आणि डीलर डावीकडे गेला.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} कडे विनंती केलेले कार्ड आहे आणि तो तुमचा भागीदार आहे.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ने युक्ती जिंकली.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"फेरी पूर्ण. {player} ने {count} युक्त्या घेतल्या.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ने {count} गुणांसह गेम जिंकला!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"{players} दरम्यान {count} पॉइंट्सवर गेम बरोबरीत संपला.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"बोली लावली: प्रत्येक टीममेटला {count} पॉइंट मिळतात.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"बोली चुकली: प्रत्येक टीममेट {count} पॉइंट गमावतो.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"यशस्वी अमेरिकन: 52 गुण.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"अयशस्वी अमेरिकन: −52 गुण.","Game saved on this device.":"गेम या डिव्हाइसवर सेव्ह केला आहे.","Saved game resumed.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम पुन्हा सुरू झाला.","Saved game deleted.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम हटवला.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"स्थानिक बचत अनुपलब्ध आहे; तुम्ही पेज सोडेपर्यंत हा गेम खुला राहील.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"सेव्ह केलेला गेम वाचता आला नाही. नवीन गेम सुरू करा किंवा खराब झालेले सेव्ह हटवा.","There is no saved game on this device.":"या डिव्हाइसवर कोणताही सेव्ह केलेला गेम नाही.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"एक मानक 52-कार्ड डेक, जोकर नाहीत. पुरेसे दोन बाजूला ठेवून 3–6 खेळाडूंसाठी समान रीतीने व्यवहार करा. नियमित बोली अर्ध्या हाताने सुरू होते आणि ती मागील बोलीच्या वर असणे आवश्यक आहे. सर्व युक्त्या एकट्याने घेण्यासाठी अमेरिकेनेरला कॉल करा. नियमित बोलीवर, ट्रम्प सेट करण्यासाठी नेतृत्व करा आणि भागीदार कार्डची विनंती करा. जेव्हा शक्य असेल तेव्हा त्याचे अनुसरण करा. प्रत्येक संघ बोली मिळवतो किंवा गमावतो; इतर खेळाडू त्यांच्या युक्तीची संख्या मिळवतात. एकदा स्कोअर 52 वर पोहोचला की सर्वोच्च स्कोअर जिंकतो.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"नॉर्वेजियन नियम 16 ऑक्टोबर 2026 तपासले","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske cortspill · Amerikaner"},"ms":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Permainan Kad Amerikaner","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Permainan Kad Amerikaner Dalam Talian — Bida, Cari Rakan Kongsi dan Menangi Helah","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Main permainan kad Amerikaner Norway secara tempatan dengan tiga hingga enam pemain. Bida untuk helah, pilih trump, cari pasangan anda dan kekalkan markah pada peranti ini.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Ketahui permainan menipu Amerikaner Norway: bida berapa banyak helah yang boleh anda dan rakan kongsi yang tidak dikenali, tetapkan petunjuk anda dan minta kad yang mendedahkan pasangan anda.","A quick example":"Contoh pantas","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Dengan empat pemain, bidaan 8 menang jika anda dan rakan kongsi yang didedahkan oleh kad yang anda minta mengambil sekurang-kurangnya 8 helah bersama-sama. Setiap rakan sepasukan kemudiannya memperoleh mata 8; setiap pemain lain memperoleh kiraan helah mereka sendiri.","How to play":"Cara bermain","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Versi tempatan ini mengikut peraturan Norwegian Amerikaner yang disemak terhadap Norske kortspill. Ia menyokong tiga hingga enam pemain dengan dek standard dan tiada pelawak. Untuk berurusan secara sama rata, satu, dua atau empat dua diketepikan untuk tiga, lima atau enam pemain; empat pemain menggunakan semua kad 52. Pemain yang meninggalkan peniaga membida dahulu. Bidaan biasa mestilah sekurang-kurangnya separuh tangan anda dibundarkan dan lebih tinggi daripada bida semasa; anda juga boleh lulus atau menelefon Amerikaner untuk mencuba setiap helah sahaja tanpa rakan kongsi atau trump. Jika anda memenangi bidaan biasa, pimpin kad pertama untuk menetapkan trump dan minta kad dalam permainan dalam saman itu yang bukan dalam tangan anda. Pemegangnya mesti memainkannya dalam helah pertama dan menjadi pasangan anda. Jika tiada kad sepadan kekal di tangan lawan pada pendahuluan kemudian, teruskan tanpa rakan kongsi; hanya pengisytihar diberi markah sebagai pembida. Pemain mesti mengikut sut yang diketuai apabila boleh. Trump tertinggi memenangi helah, atau kad tertinggi dalam sut led jika tiada trump. Pengisytihar dan rakan kongsi masing-masing mendapat tawaran apabila mereka membuat tawaran, atau masing-masing kehilangan tawaran apabila mereka terlepas; pemain lain mendapat satu mata untuk setiap helah yang mereka ambil. Orang Amerika yang berjaya memperoleh mata 52 dan yang gagal kehilangan 52. Selepas satu pusingan, peniaga bergerak ke kiri. Sebaik sahaja skor mencapai 52, markah tertinggi menang. Lawan komputer tempatan membuat pilihan heuristik mudah; tiada berbilang pemain dalam talian.","How many players can play?":"Berapa ramai pemain boleh bermain?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Pilih tiga, empat, lima atau enam kerusi. Pemain satu ialah anda; kerusi lain adalah lawan komputer tempatan.","How is the deck dealt?":"Bagaimana dek ditangani?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Gunakan kad 52 tanpa pelawak. Ketepikan satu dua untuk tiga pemain, tiada satu untuk empat, dua untuk lima, dan keempat-empat dua untuk enam supaya setiap tangan mempunyai bilangan kad yang sama.","How do I find my partner?":"Bagaimana cara saya mencari pasangan saya?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Selepas bida biasa, bawa kad untuk menetapkan trump dan minta kad saman itu yang tiada di tangan anda. Sesiapa yang memegangnya mesti memainkannya dalam helah pertama dan menjadi pasangan anda.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Apakah maksud Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Ia adalah panggilan teratas: cuba menangi setiap helah sahaja, tanpa rakan kongsi dan tiada truf. Panggilan yang berjaya bernilai 52 mata; yang gagal berharga 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Bagaimanakah bida biasa dijaringkan?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Pengisytihar dan rakan kongsi masing-masing mendapat bida jika helah gabungan mereka memenuhinya, atau masing-masing kehilangan bida jika gagal. Orang lain mendapat satu mata setiap helah.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Adakah permainan ini memuat naik kad atau markah saya?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"No. Keadaan permainan dan permainan disimpan pilihan kekal dalam penyemak imbas ini pada peranti ini.","Rules and limitations":"Peraturan dan had","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Ini ialah versi amalan digital bagi satu set peraturan Norway, bukan tuntutan bahawa setiap peraturan dalaman dilindungi. Lawan komputer tempatan menggunakan heuristik mudah, bukan strategi pakar. Tiada berbilang pemain dalam talian, akaun atau data permainan yang dimuat naik. Jika mata seri pada penamat, alat melaporkan pemain tertinggi yang terikat dan bukannya memilih satu sewenang-wenangnya.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Percuma untuk dimainkan. Kad, markah dan simpanan pilihan kekal pada peranti ini; tiada apa yang dimuat naik.","Play Amerikaner":"Main Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"PERCUMA · DIJALANKAN DALAM PENYIARI SEMAK ANDA","Total players":"Jumlah pemain","New game":"Permainan baharu","Resume saved game":"Sambung semula permainan yang disimpan","Delete saved game":"Padam permainan yang disimpan","Export scores":"Skor eksport","Spades":"Penyodok","Hearts":"Hati","Diamonds":"Berlian","Clubs":"Kelab","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Permaisuri","King":"Raja","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Pilih bida anda","Lead a card":"Pimpin kad","Play a card":"Main kad","No trump":"Tiada trump","Not revealed":"Tidak didedahkan","No card has been played yet.":"Tiada kad dimainkan lagi.","You passed.":"awak lulus.","Your lead is on the table.":"Petunjuk anda ada di atas meja.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} memimpin dan meminta kad rakan kongsi.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} memainkan {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Mulakan permainan atau sambung semula permainan yang disimpan pada peranti ini.","Player":"Pemain","You":"awak","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","Score":"skor","Tricks":"tipu helah","Round":"Bulat","Current bid":"Bidaan semasa","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} sedang memilih bida.","Turn":"pusing","Dealer":"Peniaga","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"rakan kongsi","Bid":"bidaan","Number of tricks":"Bilangan helah","Place bid":"Letak bida","Pass":"Lulus","Call Amerikaner":"Panggil Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maksimum","Set trump and request your partner":"Tetapkan trump dan minta pasangan anda","Choose your lead card":"Pilih kad petunjuk anda","Request a card in this suit":"Minta kad dalam saman ini","Lead and request this card":"Pimpin dan minta kad ini","Play selected card":"Mainkan kad yang dipilih","Choose a card to play":"Pilih kad untuk dimainkan","Current trick":"Helah semasa","Your hand":"Tangan anda","Cards in hand":"Kad di tangan","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Ikuti sut led apabila anda boleh. Kad rakan kongsi yang diminta mesti dimainkan dalam helah pertama.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Bida sekurang-kurangnya separuh tangan anda dibundarkan dan lebih tinggi daripada bida semasa, lulus untuk lelongan ini atau hubungi Amerikaner untuk mencuba setiap helah sahaja.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Saman utama anda menjadi truf. Minta kad dalam permainan dalam saman itu yang anda tidak pegang; pemegangnya mesti memainkannya terlebih dahulu.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Tiada kad padanan kekal di tangan pihak lawan. Memimpin tanpa pasangan; hanya bida anda sendiri akan dijaringkan.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Permainan dimulakan. Pemain yang meninggalkan peniaga membida dahulu.","{player} passed.":"{player} lulus.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bidaan {count} helah.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} dipanggil Amerikaner: setiap helah sahaja, tiada truf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Semua orang lulus. Tangan telah diniagakan semula dan peniaga bergerak ke kiri.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} memegang kad yang diminta dan merupakan rakan kongsi anda.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} memenangi helah itu.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Pusingan lengkap. {player} mengambil helah {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} memenangi permainan dengan mata {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Permainan berakhir dengan seri antara {players} pada mata {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Bidaan dibuat: setiap rakan sepasukan memperoleh mata {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Bida terlepas: setiap rakan sepasukan kehilangan mata {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Orang Amerika yang berjaya: mata 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Orang Amerika yang gagal: −52 mata.","Game saved on this device.":"Permainan disimpan pada peranti ini.","Saved game resumed.":"Permainan yang disimpan disambung semula.","Saved game deleted.":"Permainan yang disimpan dipadamkan.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Penyimpanan setempat tidak tersedia; permainan ini akan kekal terbuka sehingga anda meninggalkan halaman.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Permainan yang disimpan tidak dapat dibaca. Mulakan permainan baharu atau padamkan simpanan yang rosak.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Tiada permainan yang disimpan pada peranti ini.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Satu dek kad 52 standard, tiada pelawak. Berurusan secara sama rata untuk pemain 3–6 dengan mengetepikan dua pemain yang cukup. Bidaan biasa bermula pada separuh tangan dibundarkan dan mesti mengatasi bida sebelumnya. Panggil Amerikaner untuk mengambil semua helah sahaja. Pada bida biasa, bawa kepada set trump dan minta kad rakan kongsi. Ikutlah bila mampu. Pasukan masing-masing mendapat atau kalah tawaran; pemain lain mendapat kiraan helah mereka. Markah tertinggi menang apabila skor mencapai 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Peraturan Norway disemak 16 Oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerika"},"nb":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner kortspill","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Kortspillet Amerikaner på nett — meld, finn en makker og vinn stikk","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Spill det norske Amerikaner-kortspillet lokalt med tre til seks spillere. By på triks, velg trumf, finn partneren din og behold poengsummen på denne enheten.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Spill det norske kortspillet Amerikaner: meld hvor mange stikk du og en ukjent makker kan ta, velg trumf med utspillet ditt og be om kortet som avslører makkeren din.","A quick example":"Et raskt eksempel","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Med fire spillere vinner et bud på 8 hvis du og partneren som ble avslørt av det forespurte kortet, tar minst 8 triks sammen. Hver lagkamerat tjener deretter 8 poeng; hver andre spiller tjener sin egen trikstelling.","How to play":"Slik spiller du","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Denne lokale versjonen følger de norske Amerikaner-reglene sjekket mot Norske kortspill. Den støtter tre til seks spillere med en standard kortstokk og ingen jokere. For å gjøre jevnt, er en, to eller fire toere satt til side for tre, fem eller seks spillere; fire spillere bruker alle 52-kortene. Spilleren til venstre for dealeren byr først. Et vanlig bud må være minst halvparten av hånden din rundet opp og høyere enn gjeldende bud; du kan også gi forbi eller ringe Amerikaner for å prøve hvert triks alene uten partner eller trumf. Hvis du vinner et vanlig bud, før det første kortet til å sette trumf og be om et kort i den fargen som ikke er i hånden din. Holderen må spille den i det første trikset og blir din partner. Hvis det ikke er noe matchende kort igjen i motstandernes hender på en senere ledelse, fortsett uten partner; det er kun den som er budgiver som får poengsum. Spillere må følge den ledede fargen når det er mulig. Høyeste trumf vinner et stikk, eller det høyeste kortet i ledet farge hvis det ikke er trumf. Erklæreren og partneren får begge budet når de gir det, eller taper hver av budet når de bommer; andre spillere får ett poeng for hvert triks de tar. En vellykket Amerikaner tjener 52 poeng og en mislykket en mister 52. Etter en runde flytter dealeren til venstre. Når en poengsum når 52, vinner den høyeste poengsummen. Lokale datamotstandere gjør enkle heuristiske valg; det er ingen online multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Hvor mange spillere kan spille?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Velg tre, fire, fem eller seks seter. Spiller en er deg; de andre setene er lokale datamotstandere.","How is the deck dealt?":"Hvordan behandles kortstokken?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Bruk 52-kort uten jokere. Sett til side en to for tre spillere, ingen for fire, to for fem, og alle fire toer for seks, slik at hver hånd har samme antall kort.","How do I find my partner?":"Hvordan finner jeg partneren min?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Etter et normalt bud, før et kort for å sette trumf og be om et kort i den fargen som ikke er i din hånd. Den som holder den må spille den i det første trikset og blir din partner.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Hva betyr Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Det er toppsynet: prøv å vinne hvert triks alene, uten partner og uten trumf. En vellykket samtale er verdt 52 poeng; en mislykket en koster 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Hvordan scores et normalt bud?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Forklareren og partneren får budet hvis deres kombinerte triks oppfyller det, eller taper budet hvis de kommer til kort. Alle andre får ett poeng per triks.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Laster dette spillet opp kortene eller poengsummene mine?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Spillstatus og det valgfrie lagrede spillet forblir i denne nettleseren på denne enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler og begrensninger","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Dette er en digital praksisversjon av ett norsk regelsett, ikke en påstand om at hver husregel dekkes. Lokale datamotstandere bruker enkel heuristikk, ikke ekspertstrategi. Det er ingen online multiplayer, konto eller opplastede spilldata. Hvis poengsummen er ulik ved målgang, rapporterer verktøyet de spillerne som har høyest poengsum i stedet for å velge en vilkårlig.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis å spille. Kort, poeng og valgfri lagring forblir på denne enheten; ingenting er lastet opp.","Play Amerikaner":"Spill Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KJØRER I NETTLESEREN DIN","Total players":"Totalt spillere","New game":"Nytt spill","Resume saved game":"Fortsett lagret spill","Delete saved game":"Slett lagret spill","Export scores":"Eksporter poeng","Spades":"Spader","Hearts":"hjerter","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Clubs":"Klubber","Jack":"Jekk","Queen":"Dronning","King":"King","Ace":"Ess","Choose your bid":"Velg ditt bud","Lead a card":"Lede et kort","Play a card":"Spill et kort","No trump":"Ingen trumf","Not revealed":"Ikke avslørt","No card has been played yet.":"Ingen kort er spilt ennå.","You passed.":"Du bestod.","Your lead is on the table.":"Din ledelse er på bordet.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ledet og ba om et partnerkort.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} spilte {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Start et spill eller gjenoppta det som er lagret på denne enheten.","Player":"Spiller","You":"Du","Computer {number}":"Datamaskin {number}","Score":"Score","Tricks":"Triks","Round":"Rund","Current bid":"Nåværende bud","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} velger et bud.","Turn":"Sving","Dealer":"Forhandler","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Bud","Number of tricks":"Antall triks","Place bid":"Legg inn bud","Pass":"Pass","Call Amerikaner":"Ring Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maksimum","Set trump and request your partner":"Sett trumf og be din partner","Choose your lead card":"Velg ditt hovedkort","Request a card in this suit":"Be om et kort i denne fargen","Lead and request this card":"Lede og be om dette kortet","Play selected card":"Spill det valgte kortet","Choose a card to play":"Velg et kort å spille","Current trick":"Gjeldende triks","Your hand":"Din hånd","Cards in hand":"Kort i hånden","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Følg LED-drakten når du kan. Det forespurte partnerkortet må spilles i det første stikket.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"By minst halvparten av hånden din rundet opp og høyere enn det gjeldende budet, pass for denne auksjonen, eller ring Amerikaner for å prøve hvert triks alene.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Din hovedfarge blir trumf. Be om et in-play-kort i den fargen du ikke har; holderen må spille den først.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Ingen matchende kort er igjen i motstandernes hender. Lede uten partner; kun ditt eget bud vil bli scoret.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Spillet startet. Spilleren til venstre for dealeren byr først.","{player} passed.":"{player} bestått.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bud {count} triks.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} kalt Amerikaner: hvert triks alene, ingen trumf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Alle bestod. Hånden ble omdelt og dealeren flyttet til venstre.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} hadde det forespurte kortet og er din partner.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} vant trikset.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Runde fullført. {player} tok {count} triks.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} vant spillet med {count} poeng!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Spillet endte uavgjort mellom {players} med {count} poeng.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Bud gitt: hver lagkamerat får {count} poeng.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Bud savnet: hver lagkamerat mister {count} poeng.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Vellykket Amerikaner: 52 poeng.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Mislykket Amerikaner: −52 poeng.","Game saved on this device.":"Spillet er lagret på denne enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Lagret spill ble gjenopptatt.","Saved game deleted.":"Lagret spill slettet.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokal lagring er utilgjengelig; dette spillet vil forbli åpent til du forlater siden.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Lagret spill kunne ikke leses. Start et nytt spill eller slett den skadede lagringen.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Det er ikke noe lagret spill på denne enheten.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"En standard 52-kortstokk, ingen jokere. Deal jevnt for 3–6-spillere ved å sette til side nok toere. Et vanlig bud starter på halvparten av hånden rundet opp og må toppe det forrige budet. Ring Amerikaner for å ta alle triks alene. På et vanlig bud, lede for å sette trumf og be om et partnerkort. Følg etter når du kan. Laget vinner eller taper budet; andre spillere får sine trikstellinger. Høyeste poengsum vinner når en poengsum når 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norske regler sjekket 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"nl":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner-kaartspel","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner kaartspel online - Bied, vind een partner en win trucs","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Speel het Noorse Amerikaner-kaartspel lokaal met drie tot zes spelers. Bied op trucs, kies troef, vind je partner en houd de score bij op dit apparaat.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Leer het Noorse Amerikaner-trucjesspel: bied hoeveel slagen jij en een onbekende partner kunnen maken, stel de troef in met jouw voorsprong en vraag de kaart aan die jouw partner onthult.","A quick example":"Een snel voorbeeld","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Bij vier spelers wint een bod van 8 als jij en de partner die op de gevraagde kaart staat, samen minstens 8 slagen maken. Elke teamgenoot verdient dan 8-punten; elke andere speler verdient zijn eigen aantal slagen.","How to play":"Hoe te spelen","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Deze lokale versie volgt de Noorse Amerikaner-regels, vergeleken met Norske Kortspill. Het ondersteunt drie tot zes spelers met een standaard kaartspel en zonder jokers. Om gelijkmatig te kunnen handelen, worden één, twee of vier tweeën gereserveerd voor drie, vijf of zes spelers; vier spelers gebruiken alle 52-kaarten. De speler links van de dealer biedt als eerste. Een normaal bod moet minimaal de helft van uw hand naar boven afgerond zijn en hoger dan het huidige bod; je kunt ook Amerikaner passen of bellen om elke truc alleen uit te proberen, zonder partner of troef. Als u een normaal bod wint, leidt u de eerste kaart naar de troef en vraagt ​​u om een ​​in-play-kaart in die reeks die u niet in uw hand heeft. De houder ervan moet het in de eerste slag spelen en wordt jouw partner. Als er bij een latere voorsprong geen overeenkomende kaart in de handen van de tegenstander achterblijft, ga dan verder zonder partner; alleen de leider wordt als bieder gescoord. Spelers moeten indien mogelijk de led-reeks volgen. De hoogste troef wint een slag, of de hoogste kaart in de led-kleur als er geen troef is. De leider en partner winnen elk het bod als ze het doen, of verliezen elk het bod als ze missen; andere spelers krijgen één punt voor elke slag die ze maken. Een succesvolle Amerikaner verdient 52-punten en een mislukte Amerikaner verliest 52. Na een ronde gaat de dealer naar links. Zodra een score 52 bereikt, wint de hoogste score. Lokale computertegenstanders maken eenvoudige heuristische keuzes; er is geen online multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Hoeveel spelers kunnen spelen?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Kies drie, vier, vijf of zes zitplaatsen. Speler één ben jij; de overige stoelen zijn lokale computertegenstanders.","How is the deck dealt?":"Hoe wordt het kaartspel gedeeld?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Gebruik 52-kaarten zonder jokers. Zet één twee opzij voor drie spelers, geen voor vier, twee voor vijf en alle vier twee voor zes, zodat elke hand hetzelfde aantal kaarten heeft.","How do I find my partner?":"Hoe vind ik mijn partner?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Na een normaal bod leidt u een kaart naar de troef en vraagt ​​u om een ​​kaart van die kleur die u niet in uw hand heeft. Degene die hem vasthoudt, moet hem in de eerste slag spelen en wordt jouw partner.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Wat betekent Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Het is de hoogste beslissing: probeer elke slag alleen te winnen, zonder partner en zonder troef. Een succesvol gesprek is 52 punten waard; een mislukte kost 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Hoe wordt een normaal bod gescoord?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"De leider en partner winnen elk het bod als hun gecombineerde slagen hieraan voldoen, of verliezen elk het bod als ze tekortschieten. Alle anderen krijgen één punt per slag.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Uploadt dit spel mijn kaarten of scores?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. De spelstatus en de optionele opgeslagen game blijven in deze browser op dit apparaat.","Rules and limitations":"Regels en beperkingen","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Dit is een digitale oefenversie van één Noorse regelset, en niet de bewering dat elke huisregel gedekt is. Lokale computertegenstanders gebruiken eenvoudige heuristieken, geen deskundige strategie. Er zijn geen online multiplayer-, account- of geüploade gamegegevens. Als de scores bij de finish gelijk zijn, rapporteert de tool de spelers met het hoogste aantal punten in plaats van er willekeurig één te kiezen.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis te spelen. Kaarten, scores en de optionele save blijven op dit apparaat; er wordt niets geüpload.","Play Amerikaner":"Speel Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · DRAAIT IN UW BROWSER","Total players":"Totaal aantal spelers","New game":"Nieuw spel","Resume saved game":"Opgeslagen spel hervatten","Delete saved game":"Opgeslagen spel verwijderen","Export scores":"Scores exporteren","Spades":"Schoppen","Hearts":"Harten","Diamonds":"Diamanten","Clubs":"Clubs","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Koningin","King":"Koning","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Kies uw bod","Lead a card":"Leid een kaart","Play a card":"Speel een kaart","No trump":"Geen troef","Not revealed":"Niet onthuld","No card has been played yet.":"Er is nog geen kaart gespeeld.","You passed.":"Jij bent geslaagd.","Your lead is on the table.":"Jouw voorsprong ligt op tafel.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} leidde en vroeg een partnerkaart aan.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} speelde {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Start een game of hervat de game die op dit apparaat is opgeslagen.","Player":"Speler","You":"Jij","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","Score":"Scoren","Tricks":"Trucs","Round":"Ronde","Current bid":"Huidig ​​bod","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} kiest een bod.","Turn":"Draai","Dealer":"Dealer","Trump":"Troef","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Bied","Number of tricks":"Aantal trucs","Place bid":"Plaats een bod","Pass":"Geslaagd","Call Amerikaner":"Bel Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimaal","Maximum":"Maximum","Set trump and request your partner":"Stel troef in en vraag uw partner aan","Choose your lead card":"Kies uw leadkaart","Request a card in this suit":"Vraag een kaart in dit pak aan","Lead and request this card":"Leid en vraag deze kaart aan","Play selected card":"Speel geselecteerde kaart","Choose a card to play":"Kies een kaart om te spelen","Current trick":"Huidige truc","Your hand":"Je hand","Cards in hand":"Kaarten in de hand","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Volg het led-pak wanneer je kunt. De gevraagde partnerkaart moet in de eerste slag worden gespeeld.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Bied minimaal de helft van uw hand, afgerond naar boven en hoger dan het huidige bod, pas voor deze veiling, of bel Amerikaner om elke truc alleen uit te proberen.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Je leidende kleur wordt troef. Vraag een in-play kaart aan in die kleur die je niet in je bezit hebt; de houder ervan moet het eerst spelen.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Er blijft geen overeenkomende kaart in de handen van de tegenstander. Leid zonder partner; alleen uw eigen bod wordt gescoord.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Spel begonnen. De speler links van de dealer biedt als eerste.","{player} passed.":"{player} geslaagd.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bod {count} trucs.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} belde Amerikaner: elke truc alleen, geen troef.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Iedereen is geslaagd. De hand werd opnieuw gedeeld en de dealer ging naar links.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} beschikte over de gevraagde kaart en is uw partner.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} heeft de slag gewonnen.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Rond compleet. {player} heeft {count}-trucs uitgevoerd.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} heeft het spel gewonnen met {count}-punten!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"De wedstrijd eindigde in een gelijkspel tussen {players} en {count}-punten.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Bod uitgebracht: elke teamgenoot krijgt {count} punten.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Bod gemist: elke teamgenoot verliest {count} punten.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Succesvolle Amerikaner: 52 punten.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Mislukte Amerikaner: −52 punten.","Game saved on this device.":"Game opgeslagen op dit apparaat.","Saved game resumed.":"Het opgeslagen spel is hervat.","Saved game deleted.":"Opgeslagen spel verwijderd.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokale besparing is niet beschikbaar; dit spel blijft open totdat je de pagina verlaat.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Opgeslagen spel kon niet worden gelezen. Start een nieuw spel of verwijder de beschadigde save.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Er staat geen opgeslagen spel op dit apparaat.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Eén standaard 52-kaartspel, geen jokers. Verdeel gelijkmatig voor spelers 3–6 door voldoende tweeën opzij te zetten. Een normaal bod begint bij de helft van de hand, naar boven afgerond en moet hoger zijn dan het vorige bod. Bel Amerikaner om alle trucs alleen uit te voeren. Bij een normaal bod kun je de troef instellen en een partnerkaart aanvragen. Volg dit voorbeeld als dat mogelijk is. Het team wint of verliest elk het bod; andere spelers krijgen hun trickcounts. De hoogste score wint zodra een score 52 bereikt.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Noorse regels gecontroleerd 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"pl":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerykańska gra karciana","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online — licytuj, znajdź partnera i wygrywaj sztuczki","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Zagraj lokalnie w norweską grę karcianą Amerikaner z trzema do sześciu graczami. Licytuj lewy, wybieraj atuty, znajdź partnera i zapisuj wynik na tym urządzeniu.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Poznaj norweską amerykańską grę polegającą na braniu lew: licytuj, ile lew możesz wziąć ty i nieznany partner, ustal atut swoim prowadzeniem i poproś o kartę, która odkryje twojego partnera.","A quick example":"Krótki przykład","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"W przypadku czterech graczy oferta 8 wygrywa, jeśli ty i partner ujawniony przez żądaną kartę weźmiecie razem co najmniej lewy 8. Następnie każdy członek drużyny zdobywa punkty 8; każdy inny gracz zarabia własną liczbę lew.","How to play":"Jak grać","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Ta wersja lokalna jest zgodna z przepisami norweskiego Amerikaner, sprawdzonymi przeciwko Norske kortspill. Obsługuje od trzech do sześciu graczy ze standardową talią i bez jokerów. Aby rozdać równo, jedną, dwie lub cztery dwójki odkłada się dla trzech, pięciu lub sześciu graczy; czterech graczy korzysta ze wszystkich kart 52. Gracz na lewo od rozdającego licytuje jako pierwszy. Zwykła oferta musi wynosić co najmniej połowę Twojej ręki, zaokrąglona w górę i być wyższa od aktualnej oferty; możesz także przekazać lub zadzwonić do Amerikanera, aby wypróbować każdą sztuczkę sam, bez partnera i atutu. Jeśli wygrasz zwykłą ofertę, poprowadź pierwszą kartę, aby ustawić atut i poproś o kartę w grze w tym kolorze, której nie masz na ręce. Jej posiadacz musi zagrać ją w pierwszej lewie i zostaje Twoim partnerem. Jeśli w późniejszym wyprowadzeniu w rękach przeciwników nie pozostanie żadna pasująca karta, kontynuuj grę bez partnera; tylko deklarujący jest oceniany jako licytant. Jeśli to możliwe, gracze muszą podążać za wskazówką. Najwyższy atut wygrywa lewę lub najwyższa karta w kolorze doprowadzonym, jeśli nie ma atutu. Rozgrywający i partner zyskują ofertę, gdy ją złożą, lub każdy z nich przegrywa, gdy nie trafi; pozostali gracze zyskują jeden punkt za każdą lewę, którą wykonają. Pomyślny Amerykanin zdobywa punkty 52, a nieudany traci 52. Po rundzie krupier przesuwa się w lewo. Gdy wynik osiągnie 52, wygrywa najwyższy wynik. Lokalni przeciwnicy komputerowi dokonują prostych wyborów heurystycznych; nie ma trybu wieloosobowego online.","How many players can play?":"Ilu graczy może grać?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Wybierz trzy, cztery, pięć lub sześć miejsc. Gracz pierwszy to ty; pozostałe miejsca to lokalni przeciwnicy komputerowi.","How is the deck dealt?":"Jak jest rozdawana talia?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Używaj kart 52 bez jokerów. Odłóż jedną dwójkę na trzech graczy, żadnej na czterech, dwie na pięciu i wszystkie cztery dwójki na sześciu, tak aby każda ręka miała tę samą liczbę kart.","How do I find my partner?":"Jak znaleźć partnera?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Po normalnej licytacji poprowadź kartę, aby ustawić atut i poproś o kartę w tym kolorze, której nie masz na ręce. Ktokolwiek ją trzyma, musi ją zagrać w pierwszej lewie i zostaje Twoim partnerem.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Co znaczy Amerykanin?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"To najważniejsza decyzja: spróbuj wygrać każdą lewę sam, bez partnera i atutu. Udane połączenie warte jest 52 punktów; nieudane kosztuje 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Jak oceniana jest zwykła oferta?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Rozgrywający i partner zyskują ofertę, jeśli ich połączone lewy ją spełniają, lub każdy z nich przegrywa ofertę, jeśli nie spełnia wymagań. Wszyscy pozostali otrzymują jeden punkt za każdą sztuczkę.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Czy ta gra przesyła moje karty lub wyniki?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Nie. Stan gry i opcjonalny zapisany stan gry pozostają w tej przeglądarce na tym urządzeniu.","Rules and limitations":"Zasady i ograniczenia","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"To jest cyfrowa, praktyczna wersja jednego z norweskich zestawów zasad, a nie twierdzenie, że uwzględniono zasady dotyczące każdego domu. Lokalni przeciwnicy komputerowi stosują prostą heurystykę, a nie strategię ekspercką. Nie ma trybu wieloosobowego online, konta ani przesłanych danych gier. Jeśli na koniec wyniki są równe, narzędzie zgłasza graczy z największą liczbą remisów, zamiast wybierać jednego arbitralnie.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Darmowa gra. Karty, wyniki i opcjonalny zapis pozostają na tym urządzeniu; nic nie jest przesyłane.","Play Amerikaner":"Zagraj w Amerykanina","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BEZPŁATNY · DZIAŁA W TWOJEJ PRZEGLĄDARCE","Total players":"Wszystkie graczy","New game":"Nowa gra","Resume saved game":"Wznów zapisaną grę","Delete saved game":"Usuń zapisaną grę","Export scores":"Eksportuj wyniki","Spades":"Piki","Hearts":"Serca","Diamonds":"Diamenty","Clubs":"Kluby","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Królowa","King":"Król","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Wybierz swoją ofertę","Lead a card":"Poprowadź kartę","Play a card":"Zagraj w kartę","No trump":"Żadnego Trumpa","Not revealed":"Nie ujawniono","No card has been played yet.":"Żadna karta nie została jeszcze zagrana.","You passed.":"Zdałeś.","Your lead is on the table.":"Twój trop jest na stole.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} prowadził i zażądał karty partnera.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} odtwarzano {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Rozpocznij grę lub wznów tę zapisaną na tym urządzeniu.","Player":"Odtwarzacz","You":"Ty","Computer {number}":"Komputer {number}","Score":"Wynik","Tricks":"Wydziwianie","Round":"Okrągły","Current bid":"Aktualna oferta","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} wybiera ofertę.","Turn":"Zakręt","Dealer":"Kupiec","Trump":"Atut","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Oferta","Number of tricks":"Liczba trików","Place bid":"Złóż ofertę","Pass":"Zaliczony","Call Amerikaner":"Zadzwoń do Amerykanina","Minimum":"Minimalna","Maximum":"Maksimum","Set trump and request your partner":"Ustaw atut i poproś swojego partnera","Choose your lead card":"Wybierz kartę potencjalnego klienta","Request a card in this suit":"Poproś o kartę w tym kolorze","Lead and request this card":"Poprowadź i poproś o tę kartę","Play selected card":"Zagraj w wybraną kartę","Choose a card to play":"Wybierz kartę do gry","Current trick":"Aktualna sztuczka","Your hand":"Twoja dłoń","Cards in hand":"Karty w ręku","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Podążaj za diodami LED, kiedy tylko możesz. Żądana karta partnera musi zostać zagrana w pierwszej lewie.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Zaoferuj co najmniej połowę swojego układu, zaokrągloną w górę i wyższą niż aktualna oferta, przejdź na tę aukcję lub zadzwoń do Amerikanera, aby sam wypróbować każdą sztuczkę.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Twój główny garnitur staje się atutem. Poproś o kartę w grze w tym kolorze, której nie posiadasz; jej posiadacz musi ją zagrać jako pierwszy.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"W rękach przeciwników nie ma pasującej karty. Prowadzić bez partnera; punktowana będzie tylko Twoja oferta.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Gra się rozpoczęła. Gracz na lewo od rozdającego licytuje jako pierwszy.","{player} passed.":"{player} zaliczone.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} licytuje {count} sztuczki.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} zwany Amerikanerem: każda sztuczka osobno, bez atu.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Wszyscy przeszli. Rozdanie zostało ponownie rozdane, a krupier przesunął się w lewo.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} posiada żądaną kartę i jest Twoim partnerem.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} wygrał lewę.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Runda zakończona. {player} wziął sztuczki {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} wygrał grę z punktami {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Gra zakończyła się remisem pomiędzy {players} z liczbą punktów {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Złożona oferta: każdy członek drużyny zdobywa punkty {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Nietrafiona oferta: każdy członek drużyny traci {count} punktów.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Udany Amerykanin: punkty 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerykanin, któremu się nie udało: −52 punktów.","Game saved on this device.":"Gra zapisana na tym urządzeniu.","Saved game resumed.":"Zapisana gra została wznowiona.","Saved game deleted.":"Zapisana gra została usunięta.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Zapis lokalny jest niedostępny; ta gra pozostanie otwarta, dopóki nie opuścisz strony.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Nie można odczytać zapisanej gry. Rozpocznij nową grę lub usuń uszkodzony zapis.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Na tym urządzeniu nie ma zapisanej gry.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Jedna standardowa talia kart 52, bez jokerów. Postępuj równomiernie dla graczy 3–6, odkładając wystarczającą liczbę dwójek. Zwykła oferta zaczyna się od połowy rozdania, zaokrąglona w górę i musi przewyższać poprzednią ofertę. Zadzwoń do Amerikanera, aby sam poradził sobie ze wszystkimi sztuczkami. Przy zwykłej ofercie poprowadź do ustalenia atutu i poproś o kartę partnera. Podążaj za nimi, jeśli to możliwe. Każdy zespół wygrywa lub przegrywa ofertę; pozostali gracze zdobywają liczbę lew. Najwyższy wynik wygrywa, gdy wynik osiągnie 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Sprawdzone przepisy norweskie 16 Październik 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerykanin"},"pt":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Jogo de cartas americano","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online – Dê lances, encontre um parceiro e ganhe truques","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Jogue o jogo de cartas Norwegian Amerikaner localmente com três a seis jogadores. Aposte em truques, escolha trunfo, encontre seu parceiro e mantenha a pontuação neste dispositivo.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Aprenda o jogo de truques do Norwegian Amerikaner: lance quantas vazas você e um parceiro desconhecido podem fazer, defina o trunfo com sua liderança e solicite a carta que revela seu parceiro.","A quick example":"Um exemplo rápido","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Com quatro jogadores, um lance de 8 vence se você e o parceiro revelado pela carta solicitada realizarem pelo menos vazas 8 juntos. Cada companheiro de equipe ganha pontos 8; cada outro jogador ganha sua própria contagem de vazas.","How to play":"Como jogar","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Esta versão local segue as regras da Norwegian Amerikaner verificadas em relação ao Norske kortspill. Suporta de três a seis jogadores com um baralho padrão e sem curingas. Para distribuir uniformemente, um, dois ou quatro pares são reservados para três, cinco ou seis jogadores; quatro jogadores usam todos os cartões 52. O jogador à esquerda do dealer licita primeiro. Um lance normal deve ser pelo menos metade da sua mão arredondada para cima e superior ao lance atual; você também pode passar ou ligar para Amerikaner para tentar todos os truques sozinho, sem parceiro ou trunfo. Se você ganhar um lance normal, leve a primeira carta para definir o trunfo e solicite uma carta em jogo desse naipe que não esteja em sua mão. Seu titular deve jogá-lo na primeira vaza e se tornar seu parceiro. Se nenhuma carta correspondente permanecer nas mãos dos oponentes em uma partida posterior, continue sem parceiro; apenas o declarante é pontuado como licitante. Os jogadores devem seguir o naipe liderado quando possível. O trunfo mais alto ganha uma vaza, ou a carta mais alta do naipe principal, se não houver trunfo. O declarante e o parceiro ganham o lance quando o fazem, ou perdem o lance quando erram; outros jogadores ganham um ponto para cada vaza que realizam. Um Amerikaner bem-sucedido ganha pontos 52 e um fracassado perde 52. Após uma rodada, o dealer move-se para a esquerda. Quando a pontuação atingir 52, a pontuação mais alta vence. Os oponentes locais do computador fazem escolhas heurísticas simples; não há multijogador online.","How many players can play?":"Quantos jogadores podem jogar?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Escolha três, quatro, cinco ou seis assentos. O jogador um é você; os outros assentos são oponentes locais do computador.","How is the deck dealt?":"Como o baralho é distribuído?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Use cartões 52 sem curingas. Separe um dois para três jogadores, nenhum para quatro, dois para cinco e todos os quatro dois para seis para que cada mão tenha o mesmo número de cartas.","How do I find my partner?":"Como encontro meu parceiro?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Após um lance normal, leve uma carta para definir o trunfo e solicite uma carta desse naipe que não esteja em sua mão. Quem o detém deve jogá-lo na primeira vaza e se torna seu parceiro.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"O que significa Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"É a decisão principal: tentar vencer todas as vazas sozinho, sem parceiro e sem trunfo. Uma chamada bem-sucedida vale pontos 52; um com falha custa 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Como é avaliado um lance normal?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"O declarante e o parceiro ganham o lance se suas vazas combinadas o atingirem, ou perdem o lance se não conseguirem. Todos os outros ganham um ponto por manobra.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Este jogo carrega minhas cartas ou pontuações?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Não. O estado do jogo e o jogo salvo opcional permanecem neste navegador neste dispositivo.","Rules and limitations":"Regras e limitações","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Esta é uma versão prática digital de um conjunto de regras norueguesas, não uma afirmação de que todas as regras da casa são cobertas. Os oponentes locais do computador usam heurísticas simples, não estratégias especializadas. Não há multijogador online, conta ou dados de jogo carregados. Se as pontuações empatarem no final, a ferramenta reportará os jogadores com o maior empate em vez de escolher um arbitrariamente.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Grátis para jogar. Cartões, pontuações e salvamento opcional permanecem neste dispositivo; nada é carregado.","Play Amerikaner":"Jogar Americano","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRÁTIS · FUNCIONA NO SEU NAVEGADOR","Total players":"Total de jogadores","New game":"Novo jogo","Resume saved game":"Retomar jogo salvo","Delete saved game":"Excluir jogo salvo","Export scores":"Exportar pontuações","Spades":"Espadas","Hearts":"Corações","Diamonds":"Diamantes","Clubs":"Clubes","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Rainha","King":"Rei","Ace":"Ás","Choose your bid":"Escolha seu lance","Lead a card":"Conduza um cartão","Play a card":"Jogue uma carta","No trump":"Sem trunfo","Not revealed":"Não revelado","No card has been played yet.":"Nenhuma carta foi jogada ainda.","You passed.":"Você passou.","Your lead is on the table.":"Sua liderança está na mesa.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} liderou e solicitou um cartão de parceiro.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} jogou {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Inicie um jogo ou retome aquele salvo neste dispositivo.","Player":"Jogador","You":"Você","Computer {number}":"Computador {number}","Score":"Pontuação","Tricks":"Truques","Round":"Redondo","Current bid":"Lance atual","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} está escolhendo um lance.","Turn":"Vez","Dealer":"Distribuidor","Trump":"Trunfo","Partner":"Parceiro","Bid":"Oferta","Number of tricks":"Número de truques","Place bid":"Colocar lance","Pass":"Aprovado","Call Amerikaner":"Ligue para o Americano","Minimum":"Mínimo","Maximum":"Máximo","Set trump and request your partner":"Defina o trunfo e solicite seu parceiro","Choose your lead card":"Escolha seu cartão principal","Request a card in this suit":"Solicite uma carta deste naipe","Lead and request this card":"Conduza e solicite este cartão","Play selected card":"Jogar a carta selecionada","Choose a card to play":"Escolha uma carta para jogar","Current trick":"Truque atual","Your hand":"Sua mão","Cards in hand":"Cartões em mãos","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Siga o traje LED quando puder. A carta de parceiro solicitada deve ser jogada na primeira rodada.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Apresente pelo menos metade da sua mão arredondada e superior ao lance atual, passe para este leilão ou ligue para Amerikaner para tentar todos os truques sozinho.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Seu naipe principal se torna um trunfo. Solicite uma carta em jogo daquele naipe que você não possui; seu titular deve jogá-lo primeiro.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Nenhuma carta correspondente permanece nas mãos dos oponentes. Liderar sem parceiro; apenas o seu próprio lance será pontuado.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"O jogo começou. O jogador à esquerda do dealer licita primeiro.","{player} passed.":"{player} aprovado.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} lance truques {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} chamado Amerikaner: cada truque sozinho, sem trunfo.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Todos passaram. A mão foi redistribuída e o dealer moveu-se para a esquerda.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} possui o cartão solicitado e é seu parceiro.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} venceu a manobra.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Rodada concluída. {player} fez truques com {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} venceu o jogo com pontos {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"O jogo terminou empatado entre {players} em pontos {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Lance realizado: cada companheiro de equipe ganha pontos {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Lance perdido: cada companheiro de equipe perde {count} pontos.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Amerikaner de sucesso: pontos 52.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Amerikaner reprovado: −52 pontos.","Game saved on this device.":"Jogo salvo neste dispositivo.","Saved game resumed.":"O jogo salvo foi retomado.","Saved game deleted.":"Jogo salvo excluído.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"O salvamento local não está disponível; este jogo permanecerá aberto até você sair da página.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"O jogo salvo não pôde ser lido. Inicie um novo jogo ou exclua o salvamento danificado.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Não há jogo salvo neste dispositivo.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Um baralho de cartas 52 padrão, sem curingas. Distribua uniformemente para jogadores 3 – 6, reservando pares suficientes. Um lance normal começa com metade da mão arredondada para cima e deve superar o lance anterior. Ligue para o Amerikaner para fazer todos os truques sozinho. Em um lance normal, leve para definir o trunfo e solicite um cartão de parceiro. Siga o exemplo quando puder. Cada equipe ganha ou perde a licitação; outros jogadores ganham suas contagens de vazas. A pontuação mais alta vence quando a pontuação atinge 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Regras norueguesas verificadas 16 outubro 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Derramamento de cartão norueguês · Americano"},"ru":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Американская карточная игра","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Карточная онлайн-игра «Американер» — делайте ставки, находите партнера и выигрывайте трюки","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Играйте в карточную игру «Норвежский американец» локально с тремя-шестью игроками. Делайте ставки на взятки, выбирайте козырь, находите партнера и ведите счет на этом устройстве.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Изучите игру норвежских американцев по взятию взяток: предложите, сколько взяток вы и неизвестный партнер можете взять, установите козырь своим ходом и запросите карту, раскрывающую вашего партнера.","A quick example":"Краткий пример","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"При четырех игроках ставка в размере 8 выиграет, если вы и партнер, указанный в запрошенной вами карте, вместе соберете как минимум 8 взяток. Затем каждый товарищ по команде зарабатывает 8 очков; каждый другой игрок зарабатывает свое собственное количество взяток.","How to play":"Как играть","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Эта локальная версия соответствует правилам норвежских американцев, проверенным на Norske kortspill. Он поддерживает от трех до шести игроков со стандартной колодой и без джокеров. Для равномерной раздачи на троих, пяти или шести игроков откладываются одна, две или четыре двойки; четыре игрока используют все карты 52. Первым делает ставку игрок слева от дилера. Обычная ставка должна быть округлена как минимум на половину вашей руки вверх и превышать текущую ставку; вы также можете передать или позвонить американцу, чтобы попробовать каждый трюк в одиночку, без партнера или козыря. Если вы выиграете обычную ставку, поведите первую карту, чтобы установить козырь, и запросите игровую карту той масти, которой нет в вашей руке. Ее обладатель должен сыграть ею первую взятку и стать вашим партнером. Если при следующем ходе в руках противников не осталось ни одной подходящей карты, продолжайте без партнера; только разыгрывающий считается участником торгов. Игроки должны по возможности следовать примеру ведущего. Взятку выигрывает старший козырь или самая старшая карта в ведущей масти, если козыря нет. Разыгрывающий и партнер получают ставку, когда они ее делают, или проигрывают ставку, когда они промахиваются; другие игроки получают одно очко за каждую взятку. Успешный американец зарабатывает 52 очков, а неудачник теряет 52. После раунда дилер перемещается влево. Как только счет достигнет 52, побеждает тот, кто набрал наибольшее количество очков. Местные компьютерные оппоненты делают простой эвристический выбор; нет онлайн-мультиплеера.","How many players can play?":"Сколько игроков может играть?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Выберите три, четыре, пять или шесть мест. Первый игрок — это вы; остальные места занимают местные компьютерные оппоненты.","How is the deck dealt?":"Как раздается колода?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Используйте карты 52 без джокеров. Отложите одну двойку для трех игроков, ни одной для четырех, две для пяти и все четыре двойки для шести, чтобы в каждой руке было одинаковое количество карт.","How do I find my partner?":"Как мне найти партнера?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"После обычной ставки поведите карту, чтобы установить козырь, и запросите карту той масти, которой нет в вашей руке. Тот, кто владеет ею, должен сыграть ею первую взятку и стать вашим партнером.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Что значит американец?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Это главный вызов: постарайтесь выиграть каждую взятку в одиночку, без партнера и без козыря. Успешный звонок приносит 52 баллов; неисправный стоит 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Как оценивается обычная ставка?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"И разыгрывающий, и партнер получают ставку, если их комбинированные трюки соответствуют ей, или теряют ставку, если им не удается. Все остальные получают одно очко за взятку.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Эта игра загружает мои карты или результаты?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Нет. Состояние игры и дополнительная сохраненная игра остаются в браузере на этом устройстве.","Rules and limitations":"Правила и ограничения","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Это цифровая практическая версия одного норвежского набора правил, а не претензия на то, что охвачены все внутренние правила. Местные компьютерные оппоненты используют простую эвристику, а не экспертную стратегию. Нет многопользовательской онлайн-игры, учетной записи или загруженных игровых данных. Если на финише результаты равны, инструмент сообщает об игроках с равным результатом, а не выбирает одного произвольно.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Играть можно бесплатно. Карты, очки и дополнительные сохранения остаются на этом устройстве; ничего не загружается.","Play Amerikaner":"Играть в американца","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕСПЛАТНО · ЗАПУСКАЕТСЯ В ВАШЕМ БРАУЗЕРЕ","Total players":"Всего игроков","New game":"Новая игра","Resume saved game":"Возобновить сохраненную игру","Delete saved game":"Удалить сохраненную игру","Export scores":"Экспорт результатов","Spades":"Пики","Hearts":"Сердца","Diamonds":"Бриллианты","Clubs":"Клубы","Jack":"Джек","Queen":"Королева","King":"Король","Ace":"Ас","Choose your bid":"Выберите свою ставку","Lead a card":"Выведите карту","Play a card":"Разыграть карту","No trump":"Нет козыря","Not revealed":"Не раскрыто","No card has been played yet.":"Ни одна карта еще не разыграна.","You passed.":"Вы прошли.","Your lead is on the table.":"Ваша зацепка на столе.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} возглавил и запросил партнерскую карту.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} сыграл {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Запустите игру или возобновите игру, сохраненную на этом устройстве.","Player":"Игрок","You":"Ты","Computer {number}":"Компьютер {number}","Score":"Счет","Tricks":"Трюки","Round":"Круглый","Current bid":"Текущая ставка","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} выбирает ставку.","Turn":"Повернуть","Dealer":"Дилер","Trump":"Трамп","Partner":"Партнер","Bid":"Делать ставку","Number of tricks":"Количество трюков","Place bid":"Разместить ставку","Pass":"Пройти","Call Amerikaner":"Позвонить американцу","Minimum":"Минимум","Maximum":"Максимум","Set trump and request your partner":"Установите козырь и запросите своего партнера","Choose your lead card":"Выберите карточку потенциального клиента","Request a card in this suit":"Запросить карту в этой масти","Lead and request this card":"Возглавьте и запросите эту карту","Play selected card":"Разыграть выбранную карту","Choose a card to play":"Выберите карту для игры","Current trick":"Текущий трюк","Your hand":"Ваша рука","Cards in hand":"Карты в руке","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"По возможности следуйте примеру светодиода. Запрошенная партнерская карта должна быть разыграна в первой взятке.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Сделайте ставку не менее половины своей руки, округленной вверх, и выше текущей ставки, примите участие в этом аукционе или позвоните американцу, чтобы попробовать каждый трюк в одиночку.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Ваша ведущая масть становится козырной. Запросите внутриигровую карту той масти, которой у вас нет; его владелец должен сначала сыграть его.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"У противников не осталось подходящей карты. Руководить без партнера; только ваша собственная ставка будет оценена.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Игра началась. Первым делает ставку игрок слева от дилера.","{player} passed.":"{player} пройден.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} ставка {count} трюки.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} под названием Американер: каждая взятка одна, никакого козыря.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Все прошли. Раздача была пересдана, и дилер двинулся влево.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} владеет запрошенной картой и является вашим партнером.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} выиграл взятку.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Раунд завершен. {player} выполнял трюки {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} выиграл игру, набрав {count} очков!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Игра завершилась вничью между {players} с результатом {count} очков.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Ставка сделана: каждый товарищ по команде получает {count} очков.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Ставка не пройдена: каждый товарищ по команде теряет {count} очков.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Успешный американец: 52 очков.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Неудавшийся американец: −52 очков.","Game saved on this device.":"Игра сохранена на этом устройстве.","Saved game resumed.":"Сохраненная игра возобновлена.","Saved game deleted.":"Сохраненная игра удалена.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локальное сохранение недоступно; эта игра останется открытой, пока вы не покинете страницу.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Сохраненная игра не может быть прочитана. Начните новую игру или удалите поврежденное сохранение.","There is no saved game on this device.":"На этом устройстве нет сохраненной игры.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Одна стандартная колода карт 52, без джокеров. Раздайте игрокам 3–6 поровну, отложив достаточное количество двоек. Обычная ставка начинается с половины суммы руки, округленной вверх, и должна превышать предыдущую ставку. Позвоните американеру, чтобы он взял на себя все трюки в одиночку. На обычной ставке ведите, чтобы установить козырь и запросить партнерскую карту. Следуйте его примеру, когда сможете. Каждая из команд выигрывает или проигрывает ставку; другие игроки получают количество взяток. Игрок, набравший наибольшее количество очков, считается победителем, если он достигает 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Норвежские правила проверены 16 Октябрь 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Норский кортспил · Американер"},"sv":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikanskt kortspel","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner kortspel online — Bjud, hitta en partner och vinn tricks","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Spela det norska Amerikaner-kortspelet lokalt med tre till sex spelare. Bjud på trick, välj trumf, hitta din partner och behåll poängen på den här enheten.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Lär dig det norska Amerikaner-tricktagningsspelet: bjud hur många trick du och en okänd partner kan ta, sätt trumf med din ledning och begär kortet som avslöjar din partner.","A quick example":"Ett snabbt exempel","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Med fyra spelare vinner ett bud på 8 om du och partnern som avslöjas av ditt begärda kort tar minst 8 trick tillsammans. Varje lagkamrat tjänar sedan 8 poäng; varje annan spelare tjänar sin egen trickräkning.","How to play":"Hur man spelar","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Denna lokala version följer de norska Amerikaner-reglerna kontrollerade mot Norske kortspill. Den stöder tre till sex spelare med en standardlek och inga jokrar. För att dela jämnt sätts en, två eller fyra tvåor åt sidan för tre, fem eller sex spelare; fyra spelare använder alla 52-kort. Spelaren till vänster om dealern bjuder först. Ett vanligt bud måste vara minst hälften av din hand avrundat uppåt och högre än det aktuella budet; du kan också passera eller ringa Amerikaner för att prova varje trick ensam utan partner eller trumf. Om du vinner ett vanligt bud, leda det första kortet för att sätta trumf och begär ett kort i den färgen som inte finns i din hand. Dess hållare måste spela det i det första tricket och blir din partner. Om inget matchande kort finns kvar i motståndarnas händer vid en senare ledning, fortsätt utan en partner; endast deklaranten får poäng som budgivare. Spelare måste följa led-färgen när det är möjligt. Högsta trumf vinner ett stick, eller det högsta kortet i färgen led om det inte finns någon trumf. Förklararen och partnern vinner varsin bud när de lägger det, eller förlorar var och en när de missar; andra spelare får en poäng för varje trick de tar. En framgångsrik Amerikaner tjänar 52 poäng och en misslyckad förlorar 52. Efter en runda flyttar dealern till vänster. När en poäng når 52 vinner den högsta poängen. Lokala datormotståndare gör enkla heuristiska val; det finns ingen online multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Hur många spelare kan spela?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Välj tre, fyra, fem eller sex platser. Spelare ett är du; de andra platserna är lokala datormotståndare.","How is the deck dealt?":"Hur hanteras kortleken?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Använd 52-kort utan jokrar. Avsätt en två för tre spelare, ingen för fyra, två för fem och alla fyra tvåor för sex så att varje hand har samma antal kort.","How do I find my partner?":"Hur hittar jag min partner?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Efter ett normalt bud, leda ett kort för att sätta trumf och begär ett kort i den färgen som inte finns i din hand. Den som håller den måste spela den i det första tricket och blir din partner.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Vad betyder Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Det är toppropet: försök att vinna varje stick ensam, utan partner och utan trumf. Ett lyckat samtal är värt 52 poäng; en misslyckad kostar 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Hur får ett normalt bud?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Förklararen och partnern vinner var och en budet om deras kombinerade trick uppfyller det, eller förlorar var och en budet om de faller kort. Alla andra får en poäng per trick.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Laddar detta spel upp mina kort eller poäng?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Nr. Spelstatus och det valfria sparade spelet stannar i den här webbläsaren på den här enheten.","Rules and limitations":"Regler och begränsningar","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Detta är en digital övningsversion av en norsk regeluppsättning, inte ett påstående om att varje husregel omfattas. Lokala datormotståndare använder enkel heuristik, inte expertstrategi. Det finns ingen online multiplayer, konto eller uppladdade speldata. Om poängen är oavgjorda i mål, rapporterar verktyget de oavgjorda högsta spelarna istället för att välja en godtyckligt.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Gratis att spela. Kort, poäng och den valfria räddningen stannar på den här enheten; ingenting laddas upp.","Play Amerikaner":"Spela Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"GRATIS · KÖR I DIN WEBBläsare","Total players":"Totalt antal spelare","New game":"Nytt spel","Resume saved game":"Återuppta sparat spel","Delete saved game":"Ta bort sparat spel","Export scores":"Exportera poäng","Spades":"Spader","Hearts":"Hjärtan","Diamonds":"Diamanter","Clubs":"Klubbar","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Drottning","King":"Kung","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Välj ditt bud","Lead a card":"Leda ett kort","Play a card":"Spela ett kort","No trump":"Ingen trumf","Not revealed":"Ej avslöjat","No card has been played yet.":"Inget kort har spelats ännu.","You passed.":"Du klarade.","Your lead is on the table.":"Din ledning ligger på bordet.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ledde och begärde ett partnerkort.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} spelade {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Starta ett spel eller återuppta det som sparats på den här enheten.","Player":"Spelare","You":"Du","Computer {number}":"Dator {number}","Score":"Göra","Tricks":"Knep","Round":"Runda","Current bid":"Aktuellt bud","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} väljer ett bud.","Turn":"Sväng","Dealer":"Handlare","Trump":"Trumf","Partner":"Partner","Bid":"Bud","Number of tricks":"Antal trick","Place bid":"Lägg bud","Pass":"Pass","Call Amerikaner":"Ring Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minst","Maximum":"Max","Set trump and request your partner":"Sätt trumf och begär din partner","Choose your lead card":"Välj ditt huvudkort","Request a card in this suit":"Begär ett kort i denna färg","Lead and request this card":"Leda och begära detta kort","Play selected card":"Spela valt kort","Choose a card to play":"Välj ett kort att spela","Current trick":"Aktuellt trick","Your hand":"Din hand","Cards in hand":"Kort i handen","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Följ leddräkten när du kan. Det begärda partnerkortet måste spelas i det första sticket.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Bjud minst halva din hand avrundat uppåt och högre än det nuvarande budet, gå igenom denna auktion eller ring Amerikaner för att prova varje trick ensam.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Din blyfärg blir trumf. Begär ett in-play-kort i den färgen som du inte har; dess hållare måste spela den först.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Inga matchande kort finns kvar i motståndarnas händer. Leda utan partner; endast ditt eget bud kommer att poängsättas.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Spelet började. Spelaren till vänster om dealern bjuder först.","{player} passed.":"{player} godkänd.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bud {count} knep.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} kallas Amerikaner: varje trick ensam, ingen trumf.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Alla passerade. Handen återutdelades och dealern flyttade till vänster.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} hade det begärda kortet och är din partner.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} vann tricket.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Omgången klar. {player} tog {count} trick.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} vann spelet med {count} poäng!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Matchen slutade oavgjort mellan {players} med {count} poäng.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Bud lagt: varje lagkamrat får {count} poäng.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Missat bud: varje lagkamrat förlorar {count} poäng.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Framgångsrik Amerikaner: 52 poäng.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Misslyckad Amerikaner: −52 poäng.","Game saved on this device.":"Spelet har sparats på den här enheten.","Saved game resumed.":"Sparat spel återupptogs.","Saved game deleted.":"Sparat spel raderat.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Lokalt sparande är inte tillgängligt; detta spel kommer att förbli öppet tills du lämnar sidan.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Sparat spel kunde inte läsas. Starta ett nytt spel eller ta bort den skadade lagringen.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Det finns inget sparat spel på den här enheten.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"En standard 52-kortlek, inga jokrar. Dela jämnt för 3–6 spelare genom att avsätta tillräckligt många tvåor. Ett vanligt bud börjar på halva handen avrundat uppåt och måste toppa det föregående budet. Ring Amerikaner för att ta alla knep ensam. Vid ett vanligt bud, leda till att sätta trumf och begära ett partnerkort. Följ efter när du kan. Laget vinner eller förlorar budet; andra spelare får sina tricks. Högsta poäng vinner när en poäng når 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norska regler kontrollerade 16 oktober 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norska kortspel · Amerikaner"},"sw":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Mchezo wa Kadi ya Amerika","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Mchezo wa Kadi ya Merikani Mtandaoni — Tangaza, Tafuta Mshirika na Ushinde Mbinu","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Cheza mchezo wa kadi ya Norway Amerikaner ndani ya nchi na wachezaji watatu hadi sita. Zabuni mbinu, chagua trump, tafuta mshirika wako na uweke alama kwenye kifaa hiki.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Jifunze mchezo wa ujanja wa Kinorwe wa Amerikaner: toa zabuni ni mbinu ngapi wewe na mshirika asiyejulikana mnaweza kuchukua, weka trump kwa uongozi wako, na uombe kadi ambayo itafichua mshirika wako.","A quick example":"Mfano wa haraka","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Ukiwa na wachezaji wanne, ofa ya 8 itashinda ikiwa wewe na mshirika uliyefichuliwa na kadi uliyoomba mtashiriki angalau mbinu za 8 pamoja. Kila mchezaji mwenza basi anapata pointi 8; kila mchezaji mwingine hupata hesabu yake ya hila.","How to play":"Jinsi ya kucheza","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Toleo hili la ndani linafuata sheria za Amerika ya Kaskazini zilizoangaliwa dhidi ya Norske kortspill. Inaauni wachezaji watatu hadi sita wenye staha ya kawaida na hakuna wacheshi. Ili kukabiliana sawasawa, moja, mbili au nne mbili zimetengwa kwa wachezaji watatu, watano au sita; wachezaji wanne wanatumia kadi zote za 52. Mchezaji aliyesalia kwa muuzaji ndiye anayetoa zabuni kwanza. Zabuni ya kawaida lazima iwe angalau nusu ya mkono wako uliozungushwa juu na juu kuliko zabuni ya sasa; unaweza pia kupita au kupiga simu Amerikaner kujaribu kila hila peke yako bila mpenzi au trump. Ukishinda zabuni ya kawaida, ongoza kadi ya kwanza kuweka trump na uombe kadi ya ndani ya mchezo katika suti ambayo haipo mkononi mwako. Mmiliki wake lazima aicheze katika hila ya kwanza na kuwa mshirika wako. Ikiwa hakuna kadi inayolingana inabaki mikononi mwa wapinzani kwenye uongozi wa baadaye, endelea bila mshirika; mtangazaji pekee ndiye anayepewa alama kama mzabuni. Wachezaji lazima wafuate suti inayoongozwa inapowezekana. Tarumbeta ya juu hushinda hila, au kadi ya juu zaidi katika suti iliyoongozwa ikiwa hakuna tarumbeta. Mtangazaji na mshirika kila mmoja anapata zabuni anapofanya, au kila mmoja anapoteza zabuni anapokosa; wachezaji wengine hupata pointi moja kwa kila mbinu wanayotumia. Mwanariadha aliyefanikiwa hupata pointi 52 na asiyefanikiwa hupoteza 52. Baada ya mzunguko, muuzaji anasonga kushoto. Mara baada ya alama kufikia 52, alama ya juu zaidi itashinda. Wapinzani wa kompyuta za mitaa hufanya uchaguzi rahisi wa heuristic; hakuna wachezaji wengi mtandaoni.","How many players can play?":"Je, wachezaji wangapi wanaweza kucheza?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Chagua viti vitatu, vinne, vitano au sita. Mchezaji mmoja ni wewe; viti vingine ni wapinzani wa kompyuta wa ndani.","How is the deck dealt?":"Je, sitaha inashughulikiwaje?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Tumia kadi za 52 bila wacheshi. Tenga moja mbili kwa wachezaji watatu, hakuna wanne, wawili kwa watano, na wote wanne wawili kwa sita ili kila mkono uwe na idadi sawa ya kadi.","How do I find my partner?":"Nitampataje mpenzi wangu?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Baada ya zabuni ya kawaida, ongoza kadi ili kuweka turufu na uombe kadi ya suti hiyo ambayo haiko mkononi mwako. Yeyote anayeishika lazima aicheze kwa hila ya kwanza na kuwa mshirika wako.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Je, Amerikaner inamaanisha nini?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Ni simu kuu: jaribu kushinda kila hila peke yako, bila mshirika wala tarumbeta. Simu iliyofanikiwa ina thamani ya pointi 52; iliyoshindwa inagharimu 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Je, zabuni ya kawaida hupatikanaje?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Mtangazaji na mshirika kila mmoja hupata zabuni ikiwa hila zao zote zitatimizwa, au kila mmoja atapoteza zabuni ikiwa atakosa. Kila mtu mwingine hupata pointi moja kwa kila hila.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Je, mchezo huu unapakia kadi au alama zangu?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Na. Hali ya mchezo na mchezo uliohifadhiwa kwa hiari ubaki kwenye kivinjari hiki kwenye kifaa hiki.","Rules and limitations":"Sheria na mapungufu","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Hili ni toleo la mazoezi ya kidijitali la seti moja ya sheria ya Norway, si dai kwamba kila sheria ya nyumbani inashughulikiwa. Wapinzani wa kompyuta za ndani hutumia heuristics rahisi, sio mkakati wa kitaalam. Hakuna wachezaji wengi mtandaoni, akaunti au data ya mchezo iliyopakiwa. Iwapo matokeo yatatoka sare mwishoni, zana huripoti wachezaji waliofungana zaidi badala ya kuchagua mmoja kiholela.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Bila kucheza. Kadi, alama na hifadhi ya hiari kwenye kifaa hiki; hakuna kinachopakiwa.","Play Amerikaner":"Cheza Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"BILA MALIPO · INAENDELEA KATIKA KIvinjari CHAKO","Total players":"Jumla ya wachezaji","New game":"Mchezo mpya","Resume saved game":"Endelea na mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Delete saved game":"Futa mchezo uliohifadhiwa","Export scores":"Hamisha alama","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"Mioyo","Diamonds":"Almasi","Clubs":"Vilabu","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Malkia","King":"Mfalme","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Chagua zabuni yako","Lead a card":"Ongoza kadi","Play a card":"Cheza kadi","No trump":"Hakuna trump","Not revealed":"Haijafichuliwa","No card has been played yet.":"Bado hakuna kadi iliyochezwa.","You passed.":"Umepita.","Your lead is on the table.":"Mwongozo wako uko kwenye meza.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} iliyoongozwa na kuomba kadi ya mshirika.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} ilichezwa {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Anzisha mchezo au uendelee na ule uliohifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Player":"Mchezaji","You":"Wewe","Computer {number}":"Kompyuta {number}","Score":"Alama","Tricks":"Mbinu","Round":"Mzunguko","Current bid":"Zabuni ya sasa","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} inachagua zabuni.","Turn":"Geuka","Dealer":"Muuzaji","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Mshirika","Bid":"Zabuni","Number of tricks":"Idadi ya mbinu","Place bid":"Mahali pa zabuni","Pass":"Pasi","Call Amerikaner":"Pigia simu Amerikaner","Minimum":"Kima cha chini kabisa","Maximum":"Upeo","Set trump and request your partner":"Weka mbiu na umwombe mshirika wako","Choose your lead card":"Chagua kadi yako ya kuongoza","Request a card in this suit":"Omba kadi katika suti hii","Lead and request this card":"Ongoza na uombe kadi hii","Play selected card":"Cheza kadi iliyochaguliwa","Choose a card to play":"Chagua kadi ya kucheza","Current trick":"Ujanja wa sasa","Your hand":"Mkono wako","Cards in hand":"Kadi mkononi","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Fuata suti inayoongoza unapoweza. Kadi ya mshirika iliyoombwa lazima ichezwe katika mbinu ya kwanza.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Nadi angalau nusu ya mkono wako ukiwa umezungushwa na juu zaidi ya zabuni ya sasa, shinda mnada huu, au piga simu Amerikaner ili kujaribu kila hila peke yako.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Suti yako ya kuongoza inakuwa trump. Omba kadi ya kucheza katika suti hiyo ambayo huimiliki; mwenye nayo lazima acheze kwanza.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Hakuna kadi inayolingana iliyobaki mikononi mwa wapinzani. Kuongoza bila mshirika; zabuni yako pekee ndiyo itapigwa.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Mchezo umeanza. Mchezaji aliyesalia kwa muuzaji ndiye anayetoa zabuni kwanza.","{player} passed.":"{player} imepita.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} mbinu za zabuni {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} inaitwa Amerikaner: kila hila peke yake, hakuna trump.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Kila mtu alipita. Mkono ulifanywa upya na muuzaji akasonga kushoto.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} alishikilia kadi iliyoombwa na ni mshirika wako.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} imeshinda hila.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Mzunguko umekamilika. {player} alichukua mbinu za {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ilishinda mchezo kwa pointi {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Mchezo ulimalizika kwa sare kati ya {players} kwa pointi {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Zabuni imetolewa: kila mchezaji mwenza anapata pointi {count}.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Zabuni haikupatikana: kila mchezaji mwenza amepoteza pointi {count}.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Mmarekani Mwenye Mafanikio: 52 pointi.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Mmarekani aliyeshindwa: pointi −52.","Game saved on this device.":"Mchezo umehifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","Saved game resumed.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umeanza tena.","Saved game deleted.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa umefutwa.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Uhifadhi wa ndani haupatikani; mchezo huu utabaki wazi hadi uondoke kwenye ukurasa.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Mchezo uliohifadhiwa haukuweza kusomeka. Anzisha mchezo mpya au ufute hifadhi iliyoharibiwa.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Hakuna mchezo uliohifadhiwa kwenye kifaa hiki.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Kadi moja ya kawaida ya 52, hakuna wacheshi. Shughulikia kwa usawa wachezaji wa 3–6 kwa kutenga wachezaji wawili wa kutosha. Zabuni ya kawaida huanzia nusu ya mkono uliozungushwa na lazima iwe juu ya zabuni iliyotangulia. Piga simu Amerikaner kuchukua hila zote peke yake. Kwa zabuni ya kawaida, ongoza kwa kuweka turufu na uombe kadi ya mshirika. Fuata mkondo unapoweza. Timu kila moja inapata au inapoteza zabuni; wachezaji wengine hupata hesabu zao za hila. Alama za juu hushinda mara tu alama inapofikia 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Sheria za Norway zimeangaliwa 16 Oktoba 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"ta":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"அமெரிக்கன் கார்டு கேம்","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online — ஏலம், கூட்டாளரைக் கண்டுபிடி மற்றும் தந்திரங்களை வெல்லுங்கள்","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"நோர்வே அமெரிக்கன் கார்டு விளையாட்டை மூன்று முதல் ஆறு வீரர்களுடன் உள்நாட்டில் விளையாடுங்கள். தந்திரங்களுக்கு ஏலம் விடுங்கள், டிரம்பைத் தேர்வுசெய்து, உங்கள் கூட்டாளரைக் கண்டுபிடித்து, இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் ஸ்கோரை வைத்திருங்கள்.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"நார்வேஜியன் அமெரிக்கர் ட்ரிக்-டேக்கிங் கேமைக் கற்றுக்கொள்ளுங்கள்: நீங்களும் அறியாத கூட்டாளியும் எத்தனை தந்திரங்களை எடுக்கலாம், உங்கள் லீட் மூலம் ட்ரம்பை அமைக்கலாம் மற்றும் உங்கள் கூட்டாளரைக் காட்டும் கார்டைக் கோரலாம்.","A quick example":"விரைவான உதாரணம்","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"நான்கு பிளேயர்களுடன், நீங்களும் நீங்கள் கோரிய கார்டின் மூலம் வெளிப்படுத்தப்பட்ட கூட்டாளரும் குறைந்தது 8 தந்திரங்களை ஒன்றாக எடுத்துக்கொண்டால், 8 ஏலம் வெற்றிபெறும். ஒவ்வொரு அணியினரும் 8 புள்ளிகளைப் பெறுகிறார்கள்; ஒருவரையொருவர் தங்கள் சொந்த தந்திர எண்ணிக்கையைப் பெறுகிறார்கள்.","How to play":"எப்படி விளையாடுவது","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"இந்த உள்ளூர் பதிப்பு Norske kortspill இல் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்ட நார்வேஜியன் அமெரிக்கர் விதிகளைப் பின்பற்றுகிறது. இது ஒரு நிலையான டெக் மற்றும் ஜோக்கர்கள் இல்லாத மூன்று முதல் ஆறு வீரர்களை ஆதரிக்கிறது. சமமாக சமாளிக்க, ஒன்று, இரண்டு அல்லது நான்கு இரண்டு மூன்று, ஐந்து அல்லது ஆறு வீரர்களுக்கு ஒதுக்கப்படுகின்றன; நான்கு வீரர்கள் அனைத்து 52 அட்டைகளையும் பயன்படுத்துகின்றனர். டீலரை விட்டு வெளியேறிய வீரர் முதலில் ஏலம் எடுக்கிறார். வழக்கமான ஏலமானது குறைந்தபட்சம் பாதி உங்கள் கையை வட்டமிட்டு தற்போதைய ஏலத்தை விட அதிகமாக இருக்க வேண்டும்; கூட்டாளர் அல்லது ட்ரம்ப் இல்லாமல் தனியாக ஒவ்வொரு தந்திரத்தையும் முயற்சிக்க நீங்கள் அமெரிக்கனரை அனுப்பலாம் அல்லது அழைக்கலாம். வழக்கமான ஏலத்தை நீங்கள் வென்றால், டிரம்பை அமைக்க முதல் கார்டை வழிநடத்தி, உங்கள் கையில் இல்லாத அந்த உடையில் இன்-ப்ளே கார்டைக் கோருங்கள். அதன் வைத்திருப்பவர் அதை முதல் தந்திரத்தில் விளையாடி உங்கள் கூட்டாளியாக வேண்டும். பின்னாளில் முன்னிலையில் எதிராளிகளின் கைகளில் பொருந்தக்கூடிய அட்டை எதுவும் இல்லை என்றால், துணையின்றி தொடரவும்; அறிவிப்பாளர் மட்டுமே ஏலத்தில் மதிப்பெண் பெறுகிறார். வீரர்கள் முடிந்தவரை லீட் சூட்டைப் பின்பற்ற வேண்டும். அதிக டிரம்ப் ஒரு தந்திரத்தை வெல்வார் அறிவிப்பாளர் மற்றும் பங்குதாரர் ஒவ்வொருவரும் ஏலத்தை உருவாக்கும் போது பெறுகிறார்கள் அல்லது ஒவ்வொருவரும் ஏலத்தை இழக்கும் போது இழக்கிறார்கள்; மற்ற வீரர்கள் அவர்கள் எடுக்கும் ஒவ்வொரு தந்திரத்திற்கும் ஒரு புள்ளியைப் பெறுகிறார்கள். ஒரு வெற்றிகரமான அமெரிக்கர் 52 புள்ளிகளைப் பெறுகிறார் மற்றும் தோல்வியுற்றவர் 52 ஐ இழக்கிறார். ஒரு சுற்றுக்குப் பிறகு, வியாபாரி இடதுபுறம் நகர்ந்தார். ஒரு மதிப்பெண் 52 ஐ அடைந்தவுடன், அதிகபட்ச மதிப்பெண் வெற்றி பெறும். உள்ளூர் கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளர்கள் எளிமையான ஹூரிஸ்டிக் தேர்வுகளை செய்கிறார்கள்; ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர் இல்லை.","How many players can play?":"எத்தனை வீரர்கள் விளையாடலாம்?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"மூன்று, நான்கு, ஐந்து அல்லது ஆறு இடங்களைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும். வீரர் ஒருவர் நீங்கள்; மற்ற இடங்கள் உள்ளூர் கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளர்கள்.","How is the deck dealt?":"தளம் எவ்வாறு கையாளப்படுகிறது?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"ஜோக்கர்கள் இல்லாமல் 52 கார்டுகளைப் பயன்படுத்தவும். மூன்று வீரர்களுக்கு ஒன்று இரண்டையும், நான்கு பேருக்கு ஒன்றும் இல்லை, ஐந்திற்கு இரண்டும், மற்றும் நான்கு இரண்டையும் ஆறு பேருக்கு ஒதுக்குங்கள், எனவே ஒவ்வொரு கையிலும் ஒரே எண்ணிக்கையிலான அட்டைகள் இருக்கும்.","How do I find my partner?":"எனது துணையை எப்படி கண்டுபிடிப்பது?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"சாதாரண ஏலத்திற்குப் பிறகு, டிரம்பை அமைக்க ஒரு கார்டை இட்டு, உங்கள் கையில் இல்லாத அந்த உடையின் அட்டையைக் கோரவும். அதை வைத்திருப்பவர் முதல் தந்திரத்தில் அதை விளையாட வேண்டும் மற்றும் உங்கள் பங்குதாரர் ஆக வேண்டும்.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"அமெரிக்கர் என்றால் என்ன?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"இது சிறந்த அழைப்பு: கூட்டாளிகள் மற்றும் ட்ரம்ப் இல்லாமல் தனியாக ஒவ்வொரு தந்திரத்தையும் வெல்ல முயற்சி செய்யுங்கள். வெற்றிகரமான அழைப்பு 52 புள்ளிகள் மதிப்புடையது; ஒரு தோல்வி 52 செலவாகும்.","How is a normal bid scored?":"சாதாரண ஏலம் எப்படி எடுக்கப்படுகிறது?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"அறிவிப்பவர் மற்றும் பங்குதாரர் ஒவ்வொருவரும் தங்கள் ஒருங்கிணைந்த தந்திரங்கள் அதைச் சந்தித்தால் ஏலத்தைப் பெறுவார்கள் அல்லது ஒவ்வொருவரும் ஏலத்தில் தவறினால் ஏலத்தை இழக்கிறார்கள். மற்ற அனைவரும் ஒரு தந்திரத்திற்கு ஒரு புள்ளியைப் பெறுகிறார்கள்.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"இந்த கேம் எனது கார்டுகளையோ மதிப்பெண்களையோ பதிவேற்றுகிறதா?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"எண். கேம் நிலை மற்றும் விருப்பமான சேமித்த கேம் இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இந்த உலாவியில் இருக்கும்.","Rules and limitations":"விதிகளும் வரம்புகளும்","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"இது ஒரு நார்வேஜியன் விதிகளின் டிஜிட்டல் நடைமுறைப் பதிப்பாகும், ஒவ்வொரு வீட்டு விதியும் உள்ளடக்கப்பட்டதாகக் கூறப்படவில்லை. உள்ளூர் கணினி எதிர்ப்பாளர்கள் எளிய ஹூரிஸ்டிக்ஸைப் பயன்படுத்துகிறார்கள், நிபுணர் உத்தி அல்ல. ஆன்லைன் மல்டிபிளேயர், கணக்கு அல்லது பதிவேற்றிய கேம் தரவு எதுவும் இல்லை. முடிவில் மதிப்பெண்கள் சமநிலையில் இருந்தால், கருவி தன்னிச்சையாக ஒருவரைத் தேர்ந்தெடுப்பதற்குப் பதிலாக சமன் செய்யப்பட்ட அதிகபட்ச வீரர்களைப் புகாரளிக்கும்.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"இலவசமாக விளையாடலாம். கார்டுகள், மதிப்பெண்கள் மற்றும் விருப்பச் சேமிப்பு ஆகியவை இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் இருக்கும்; எதுவும் பதிவேற்றப்படவில்லை.","Play Amerikaner":"அமெரிக்கனேரை விளையாடு","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"இலவசம் · உங்கள் உலாவியில் இயங்குகிறது","Total players":"மொத்த வீரர்கள்","New game":"புதிய கேம்","Resume saved game":"சேமித்த விளையாட்டை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்","Delete saved game":"சேமித்த கேமை நீக்கு","Export scores":"ஏற்றுமதி மதிப்பெண்கள்","Spades":"ஸ்பேட்ஸ்","Hearts":"இதயங்கள்","Diamonds":"வைரங்கள்","Clubs":"கிளப்புகள்","Jack":"ஜாக்","Queen":"ராணி","King":"ராஜா","Ace":"ஏஸ்","Choose your bid":"உங்கள் ஏலத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்","Lead a card":"ஒரு அட்டையை வழிநடத்தவும்","Play a card":"ஒரு அட்டையை விளையாடு","No trump":"டிரம்ப் இல்லை","Not revealed":"வெளிப்படுத்தப்படவில்லை","No card has been played yet.":"இதுவரை எந்த அட்டையும் விளையாடப்படவில்லை.","You passed.":"நீங்கள் தேர்ச்சி பெற்றீர்கள்.","Your lead is on the table.":"உங்கள் முன்னணி மேஜையில் உள்ளது.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} தலைமை தாங்கி கூட்டாளர் அட்டையைக் கோரியது.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} விளையாடியது.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"கேமைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் சேமித்ததை மீண்டும் தொடங்கவும்.","Player":"வீரர்","You":"நீங்கள்","Computer {number}":"கணினி {number}","Score":"மதிப்பெண்","Tricks":"தந்திரங்கள்","Round":"சுற்று","Current bid":"தற்போதைய ஏலம்","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} ஒரு ஏலத்தைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கிறது.","Turn":"திருப்பு","Dealer":"வியாபாரி","Trump":"டிரம்ப்","Partner":"பங்குதாரர்","Bid":"ஏலம்","Number of tricks":"தந்திரங்களின் எண்ணிக்கை","Place bid":"ஏலம் வைக்கவும்","Pass":"பாஸ்","Call Amerikaner":"அமெரிக்கனரை அழைக்கவும்","Minimum":"குறைந்தபட்சம்","Maximum":"அதிகபட்சம்","Set trump and request your partner":"டிரம்பை அமைத்து உங்கள் கூட்டாளரைக் கோருங்கள்","Choose your lead card":"உங்கள் முன்னணி அட்டையைத் தேர்ந்தெடுக்கவும்","Request a card in this suit":"இந்த உடையில் கார்டைக் கோரவும்","Lead and request this card":"இந்த அட்டையை வழிநடத்தி கோரவும்","Play selected card":"தேர்ந்தெடுக்கப்பட்ட கார்டை இயக்கவும்","Choose a card to play":"விளையாட கார்டைத் தேர்வு செய்யவும்","Current trick":"தற்போதைய தந்திரம்","Your hand":"உங்கள் கை","Cards in hand":"கார்டுகள் கையில்","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"உங்களால் முடிந்தவரை லெட் சூட்டைப் பின்பற்றவும். கோரப்பட்ட பார்ட்னர் கார்டை முதல் ட்ரிக்கில் இயக்க வேண்டும்.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"உங்கள் கைகளில் பாதியையாவது வட்டமிட்டு, தற்போதைய ஏலத்தை விட அதிகமாக ஏலம் எடுக்கவும், இந்த ஏலத்திற்குச் செல்லவும் அல்லது ஒவ்வொரு தந்திரத்தையும் தனியாக முயற்சி செய்ய அமெரிக்கரை அழைக்கவும்.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"உங்கள் லீட் சூட் டிரம்ப்பாக மாறுகிறது. நீங்கள் வைத்திருக்காத அந்த உடையில் இன்-ப்ளே கார்டைக் கோருங்கள்; அதை வைத்திருப்பவர் முதலில் விளையாட வேண்டும்.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"எதிரிகளின் கைகளில் பொருந்தக்கூடிய அட்டை எதுவும் இல்லை. பங்குதாரர் இல்லாமல் வழிநடத்துங்கள்; உங்கள் சொந்த ஏலம் மட்டுமே அடிக்கப்படும்.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"விளையாட்டு தொடங்கியது. டீலரை விட்டு வெளியேறிய வீரர் முதலில் ஏலம் எடுக்கிறார்.","{player} passed.":"{player} தேர்ச்சி.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} ஏலம் {count} தந்திரங்கள்.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} என்று அமெரிக்கர்: ஒவ்வொரு தந்திரமும் தனியாக, டிரம்ப் இல்லை.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"அனைவரும் தேர்ச்சி பெற்றனர். கை மறுபரிசீலனை செய்யப்பட்டது மற்றும் வியாபாரி இடதுபுறம் நகர்ந்தார்.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} கோரிய அட்டையை வைத்திருந்தது மற்றும் உங்கள் பங்குதாரர்.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} தந்திரத்தை வென்றது.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"சுற்று முடிந்தது. {player} {count} தந்திரங்களை எடுத்தது.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} {count} புள்ளிகளுடன் கேமை வென்றது!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"{players} {count} புள்ளிகளில் ஆட்டம் டையில் முடிந்தது.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"ஏலம் எடுக்கப்பட்டது: ஒவ்வொரு அணியினரும் {count} புள்ளிகளைப் பெறுகிறார்கள்.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"ஏலம் தவறவிடப்பட்டது: ஒவ்வொரு அணியினரும் {count} புள்ளிகளை இழக்கிறார்கள்.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"வெற்றிகரமான அமெரிக்கர்: 52 புள்ளிகள்.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"தோல்வியடைந்த அமெரிக்கர்: −52 புள்ளிகள்.","Game saved on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் கேம் சேமிக்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game resumed.":"சேமித்த கேம் மீண்டும் தொடங்கப்பட்டது.","Saved game deleted.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் நீக்கப்பட்டது.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"உள்ளூர் சேமிப்பு கிடைக்கவில்லை; நீங்கள் பக்கத்தை விட்டு வெளியேறும் வரை இந்த விளையாட்டு திறந்தே இருக்கும்.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"சேமிக்கப்பட்ட விளையாட்டைப் படிக்க முடியவில்லை. புதிய கேமைத் தொடங்கவும் அல்லது சேதமடைந்த சேமிப்பை நீக்கவும்.","There is no saved game on this device.":"இந்தச் சாதனத்தில் சேமிக்கப்பட்ட கேம் எதுவும் இல்லை.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"ஒரு நிலையான 52-கார்டு டெக், ஜோக்கர்ஸ் இல்லை. போதுமான இரண்டுகளை ஒதுக்கி, 3–6 பிளேயர்களுக்கு சமமாகச் செயல்படுங்கள். வழக்கமான ஏலமானது அரை கையை வட்டமிட்டதில் தொடங்குகிறது மற்றும் முந்தைய ஏலத்தில் முதலிடம் பெற வேண்டும். எல்லா தந்திரங்களையும் தனியாக எடுக்க அமெரிக்கரை அழைக்கவும். வழக்கமான ஏலத்தில், டிரம்பை அமைக்கவும், பார்ட்னர் கார்டைக் கோரவும். முடிந்தால் பின்பற்றவும். ஒவ்வொரு அணியும் ஏலத்தைப் பெறுகிறது அல்லது இழக்கிறது; மற்ற வீரர்கள் தங்கள் தந்திர எண்ணிக்கையைப் பெறுகிறார்கள். ஒரு ஸ்கோர் 52ஐ அடைந்தவுடன் அதிக மதிப்பெண் பெறுகிறது.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"நார்வேஜிய விதிகள் சரிபார்க்கப்பட்டது 16 அக்டோபர் 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"te":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"అమెరికనేర్ కార్డ్ గేమ్","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"అమెరికనేర్ కార్డ్ గేమ్ ఆన్‌లైన్ — వేలం వేయండి, భాగస్వామిని కనుగొనండి మరియు ఉపాయాలు గెలుచుకోండి","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"ముగ్గురు నుండి ఆరుగురు ఆటగాళ్లతో స్థానికంగా నార్వేజియన్ అమెరికానర్ కార్డ్ గేమ్‌ను ఆడండి. ట్రిక్స్ కోసం వేలం వేయండి, ట్రంప్‌ను ఎంచుకోండి, మీ భాగస్వామిని కనుగొనండి మరియు ఈ పరికరంలో స్కోర్‌ను ఉంచండి.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"నార్వేజియన్ అమెరికానర్ ట్రిక్-టేకింగ్ గేమ్‌ను నేర్చుకోండి: మీరు మరియు తెలియని భాగస్వామి ఎన్ని ట్రిక్స్ తీసుకోవచ్చు, మీ లీడ్‌తో ట్రంప్‌ను సెట్ చేయవచ్చు మరియు మీ భాగస్వామిని వెల్లడించే కార్డ్‌ని అభ్యర్థించండి.","A quick example":"సత్వర ఉదాహరణ","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"నలుగురు ఆటగాళ్లతో, మీరు మరియు మీరు అభ్యర్థించిన కార్డ్ ద్వారా వెల్లడించిన భాగస్వామి కనీసం 8 ట్రిక్‌లను తీసుకుంటే 8 బిడ్ గెలుస్తుంది. ప్రతి సహచరుడు 8 పాయింట్లను సంపాదిస్తాడు; ప్రతి ఇతర ఆటగాడు వారి స్వంత ట్రిక్ కౌంట్ సంపాదిస్తారు.","How to play":"ఎలా ఆడాలి","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"ఈ స్థానిక వెర్షన్ Norske కోర్ట్స్‌పిల్‌కి వ్యతిరేకంగా తనిఖీ చేసిన నార్వేజియన్ అమెరికన్‌నర్ నియమాలను అనుసరిస్తుంది. ఇది ప్రామాణిక డెక్‌తో మరియు జోకర్‌లు లేకుండా ముగ్గురు నుండి ఆరు మంది ఆటగాళ్లకు మద్దతు ఇస్తుంది. సమానంగా వ్యవహరించడానికి, ఒకటి, రెండు లేదా నాలుగు రెండు మూడు, ఐదు లేదా ఆరు ఆటగాళ్లకు కేటాయించబడతాయి; నలుగురు ఆటగాళ్ళు అన్ని 52 కార్డ్‌లను ఉపయోగిస్తున్నారు. డీలర్ నుండి విడిచిపెట్టిన ఆటగాడు ముందుగా వేలం వేస్తాడు. సాధారణ బిడ్ తప్పనిసరిగా కనీసం సగం మీ చేతిని గుండ్రంగా మరియు ప్రస్తుత బిడ్ కంటే ఎక్కువగా ఉండాలి; భాగస్వామి లేదా ట్రంప్ లేకుండా ఒంటరిగా ప్రతి ఉపాయాన్ని ప్రయత్నించడానికి మీరు అమెరికానర్‌ను పాస్ చేయవచ్చు లేదా కాల్ చేయవచ్చు. మీరు సాధారణ బిడ్‌ను గెలిస్తే, ట్రంప్‌ను సెట్ చేయడానికి మొదటి కార్డ్‌ని నడిపించండి మరియు మీ చేతిలో లేని సూట్‌లో ఇన్-ప్లే కార్డ్‌ను అభ్యర్థించండి. దాని హోల్డర్ దీన్ని మొదటి ట్రిక్‌లో ప్లే చేయాలి మరియు మీ భాగస్వామి అవుతారు. తదుపరి ఆధిక్యంలో ప్రత్యర్థుల చేతుల్లో ఏ మ్యాచింగ్ కార్డ్ మిగిలి ఉండకపోతే, భాగస్వామి లేకుండా కొనసాగండి; డిక్లరర్ మాత్రమే బిడ్డర్‌గా స్కోర్ చేయబడతారు. సాధ్యమైనప్పుడు ఆటగాళ్ళు తప్పనిసరిగా లీడ్ సూట్‌ను అనుసరించాలి. అత్యధిక ట్రంప్ ఒక ట్రిక్ గెలుస్తాడు, లేదా ట్రంప్ లేనట్లయితే లెడ్ సూట్‌లో అత్యధిక కార్డ్‌ని గెలుచుకుంటాడు. డిక్లరర్ మరియు భాగస్వామి ప్రతి ఒక్కరూ బిడ్‌ను తయారు చేసినప్పుడు దాన్ని పొందుతారు లేదా ప్రతి ఒక్కరూ బిడ్‌ను కోల్పోయినప్పుడు కోల్పోతారు; ఇతర ఆటగాళ్ళు వారు తీసుకునే ప్రతి ట్రిక్కి ఒక పాయింట్ పొందుతారు. ఒక విజయవంతమైన అమెరికన్ 52 పాయింట్లను సంపాదిస్తాడు మరియు విఫలమైన వ్యక్తి 52ని కోల్పోతాడు. ఒక రౌండ్ తర్వాత, డీలర్ ఎడమవైపు కదులుతాడు. స్కోర్ 52కి చేరుకున్న తర్వాత, అత్యధిక స్కోర్ గెలుస్తుంది. స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ ప్రత్యర్థులు సాధారణ హ్యూరిస్టిక్ ఎంపికలు చేస్తారు; ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్ లేదు.","How many players can play?":"ఎంత మంది ఆటగాళ్లు ఆడగలరు?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"మూడు, నాలుగు, ఐదు లేదా ఆరు సీట్లను ఎంచుకోండి. ప్లేయర్ వన్ మీరు; ఇతర సీట్లు స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ వ్యతిరేకులు.","How is the deck dealt?":"డెక్ ఎలా డీల్ చేయబడింది?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"జోకర్లు లేకుండా 52 కార్డ్‌లను ఉపయోగించండి. ముగ్గురు ఆటగాళ్లకు ఒకటి రెండు, నలుగురికి ఏదీ, ఐదుగురికి రెండు, మరియు మొత్తం నాలుగు రెండొందలు ఆరుగురికి కేటాయించండి కాబట్టి ప్రతి చేతికి ఒకే సంఖ్యలో కార్డులు ఉంటాయి.","How do I find my partner?":"నేను నా భాగస్వామిని ఎలా కనుగొనగలను?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"సాధారణ బిడ్ తర్వాత, ట్రంప్‌ను సెట్ చేయడానికి కార్డ్‌ని లీడ్ చేయండి మరియు మీ చేతిలో లేని సూట్ కార్డ్‌ని అభ్యర్థించండి. దానిని ఎవరు పట్టుకున్నారో వారు దానిని మొదటి ట్రిక్‌లో ప్లే చేయాలి మరియు మీ భాగస్వామి అవుతారు.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"అమెరికనేర్ అంటే ఏమిటి?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"ఇది అగ్ర కాల్: భాగస్వామి మరియు ట్రంప్ లేకుండా ఒంటరిగా ప్రతి ఉపాయాన్ని గెలవడానికి ప్రయత్నించండి. విజయవంతమైన కాల్ విలువ 52 పాయింట్లు; విఫలమైన దాని ధర 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"సాధారణ బిడ్ ఎలా స్కోర్ చేయబడుతుంది?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"డిక్లరర్ మరియు భాగస్వామి ప్రతి ఒక్కరు తమ కంబైన్డ్ ట్రిక్స్ కలిసినట్లయితే బిడ్‌ను పొందుతారు లేదా ప్రతి ఒక్కరు బిడ్‌ను కోల్పోతారు. ప్రతి ఒక్కరు ఒక్కో ట్రిక్‌కు ఒక పాయింట్‌ను పొందుతారు.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"ఈ గేమ్ నా కార్డ్‌లు లేదా స్కోర్‌లను అప్‌లోడ్ చేస్తుందా?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"నం. గేమ్ స్థితి మరియు ఐచ్ఛికంగా సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ ఈ పరికరంలోని ఈ బ్రౌజర్‌లో ఉంటాయి.","Rules and limitations":"నియమాలు మరియు పరిమితులు","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"ఇది ఒక నార్వేజియన్ రూల్ సెట్ యొక్క డిజిటల్ ప్రాక్టీస్ వెర్షన్, ప్రతి ఇంటి నియమం కవర్ చేయబడుతుందనే దావా కాదు. స్థానిక కంప్యూటర్ వ్యతిరేకులు సాధారణ హ్యూరిస్టిక్‌లను ఉపయోగిస్తారు, నిపుణుల వ్యూహాన్ని కాదు. ఆన్‌లైన్ మల్టీప్లేయర్, ఖాతా లేదా అప్‌లోడ్ చేసిన గేమ్ డేటా లేదు. ముగింపులో స్కోర్లు టై అయితే, సాధనం ఏకపక్షంగా ఒకరిని ఎంచుకోవడానికి బదులుగా టై అయిన అత్యధిక ఆటగాళ్లను నివేదిస్తుంది.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"ప్లే చేయడానికి ఉచితం. కార్డ్‌లు, స్కోర్‌లు మరియు ఐచ్ఛిక సేవ్ ఈ పరికరంలో ఉంటాయి; ఏమీ అప్‌లోడ్ చేయబడలేదు.","Play Amerikaner":"అమెరికనర్‌ని ప్లే చేయండి","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ఉచితం · మీ బ్రౌజర్‌లో నడుస్తుంది","Total players":"మొత్తం ఆటగాళ్లు","New game":"కొత్త గేమ్","Resume saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించండి","Delete saved game":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్‌ను తొలగించండి","Export scores":"స్కోర్‌లను ఎగుమతి చేయండి","Spades":"స్పేడ్స్","Hearts":"హార్ట్స్","Diamonds":"డైమండ్స్","Clubs":"క్లబ్‌లు","Jack":"జాక్","Queen":"క్వీన్","King":"రాజు","Ace":"ఏస్","Choose your bid":"మీ బిడ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి","Lead a card":"కార్డ్‌ను లీడ్ చేయండి","Play a card":"కార్డ్ ప్లే చేయండి","No trump":"ట్రంప్ లేదు","Not revealed":"వెల్లడించలేదు","No card has been played yet.":"ఇంకా కార్డ్ ప్లే చేయలేదు.","You passed.":"మీరు పాసయ్యారు.","Your lead is on the table.":"మీ సీసం టేబుల్‌పై ఉంది.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} దారితీసింది మరియు భాగస్వామి కార్డ్‌ను అభ్యర్థించింది.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} {card} ఆడింది.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"గేమ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేసిన దాన్ని మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించండి.","Player":"ఆటగాడు","You":"మీరు","Computer {number}":"కంప్యూటర్ {number}","Score":"స్కోర్","Tricks":"ఉపాయాలు","Round":"గుండ్రంగా","Current bid":"ప్రస్తుత బిడ్","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} బిడ్‌ని ఎంచుకుంటున్నారు.","Turn":"తిరగండి","Dealer":"డీలర్","Trump":"ట్రంప్","Partner":"భాగస్వామి","Bid":"వేలం వేయండి","Number of tricks":"ఉపాయాల సంఖ్య","Place bid":"వేలం వేయండి","Pass":"పాస్","Call Amerikaner":"అమెరికనేర్‌కు కాల్ చేయండి","Minimum":"కనిష్ట","Maximum":"గరిష్టంగా","Set trump and request your partner":"ట్రంప్‌ని సెట్ చేయండి మరియు మీ భాగస్వామిని అభ్యర్థించండి","Choose your lead card":"మీ లీడ్ కార్డ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి","Request a card in this suit":"ఈ సూట్‌లో కార్డ్‌ని అభ్యర్థించండి","Lead and request this card":"ఈ కార్డ్‌ని నడిపించండి మరియు అభ్యర్థించండి","Play selected card":"ఎంచుకున్న కార్డ్‌ని ప్లే చేయండి","Choose a card to play":"ప్లే చేయడానికి కార్డ్‌ని ఎంచుకోండి","Current trick":"ప్రస్తుత ట్రిక్","Your hand":"మీ చేతి","Cards in hand":"చేతిలో కార్డ్‌లు","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"మీకు వీలైనప్పుడు లెడ్ సూట్‌ని అనుసరించండి. అభ్యర్థించిన భాగస్వామి కార్డ్ తప్పనిసరిగా మొదటి ట్రిక్‌లో ప్లే చేయబడాలి.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"ప్రస్తుత బిడ్ కంటే కనీసం సగం మీ చేతిని గుండ్రంగా ఉంచి వేలం వేయండి, ఈ వేలానికి పాస్ చేయండి లేదా ప్రతి ఉపాయాన్ని ఒంటరిగా ప్రయత్నించడానికి అమెరికానర్‌కు కాల్ చేయండి.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"మీ లీడ్ సూట్ ట్రంప్‌గా మారుతుంది. మీరు పట్టుకోని సూట్‌లో ఇన్-ప్లే కార్డ్‌ని అభ్యర్థించండి; దాని హోల్డర్ దానిని ముందుగా ప్లే చేయాలి.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"ప్రత్యర్థుల చేతిలో మ్యాచింగ్ కార్డ్ ఏదీ లేదు. భాగస్వామి లేకుండా నడిపించండి; మీ స్వంత బిడ్ మాత్రమే స్కోర్ చేయబడుతుంది.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"ఆట మొదలైంది. డీలర్ నుండి విడిచిపెట్టిన ఆటగాడు ముందుగా వేలం వేస్తాడు.","{player} passed.":"{player} ఆమోదించబడింది.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} బిడ్ {count} ట్రిక్స్.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} అని అమెరికానేర్: ప్రతి ట్రిక్ ఒంటరిగా, ట్రంప్ లేదు.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"అందరూ ఉత్తీర్ణులయ్యారు. చేతికి రీడీల్ చేయబడింది మరియు డీలర్ ఎడమవైపుకు తరలించబడింది.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} అభ్యర్థించిన కార్డ్‌ని కలిగి ఉంది మరియు మీ భాగస్వామి.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ట్రిక్ గెలిచింది.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"రౌండ్ పూర్తయింది. {player} {count} ఉపాయాలు తీసుకున్నారు.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} {count} పాయింట్లతో గేమ్ గెలిచింది!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"గేమ్ {players} {count} పాయింట్ల మధ్య టైగా ముగిసింది.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"బిడ్ చేయబడింది: ప్రతి సహచరుడు {count} పాయింట్లను పొందుతాడు.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"బిడ్ తప్పిపోయింది: ప్రతి సహచరుడు {count} పాయింట్లను కోల్పోతాడు.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"విజయవంతమైన అమెరికానర్: 52 పాయింట్లు.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"విఫలమైన అమెరికానర్: −52 పాయింట్లు.","Game saved on this device.":"గేమ్ ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేయబడింది.","Saved game resumed.":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ మళ్లీ ప్రారంభించబడింది.","Saved game deleted.":"సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ తొలగించబడింది.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"స్థానిక పొదుపు అందుబాటులో లేదు; మీరు పేజీ నుండి నిష్క్రమించే వరకు ఈ గేమ్ తెరిచి ఉంటుంది.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"సేవ్ చేసిన గేమ్ చదవడం సాధ్యం కాలేదు. కొత్త గేమ్‌ను ప్రారంభించండి లేదా దెబ్బతిన్న సేవ్‌ను తొలగించండి.","There is no saved game on this device.":"ఈ పరికరంలో సేవ్ చేయబడిన గేమ్ ఏదీ లేదు.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"ఒక ప్రామాణిక 52-కార్డ్ డెక్, జోకర్లు లేరు. తగినంత టూలను పక్కన పెట్టడం ద్వారా 3–6 ప్లేయర్‌ల కోసం సమానంగా వ్యవహరించండి. సాధారణ బిడ్ సగం చేతితో మొదలవుతుంది మరియు మునుపటి బిడ్‌లో తప్పనిసరిగా అగ్రస్థానంలో ఉండాలి. ఒంటరిగా అన్ని ఉపాయాలు తీసుకోవడానికి అమెరికానర్‌కు కాల్ చేయండి. సాధారణ బిడ్‌లో, ట్రంప్‌ని సెట్ చేసి, భాగస్వామి కార్డ్‌ని అభ్యర్థించండి. వీలున్నప్పుడు అనుసరించండి. ప్రతి జట్టు బిడ్‌ను పొందుతుంది లేదా కోల్పోతుంది; ఇతర ఆటగాళ్ళు వారి ట్రిక్ గణనలను పొందుతారు. ఒక స్కోరు 52కి చేరుకున్న తర్వాత అత్యధిక స్కోర్ గెలుస్తుంది.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"నార్వేజియన్ నియమాలు 16 అక్టోబర్ 2026 తనిఖీ చేయబడ్డాయి","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"నార్స్కే కోర్ట్స్‌పిల్ · అమెరికానర్"},"th":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"เกมไพ่อเมริกา","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"เกมไพ่อเมริกาเนอร์ออนไลน์ — เสนอราคา ค้นหาพันธมิตร และลุ้นรับเคล็ดลับ","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"เล่นเกมไพ่ Norwegian Amerikaner ในพื้นที่กับผู้เล่นสามถึงหกคน ประมูลกลเม็ด เลือกทรัมป์ ค้นหาคู่ของคุณและเก็บคะแนนไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"เรียนรู้เกมกลลวงของชาวนอร์เวย์ Amerikaner: เสนอราคาว่าคุณและคู่ต่อสู้ที่ไม่รู้จักจะรับได้กี่กล ตั้งคนที่เป็นผู้นำของคุณ และขอการ์ดที่เปิดเผยคู่ของคุณ","A quick example":"ตัวอย่างสั้นๆ","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"เมื่อมีผู้เล่นสี่คน การเสนอราคา 8 จะเป็นผู้ชนะหากคุณและพันธมิตรที่ถูกเปิดเผยโดยการ์ดที่คุณร้องขอใช้เทคนิคอย่างน้อย 8 ร่วมกัน เพื่อนร่วมทีมแต่ละคนจะได้รับคะแนน 8 ผู้เล่นแต่ละคนจะได้รับจำนวนเคล็ดลับของตนเอง","How to play":"วิธีการเล่น","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"เวอร์ชันท้องถิ่นนี้เป็นไปตามกฎ Amerikaner ของนอร์เวย์ที่ตรวจสอบกับ Norske kortspill รองรับผู้เล่นสามถึงหกคนที่มีสำรับมาตรฐานและไม่มีโจ๊กเกอร์ ในการจัดการอย่างเท่าเทียมกัน จะมีการจัดสรรผู้เล่นหนึ่ง สอง หรือสี่คนไว้สำหรับผู้เล่นสาม ห้า หรือหกคน ผู้เล่นสี่คนใช้การ์ด 52 ทั้งหมด ผู้เล่นที่เหลือของเจ้ามือเสนอราคาก่อน การเสนอราคาปกติจะต้องมีการปัดเศษอย่างน้อยครึ่งหนึ่งของมือและสูงกว่าการเสนอราคาปัจจุบัน คุณยังสามารถผ่านหรือโทรหา Amerikaner เพื่อลองเล่นกลคนเดียวโดยไม่มีคู่หรือคนที่กล้าหาญ หากคุณชนะการประมูลปกติ ให้นำไพ่ใบแรกเพื่อตั้งทรัมป์และขอไพ่ที่กำลังเล่นอยู่ในชุดไพ่ที่ไม่ได้อยู่ในมือของคุณ เจ้าของจะต้องเล่นมันในเคล็ดลับแรกและกลายเป็นคู่ของคุณ หากไม่มีไพ่ที่ตรงกันเหลืออยู่ในมือของฝ่ายตรงข้ามในการเป็นผู้นำในภายหลัง ให้เล่นต่อโดยไม่มีคู่หู มีเพียงผู้ประกาศเท่านั้นที่ได้รับคะแนนเป็นผู้เสนอราคา ผู้เล่นจะต้องปฏิบัติตามชุดนำเมื่อเป็นไปได้ คนที่กล้าหาญสูงสุดจะชนะเคล็ดลับหรือไพ่ที่สูงที่สุดในชุดนำหากไม่มีคนที่กล้าหาญ ผู้ปฏิญาณและหุ้นส่วนต่างได้รับการเสนอราคาเมื่อทำ หรือแพ้การประมูลเมื่อพลาด; ผู้เล่นคนอื่น ๆ จะได้รับหนึ่งแต้มสำหรับแต่ละเคล็ดลับที่พวกเขาทำ ชาวอเมริกาที่ประสบความสำเร็จจะได้รับคะแนน 52 และผู้ที่ล้มเหลวจะเสีย 52 หลังจากรอบหนึ่ง เจ้ามือจะเคลื่อนไปทางซ้าย เมื่อคะแนนถึง 52 คะแนนสูงสุดจะเป็นผู้ชนะ ฝ่ายตรงข้ามคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่ตัดสินใจเลือกฮิวริสติกแบบง่ายๆ ไม่มีผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์","How many players can play?":"เล่นได้กี่คน?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"เลือกสาม, สี่, ห้าหรือหกที่นั่ง ผู้เล่นคนหนึ่งคือคุณ ที่นั่งอื่นเป็นฝ่ายตรงข้ามคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่","How is the deck dealt?":"เด็คจัดการอย่างไร?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"ใช้การ์ด 52 โดยไม่มีโจ๊กเกอร์ กันไพ่ไว้หนึ่งสองต่อผู้เล่นสามคน ไม่มีเลยสำหรับสี่ สองต่อห้า และสี่สองต่อหก ดังนั้นแต่ละมือจะมีไพ่จำนวนเท่ากัน","How do I find my partner?":"ฉันจะหาคู่ของฉันได้อย่างไร?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"หลังจากบิทปกติแล้วให้นำไพ่ไปตั้งทรัมป์และขอไพ่ชุดนั้นที่ไม่ได้อยู่ในมือคุณ ใครก็ตามที่ถือมันจะต้องเล่นมันในเคล็ดลับแรกและกลายเป็นคู่ของคุณ","What does Amerikaner mean?":"อเมริกาเนอร์หมายถึงอะไร?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"นี่คือสิ่งที่สำคัญที่สุด: พยายามเอาชนะทุกกลเม็ดโดยลำพัง โดยไม่มีคู่หูและไม่มีคนเก่ง การโทรสำเร็จจะมีค่า 52 คะแนน อันที่ล้มเหลวมีค่าใช้จ่าย 52","How is a normal bid scored?":"ราคาประมูลปกติได้คะแนนอย่างไร?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"ผู้ปฏิญาณและหุ้นส่วนต่างได้รับการเสนอราคาหากกลอุบายที่รวมกันของพวกเขาบรรลุผล หรือแต่ละคนจะแพ้การประมูลหากขาด คนอื่นๆ จะได้รับหนึ่งแต้มต่อเคล็ดลับ","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"เกมนี้อัพโหลดการ์ดหรือคะแนนของฉันหรือไม่?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"No. สถานะของเกมและตัวเลือกเกมที่บันทึกไว้จะยังคงอยู่ในเบราว์เซอร์นี้บนอุปกรณ์นี้","Rules and limitations":"กฎและข้อจำกัด","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"นี่เป็นเวอร์ชันฝึกปฏิบัติดิจิทัลของชุดกฎนอร์เวย์ชุดหนึ่ง ไม่ใช่การอ้างว่ากฎของบ้านทุกข้อได้รับการคุ้มครอง ฝ่ายตรงข้ามคอมพิวเตอร์ในพื้นที่ใช้การวิเคราะห์พฤติกรรมแบบง่ายๆ ไม่ใช่กลยุทธ์ของผู้เชี่ยวชาญ ไม่มีผู้เล่นหลายคนออนไลน์ บัญชี หรือข้อมูลเกมที่อัปโหลด หากคะแนนเสมอกันเมื่อจบการแข่งขัน เครื่องมือจะรายงานผู้เล่นสูงสุดที่เสมอกัน แทนที่จะเลือกหนึ่งคนโดยพลการ","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"เล่นฟรี การ์ด คะแนน และการบันทึกเสริมจะยังคงอยู่ในอุปกรณ์นี้ ไม่มีอะไรถูกอัพโหลด","Play Amerikaner":"เล่นอเมริกาเนอร์","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ฟรี · รันในเบราว์เซอร์ของคุณ","Total players":"จำนวนผู้เล่นทั้งหมด","New game":"เกมใหม่","Resume saved game":"เล่นเกมที่บันทึกไว้ต่อ","Delete saved game":"ลบเกมที่บันทึกไว้","Export scores":"คะแนนส่งออก","Spades":"โพดำ","Hearts":"หัวใจ","Diamonds":"เพชร","Clubs":"ไม้กอล์ฟ","Jack":"แจ็ค","Queen":"ควีน","King":"คิง","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"เลือกราคาเสนอของคุณ","Lead a card":"การ์ดนำ","Play a card":"เล่นไพ่","No trump":"ไม่มีทรัมป์","Not revealed":"ไม่เปิดเผย","No card has been played yet.":"ยังไม่มีการเล่นไพ่เลย","You passed.":"คุณผ่านไปแล้ว","Your lead is on the table.":"ถึงตาคุณเป็นฝ่ายนำ","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} นำและขอบัตรพันธมิตร","{player} played {card}.":"{player} เล่น {card}","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"เริ่มเกมหรือเล่นต่อจากเกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Player":"ผู้เล่น","You":"คุณ","Computer {number}":"คอมพิวเตอร์ {number}","Score":"คะแนน","Tricks":"เคล็ดลับ","Round":"กลม","Current bid":"ราคาเสนอปัจจุบัน","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} กำลังเลือกราคาเสนอ","Turn":"เปลี่ยน","Dealer":"ตัวแทนจำหน่าย","Trump":"ทรัมป์","Partner":"พันธมิตร","Bid":"เสนอราคา","Number of tricks":"จำนวนลูกเล่น","Place bid":"วางประมูล","Pass":"ผ่าน","Call Amerikaner":"โทรหาชาวอเมริกัน","Minimum":"ขั้นต่ำ","Maximum":"สูงสุด","Set trump and request your partner":"ตั้งคนที่กล้าหาญและร้องขอคู่ของคุณ","Choose your lead card":"เลือกลีดการ์ดของคุณ","Request a card in this suit":"ขอการ์ดในชุดนี้","Lead and request this card":"เป็นผู้นำและขอการ์ดใบนี้","Play selected card":"เล่นการ์ดที่เลือก","Choose a card to play":"เลือกไพ่ที่จะเล่น","Current trick":"เคล็ดลับปัจจุบัน","Your hand":"มือของคุณ","Cards in hand":"การ์ดในมือ","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"ติดตามชุด LED เมื่อทำได้ ต้องเล่นไพ่พันธมิตรที่ร้องขอในเคล็ดลับแรก","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"เสนอราคาอย่างน้อยครึ่งหนึ่งของมือของคุณปัดขึ้นและสูงกว่าราคาเสนอปัจจุบัน ผ่านการประมูลครั้งนี้ หรือโทรหา Amerikaner เพื่อลองทุกเคล็ดลับเพียงอย่างเดียว","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"ชุดตะกั่วของคุณกลายเป็นทรัมป์ ขอการ์ดที่กำลังเล่นในชุดที่คุณไม่ได้ถือ เจ้าของจะต้องเล่นมันก่อน","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"ไม่มีการ์ดที่ตรงกันเหลืออยู่ในมือของฝ่ายตรงข้าม เป็นผู้นำโดยไม่มีหุ้นส่วน มีเพียงการเสนอราคาของคุณเองเท่านั้นที่จะได้คะแนน","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"เกมเริ่มแล้ว ผู้เล่นที่เหลือของเจ้ามือเสนอราคาก่อน","{player} passed.":"{player} ผ่านไปแล้ว","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"เทคนิค {player} เสนอราคา {count}","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} เรียกว่า Amerikaner: ทุกเคล็ดลับเพียงอย่างเดียว ไม่มีคนที่กล้าหาญ","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"ทุกคนผ่านไปได้ มือถูกแจกไพ่ใหม่และเจ้ามือก็เคลื่อนไปทางซ้าย","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} ถือบัตรที่ร้องขอและเป็นคู่ของคุณ","{player} won the trick.":"{player} ชนะเคล็ดลับ","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"รอบเสร็จแล้ว. {player} ใช้เทคนิค {count}","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} ชนะเกมด้วยคะแนน {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"เกมจบลงด้วยการเสมอกันระหว่าง {players} ที่ {count} แต้ม","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"เสนอราคา: เพื่อนร่วมทีมแต่ละคนจะได้รับคะแนน {count}","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"พลาดการประมูล: เพื่อนร่วมทีมแต่ละคนเสียคะแนน {count}","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"ชาวอเมริกาที่ประสบความสำเร็จ: คะแนน 52","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"ชาวอเมริกาที่ล้มเหลว: −52 คะแนน","Game saved on this device.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","Saved game resumed.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้กลับมาเล่นต่อ","Saved game deleted.":"เกมที่บันทึกไว้ถูกลบแล้ว","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"การบันทึกในเครื่องไม่พร้อมใช้งาน เกมนี้จะยังคงเปิดอยู่จนกว่าคุณจะออกจากหน้า","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"ไม่สามารถอ่านเกมที่บันทึกไว้ได้ เริ่มเกมใหม่หรือลบบันทึกที่เสียหาย","There is no saved game on this device.":"ไม่มีเกมที่บันทึกไว้ในอุปกรณ์นี้","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"สำรับไพ่ 52 มาตรฐานหนึ่งสำรับ ไม่มีโจ๊กเกอร์ จัดการอย่างเท่าเทียมกันสำหรับผู้เล่น 3–6 โดยจัดสรรสองคนให้เพียงพอ การเสนอราคาปกติเริ่มต้นที่ครึ่งหนึ่งของมือที่ปัดเศษขึ้น และจะต้องอยู่สูงกว่าราคาเสนอก่อนหน้า โทรหา Amerikaner เพื่อใช้กลอุบายทั้งหมดเพียงอย่างเดียว ในการประมูลปกตินำไปสู่การตั้งทรัมป์และขอบัตรพันธมิตร ปฏิบัติตามเมื่อสามารถทำได้ แต่ละทีมจะได้หรือแพ้การประมูล ผู้เล่นคนอื่นจะได้รับจำนวนเคล็ดลับ คะแนนสูงสุดจะชนะเมื่อคะแนนถึง 52","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"ตรวจสอบกฎของนอร์เวย์แล้ว 16 ตุลาคม 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · อเมริกัน"},"tl":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner Card Game","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Online — mag-bid, humanap ng kapareha at manalo ng mga trick","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Maglaro ng Norwegian Amerikaner card game nang lokal kasama ng tatlo hanggang anim na manlalaro. Mag-bid para sa mga trick, pumili ng trump, hanapin ang iyong kapareha at panatilihin ang marka sa device na ito.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Laruin ang larong Norwegian Amerikaner, isang trick-taking game: mag-bid kung ilang trick ang kaya ninyong makuha ng hindi pa kilalang kapareha, itakda ang trump sa iyong lead, at hingin ang barahang magbubunyag sa kapareha mo.","A quick example":"Isang mabilis na halimbawa","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Sa apat na manlalaro, panalo ang bid na 8 kung ikaw at ang partner na ipinakita ng iyong hiniling na card ay kukuha ng kahit man lang 8 na trick nang magkasama. Ang bawat kasamahan sa koponan pagkatapos ay makakakuha ng 8 puntos; bawat isa sa mga manlalaro ay kumikita ng kanilang sariling trick count.","How to play":"Paano laruin","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Ang lokal na bersyong ito ay sumusunod sa mga panuntunan ng Norwegian Amerikaner na sinuri laban sa Norske kortspill. Sinusuportahan nito ang tatlo hanggang anim na manlalaro na may karaniwang deck at walang joker. Upang makitungo nang pantay-pantay, isa, dalawa o apat na dalawa ang inilalaan para sa tatlo, lima o anim na manlalaro; apat na manlalaro ang gumagamit ng lahat ng 52 card. Ang manlalaro na umalis sa dealer ay unang nagbi-bid. Ang isang regular na bid ay dapat na hindi bababa sa kalahati ng iyong kamay na naka-round up at mas mataas kaysa sa kasalukuyang bid; maaari ka ring pumasa o tumawag sa Amerikaner upang subukan ang bawat trick nang mag-isa nang walang kasosyo o tramp. Kung nanalo ka ng regular na bid, pangunahan ang unang card na magtakda ng trump at humiling ng in-play na card sa suit na iyon na wala sa iyong kamay. Dapat itong laruin ng may hawak nito sa unang lansihin at maging kapareha mo. Kung walang katugmang card na nananatili sa mga kamay ng mga kalaban sa susunod na lead, magpatuloy nang walang kasosyo; ang nagdeklara lamang ang nakapuntos bilang bidder. Dapat sundin ng mga manlalaro ang led suit kung maaari. Ang pinakamataas na trump ay mananalo sa isang trick, o ang pinakamataas na card sa led suit kung walang trump. Ang nagdeklara at kasosyo ay nakakakuha ng bid kapag sila ay gumawa nito, o ang bawat isa ay natalo sa bid kapag sila ay lumampas; ang ibang mga manlalaro ay nakakakuha ng isang puntos para sa bawat trick na kanilang gagawin. Ang isang matagumpay na Amerikaner ay nakakakuha ng 52 na puntos at ang isang nabigo ay nawalan ng 52. Pagkatapos ng isang round, ang dealer ay gumagalaw pakaliwa. Kapag ang isang marka ay umabot sa 52, ang pinakamataas na marka ang mananalo. Ang mga lokal na kalaban sa computer ay gumagawa ng mga simpleng heuristic na pagpipilian; walang online multiplayer.","How many players can play?":"Ilang manlalaro ang maaaring maglaro?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Pumili ng tatlo, apat, lima o anim na upuan. Player one ay ikaw; ang ibang upuan ay mga lokal na kalaban ng computer.","How is the deck dealt?":"Paano pinangangasiwaan ang deck?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Gumamit ng 52 card nang walang mga joker. Magtabi ng isa dalawa para sa tatlong manlalaro, wala sa apat, dalawa para sa lima, at lahat ng apat na dalawa para sa anim upang ang bawat kamay ay may parehong bilang ng mga baraha.","How do I find my partner?":"Paano ko mahahanap ang aking kapareha?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Pagkatapos ng isang normal na bid, pangunahan ang isang card upang itakda ang trump at humiling ng isang card ng suit na iyon na wala sa iyong kamay. Kung sino ang may hawak nito ay dapat laruin ito sa unang trick at magiging partner mo.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Ano ang ibig sabihin ng Amerikaner?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Ito ang nangungunang tawag: subukang manalo sa bawat trick nang mag-isa, na walang kasosyo at walang tramp. Ang isang matagumpay na tawag ay nagkakahalaga ng 52 puntos; ang isang nabigo ay nagkakahalaga ng 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Paano nai-score ang isang normal na bid?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Ang nagdeklara at kasosyo ay makakakuha ng bid kung ang kanilang pinagsamang mga trick ay makakamit ito, o ang bawat isa ay matalo sa bid kung sila ay kulang. Ang iba ay nakakakuha ng isang puntos bawat trick.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"In-upload ba ng larong ito ang aking mga card o score?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Hindi. Ang estado ng laro at ang opsyonal na naka-save na laro ay mananatili sa browser na ito sa device na ito.","Rules and limitations":"Mga panuntunan at limitasyon","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Ito ay isang digital na bersyon ng pagsasanay ng isang Norwegian na hanay ng panuntunan, hindi isang paghahabol na sinasaklaw ang bawat panuntunan sa bahay. Ang mga lokal na kalaban sa computer ay gumagamit ng simpleng heuristics, hindi ekspertong diskarte. Walang online multiplayer, account o na-upload na data ng laro. Kung magtabla ang mga score sa pagtatapos, iuulat ng tool ang mga nakatabla na pinakamataas na manlalaro sa halip na pumili ng isa nang basta-basta.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Libreng laruin. Mananatili sa device na ito ang mga card, score at opsyonal na save; walang na-upload.","Play Amerikaner":"Maglaro ng Amerikaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"LIBRE · TATAKBO SA IYONG BROWSER","Total players":"Kabuuang mga manlalaro","New game":"Bagong laro","Resume saved game":"Ipagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro","Delete saved game":"Tanggalin ang naka-save na laro","Export scores":"Mga marka ng pag-export","Spades":"Mga Spade","Hearts":"Mga Puso","Diamonds":"Mga Brilyante","Clubs":"Mga Club","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Reyna","King":"Hari","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"Piliin ang iyong bid","Lead a card":"Pangunahan ang isang card","Play a card":"Maglaro ng card","No trump":"Walang trumpeta","Not revealed":"Hindi isiniwalat","No card has been played yet.":"Wala pang card na nilalaro.","You passed.":"pumasa ka.","Your lead is on the table.":"Ang iyong lead ay nasa mesa.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} ang nanguna at humiling ng partner card.","{player} played {card}.":"Naglaro ang {player} ng {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Magsimula ng laro o ipagpatuloy ang naka-save sa device na ito.","Player":"Manlalaro","You":"Ikaw","Computer {number}":"Computer {number}","Score":"Puntos","Tricks":"Mga trick","Round":"Bilog","Current bid":"Kasalukuyang bid","{player} is choosing a bid.":"Ang {player} ay pumipili ng bid.","Turn":"Lumiko","Dealer":"Dealer","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Kasosyo","Bid":"Bid","Number of tricks":"Bilang ng mga trick","Place bid":"Maglagay ng bid","Pass":"Pasa","Call Amerikaner":"Tumawag sa Amerikaner","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maximum","Set trump and request your partner":"Itakda ang trump at hilingin ang iyong partner","Choose your lead card":"Piliin ang iyong lead card","Request a card in this suit":"Humiling ng card sa suit na ito","Lead and request this card":"Pangunahan at hilingin ang card na ito","Play selected card":"I-play ang napiling card","Choose a card to play":"Pumili ng card na laruin","Current trick":"Kasalukuyang trick","Your hand":"Ang iyong kamay","Cards in hand":"Mga card na nasa kamay","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Sundin ang led suit kung kaya mo. Dapat laruin ang hiniling na partner card sa unang trick.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Mag-bid ng hindi bababa sa kalahati ng iyong kamay na naka-round up at mas mataas kaysa sa kasalukuyang bid, pumasa para sa auction na ito, o tumawag sa Amerikaner upang subukan ang bawat trick nang mag-isa.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Nagiging trump ang iyong lead suit. Humiling ng in-play card sa suit na iyon na hindi mo hawak; dapat munang laruin ito ng may hawak nito.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Walang katugmang card ang nananatili sa mga kamay ng mga kalaban. Mamuno nang walang kasama; ang sarili mong bid lamang ang bibigyan ng marka.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Nagsimula na ang laro. Ang manlalaro na umalis sa dealer ay unang nagbi-bid.","{player} passed.":"Lumipas ang {player}.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} bid {count} trick.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} na tinatawag na Amerikaner: bawat trick lamang, walang tramp.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Nakapasa ang lahat. Na-redeal ang kamay at lumipat pakaliwa ang dealer.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"Hinawakan ng {player} ang hiniling na card at iyong kasosyo.","{player} won the trick.":"Nanalo ang {player}.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Kumpleto na ang round. Kinuha ng {player} ang {count} na mga trick.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"Nanalo ang {player} sa laro na may {count} puntos!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Natapos ang laro sa isang tie sa pagitan ng {players} sa {count} puntos.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Bid made: bawat teammate ay nakakakuha ng {count} na puntos.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Napalampas ang bid: natatalo ang bawat teammate ng {count} na puntos.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Matagumpay na Amerikano: 52 puntos.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Nabigong Amerikano: −52 puntos.","Game saved on this device.":"Na-save ang laro sa device na ito.","Saved game resumed.":"Ipinagpatuloy ang naka-save na laro.","Saved game deleted.":"Na-delete na ang naka-save na laro.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Hindi available ang lokal na pag-save; mananatiling bukas ang larong ito hanggang sa umalis ka sa page.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Hindi mabasa ang naka-save na laro. Magsimula ng bagong laro o tanggalin ang nasirang save.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Walang naka-save na laro sa device na ito.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Isang karaniwang 52-card deck, walang mga joker. Deal nang pantay-pantay para sa 3–6 na mga manlalaro sa pamamagitan ng paglalaan ng sapat na dalawa. Ang isang regular na bid ay nagsisimula sa kalahati ng kamay na na-round up at dapat na itaas ang nakaraang bid. Tawagan ang Amerikaner upang gawin ang lahat ng mga trick nang mag-isa. Sa isang regular na bid, humantong upang itakda ang trump at humiling ng kasosyong card. Sumunod ka kung kaya mo. Ang bawat koponan ay nakakakuha o natalo sa bid; ang ibang mga manlalaro ay nakakakuha ng kanilang mga bilang ng trick. Panalo ang pinakamataas na marka kapag umabot na sa 52 ang isang marka.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Nasuri ang mga panuntunang Norwegian 16 Oktubre 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikano"},"tr":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Amerikaner Kart Oyunu","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Kart Oyunu Çevrimiçi — Teklif Verin, Ortak Bulun ve Hileler Kazanın","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Norveç Amerikaner kart oyununu üç ila altı oyuncuyla yerel olarak oynayın. Hileler için teklif verin, kozu seçin, partnerinizi bulun ve skoru bu cihazda tutun.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Norveç Amerikalılarının hile alma oyununu öğrenin: sizin ve bilinmeyen bir ortağın alabileceği el sayısını söyleyin, liderliğinizle koz belirleyin ve ortağınızı ortaya çıkaran kartı isteyin.","A quick example":"Hızlı bir örnek","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Dört oyuncuyla, siz ve talep ettiğiniz kartın gösterdiği ortağınız en az 8 eli birlikte alırsanız 8 değerinde bir teklif kazanır. Daha sonra her takım arkadaşı 8 puan kazanır; her oyuncu kendi numara sayısını kazanır.","How to play":"Nasıl oynanır","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Bu yerel sürüm, Norske kortspill'e göre kontrol edilen Norveç Amerikan kurallarına uygundur. Standart desteyle ve joker olmadan üç ila altı oyuncuyu destekler. Eşit dağıtmak için bir, iki veya dört ikili üç, beş veya altı oyuncuya ayrılır; dört oyuncu 52 kartlarının tamamını kullanır. Dağıtıcının solundaki oyuncu ilk önce teklif verir. Normal bir teklif, elinizin en az yarısının yuvarlanmış olması ve mevcut tekliften daha yüksek olması gerekir; Ayrıca Amerikaner'i geçebilir veya arayarak her numarayı partneriniz veya kozunuz olmadan tek başınıza deneyebilirsiniz. Normal bir deklarasyon kazanırsanız, ilk kartı koz koymaya yönlendirin ve elinizde olmayan o renkte bir oyun içi kart isteyin. Sahibi ilk lövede onu oynamalı ve ortağınız olmalıdır. Daha sonraki bir çıkışta rakiplerin elinde eşleşen kart kalmazsa, partner olmadan devam edin; yalnızca deklaran teklif sahibi olarak puanlanır. Oyuncular mümkün olduğunca led rengi takip etmelidir. En yüksek koz bir el kazanır veya koz yoksa led renkteki en yüksek kartı kazanır. Deklaranın ve ortağın her biri, deklarasyonu yaptıklarında kazanır veya her biri kaçırdıklarında deklarasyonu kaybeder; diğer oyuncular aldıkları her el için bir puan kazanırlar. Başarılı bir Amerikalı 52 puan kazanır, başarısız olan ise 52 kaybeder. Bir turdan sonra dağıtıcı sola hareket eder. Bir puan 52'e ulaştığında en yüksek puan kazanır. Yerel bilgisayar rakipleri basit buluşsal seçimler yapar; çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun yok.","How many players can play?":"Kaç oyuncu oynayabilir?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Üç, dört, beş veya altı koltuk seçin. Birinci oyuncu sensin; diğer koltuklar yerel bilgisayar rakipleridir.","How is the deck dealt?":"Deste nasıl dağıtılır?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"52 kartlarını joker olmadan kullanın. Üç oyuncuya bir iki, dört oyuncuya yok, beş oyuncuya iki ve altı oyuncuya dört ikiyi bir kenara koyun; böylece her elde aynı sayıda kart olur.","How do I find my partner?":"Partnerimi nasıl bulabilirim?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Normal bir deklarasyondan sonra, kozu açmak için bir kart açın ve elinizde olmayan aynı türden bir kart isteyin. Onu kim tutarsa ​​ilk lövede oynamalı ve partneriniz olmalıdır.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikalı ne demek?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Bu en önemli çağrıdır: her numarayı tek başınıza, ortağınız ve kozunuz olmadan kazanmaya çalışın. Başarılı bir çağrı 52 puan değerindedir; başarısız olanın maliyeti 52'dir.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Normal bir teklif nasıl puanlanır?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Deklaranın ve ortağın her biri, eğer kombine elleri bunu karşılıyorsa, teklifi kazanırlar veya yetersiz kalırlarsa, teklifi kaybederler. Diğer herkes her numara için bir puan kazanır.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Bu oyun kartlarımı veya puanlarımı yüklüyor mu?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Hayır. Oyun durumu ve isteğe bağlı kayıtlı oyun, bu cihazdaki bu tarayıcıda kalır.","Rules and limitations":"Kurallar ve sınırlamalar","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Bu, Norveç kural setinin dijital alıştırma versiyonudur; her ev kuralının kapsandığı iddiası değildir. Yerel bilgisayar rakipleri uzman stratejisi yerine basit buluşsal yöntemler kullanıyor. Çevrimiçi çok oyunculu oyun, hesap veya yüklenmiş oyun verileri yok. Bitişte skorlar eşitse, araç rastgele bir oyuncu seçmek yerine en yüksek beraberliğe sahip oyuncuları rapor eder.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Oynaması ücretsiz. Kartlar, puanlar ve isteğe bağlı kaydetme özelliği bu cihazda kalır; hiçbir şey yüklenmedi.","Play Amerikaner":"Amerikan Oyna","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"ÜCRETSİZ · TARAYICINIZDA ÇALIŞIR","Total players":"Toplam oyuncu","New game":"Yeni oyun","Resume saved game":"Kayıtlı oyuna devam et","Delete saved game":"Kayıtlı oyunu sil","Export scores":"Dışa aktarma puanları","Spades":"Maça","Hearts":"Kalpler","Diamonds":"Elmaslar","Clubs":"Kulüpler","Jack":"Jak","Queen":"Kraliçe","King":"Kral","Ace":"As","Choose your bid":"Teklifinizi seçin","Lead a card":"Kartı yönlendir","Play a card":"Kart oyna","No trump":"Koz yok","Not revealed":"Açıklanmadı","No card has been played yet.":"Henüz hiçbir kart oynanmadı.","You passed.":"Sen geçtin.","Your lead is on the table.":"Lideriniz masada.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} yol gösterdi ve bir ortak kartı talep etti.","{player} played {card}.":"{player}, {card}'i oynadı.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Bir oyun başlatın veya bu cihazda kayıtlı olanı devam ettirin.","Player":"Oyuncu","You":"Sen","Computer {number}":"Bilgisayar {number}","Score":"Gol","Tricks":"Hileler","Round":"Yuvarlak","Current bid":"Geçerli teklif","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} bir teklif seçiyor.","Turn":"Dönüş","Dealer":"Satıcı","Trump":"Koz","Partner":"Ortak","Bid":"Teklif etmek","Number of tricks":"Hile sayısı","Place bid":"Teklif ver","Pass":"Geçti","Call Amerikaner":"Amerikaner'i Ara","Minimum":"Minimum","Maximum":"Maksimum","Set trump and request your partner":"Kozunuzu belirleyin ve partnerinizden talepte bulunun","Choose your lead card":"Personel kartınızı seçin","Request a card in this suit":"Bu takımdan bir kart talep edin","Lead and request this card":"Bu kartı yönetin ve isteyin","Play selected card":"Seçilen kartı oynat","Choose a card to play":"Oynamak için bir kart seçin","Current trick":"Güncel numara","Your hand":"Eliniz","Cards in hand":"Eldeki kartlar","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Mümkün olduğunda led takımı takip edin. İstenilen ortak kartın ilk elde oynanması gerekir.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Elinizin en az yarısını yuvarlayarak ve mevcut tekliften daha yüksek bir teklif verin, bu açık artırmayı geçin veya her numarayı tek başına denemek için Amerikaner'i arayın.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Başroldeki renginiz koz haline geliyor. Elinizde olmayan bir renkteki oyun içi kartı talep edin; sahibi önce onu oynamalıdır.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Rakibin elinde eşleşen kart kalmıyor. Ortak olmadan liderlik edin; yalnızca kendi teklifiniz puanlanacaktır.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Oyun başladı. Dağıtıcının solundaki oyuncu ilk önce teklif verir.","{player} passed.":"{player} geçti.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player}, {count} numara teklif etti.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} Amerikaner'i çağırdı: her numara tek başına, koz yok.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Herkes geçti. El yeniden dağıtıldı ve dağıtıcı sola doğru hareket etti.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} istenen kartı elinde tutuyor ve ortağınız.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} numarayı kazandı.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Tur tamamlandı. {player}, {count} numaralarını aldı.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} oyunu {count} puanla kazandı!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Oyun, {players} arasında {count} puanda beraberlikle sona erdi.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Teklif yapıldı: her takım arkadaşı {count} puan kazanır.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Teklif kaçırıldı: her takım arkadaşı {count} puan kaybeder.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Başarılı Amerikalı: 52 puan.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Başarısız Amerikalı: −52 puan.","Game saved on this device.":"Oyun bu cihaza kaydedildi.","Saved game resumed.":"Kaydedilen oyun devam ettirildi.","Saved game deleted.":"Kayıtlı oyun silindi.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Yerel kaydetme kullanılamıyor; Bu oyun siz sayfadan ayrılana kadar açık kalacaktır.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Kaydedilen oyun okunamadı. Yeni bir oyun başlatın veya hasarlı kaydı silin.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Bu cihazda kayıtlı oyun yok.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Bir standart 52 kart destesi, joker yok. Yeterli ikiliyi bir kenara ayırarak 3–6 oyunculara eşit dağıtın. Normal bir teklif, yuvarlanan elin yarısından başlar ve önceki teklifin üzerine çıkmalıdır. Tüm hileleri tek başına almak için Amerikaner'i arayın. Normal bir teklifte koz belirlemeye ve ortak kartı istemeye yol açın. Mümkün olduğunda davayı takip edin. Takımın her biri teklifi kazanır veya kaybeder; diğer oyuncular hile sayılarını kazanırlar. Bir puan 52'e ulaştığında en yüksek puan kazanır.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Norveç kuralları kontrol edildi 16 Ekim 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kısa saç dökülmesi · Amerikan"},"uk":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Американська карткова гра","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner Card Game Online — Робіть ставки, знайдіть партнера та вигравайте трюки","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Грайте в норвезьку американську карткову гру локально від трьох до шести гравців. Робіть ставки на трюки, вибирайте козир, знайдіть партнера та зберігайте рахунок на цьому пристрої.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Навчіться грі з норвезькими американцями: призначте ставку, скільки трюків можете взяти ви та невідомий партнер, установіть козир із перевагою та запитайте картку, яка розкриває вашого партнера.","A quick example":"Швидкий приклад","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"З чотирма гравцями ставка 8 виграє, якщо ви та партнер, якого розкриває ваша запрошена картка, візьмете разом принаймні 8 трюків. Тоді кожен член команди отримує 8 балів; кожен інший гравець отримує власну кількість трюків.","How to play":"Як грати","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Ця локальна версія відповідає правилам Norwegian Amerikaner, перевіреним Norske kortspill. Він підтримує від трьох до шести гравців зі стандартною колодою без джокерів. Щоб роздати рівно, одну, дві або чотири двійки відкладають для трьох, п'яти або шести гравців; чотири гравці використовують усі карти 52. Першим робить ставку гравець ліворуч від дилера. Звичайна ставка має бути принаймні половиною вашої руки, округленої в більшу сторону, і бути вищою за поточну ставку; Ви також можете передати або викликати Американера, щоб спробувати кожен трюк наодинці без партнера чи козиря. Якщо ви виграєте звичайну ставку, ведіть першу карту, щоб встановити козир, і вимагайте в грі карту тієї масті, яка не у вас на руці. Його власник повинен зіграти його в перший трюк і стає вашим партнером. Якщо в руках опонентів не залишиться відповідної карти, продовжуйте без партнера; лише заявник оцінюється як учасник торгів. Гравці повинні, коли це можливо, дотримуватися масті, що веде. Найвищий козир виграє трюк або старша карта головної масті, якщо козиря немає. Заявник і партнер отримують ставку, коли роблять її, або програють, коли промахуються; інші гравці отримують одне очко за кожен взятий трюк. Успішний американець заробляє 52 очок, а невдалий втрачає 52. Після раунду дилер рухається ліворуч. Коли кількість балів досягає 52, перемагає той, хто набрав найвищий бал. Локальні комп'ютерні опоненти роблять прості евристичні рішення; немає мультиплеєра онлайн.","How many players can play?":"Скільки гравців можуть грати?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Виберіть три, чотири, п’ять або шість місць. Перший гравець – це ви; інші місця - локальні комп'ютерні опоненти.","How is the deck dealt?":"Як роздається колода?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Використовуйте карти 52 без джокерів. Відкладіть одну двійку для трьох гравців, жодної для чотирьох, дві для п’яти і всі чотири двійки для шести, щоб у кожній руці була однакова кількість карт.","How do I find my partner?":"Як мені знайти партнера?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Після звичайної ставки візьміть карту, щоб встановити козир, і вимагайте карту тієї масті, якої немає у вас на руці. Той, хто його тримає, повинен зіграти його в перший трюк і стати вашим партнером.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Що означає Американер?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Це найкращий виклик: спробуйте виграти кожен трюк поодинці, без партнера та без козиря. Успішний дзвінок коштує 52 балів; невдалий коштує 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Як оцінюється звичайна ставка?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Оголошувач і партнер отримують ставку, якщо їхні об’єднані трюки задовольняють її, або програють ставку, якщо не вдається. Усі інші отримують одне очко за трюк.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Чи завантажує ця гра мої картки чи результати?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"№ Стан гри та необов’язкова збережена гра залишаються в цьому браузері на цьому пристрої.","Rules and limitations":"Правила та обмеження","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Це цифрова практична версія одного норвезького набору правил, а не твердження, що охоплено всі домашні правила. Локальні комп’ютерні опоненти використовують просту евристику, а не експертну стратегію. Немає багатокористувацької онлайн-ігри, облікових записів або завантажених даних гри. Якщо на фініші результати зрівнюються, інструмент повідомляє про гравців із рівними результатами замість довільного вибору одного.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Безкоштовна гра. Картки, бали та опціональне збереження залишаються на цьому пристрої; нічого не завантажено.","Play Amerikaner":"Грати в Americaner","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"БЕЗКОШТОВНО · ЗАПУСКАЄТЬСЯ У ВАШОМУ БРАУЗЕРІ","Total players":"Усього гравців","New game":"Нова гра","Resume saved game":"Відновити збережену гру","Delete saved game":"Видалити збережену гру","Export scores":"Оцінки експорту","Spades":"Піки","Hearts":"Серця","Diamonds":"Діаманти","Clubs":"Булави","Jack":"Джек","Queen":"Королева","King":"Король","Ace":"Ас","Choose your bid":"Виберіть свою ставку","Lead a card":"Вести картку","Play a card":"Грати в карту","No trump":"Без козиря","Not revealed":"Не виявлено","No card has been played yet.":"Жодна карта ще не зіграна.","You passed.":"Ви пройшли.","Your lead is on the table.":"Ваш лідер на столі.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} вів і запитував картку партнера.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} грав у {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Почніть гру або відновіть гру, збережену на цьому пристрої.","Player":"гравець","You":"Ви","Computer {number}":"Комп'ютер {number}","Score":"Оцінка","Tricks":"Хитрощі","Round":"Круглий","Current bid":"Поточна ставка","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} вибирає ставку.","Turn":"поворот","Dealer":"дилер","Trump":"Трамп","Partner":"Партнер","Bid":"Ставка","Number of tricks":"Кількість прийомів","Place bid":"Розмістіть ставку","Pass":"Пас","Call Amerikaner":"Зателефонуйте в Amerikaner","Minimum":"Мінімум","Maximum":"Максимум","Set trump and request your partner":"Установіть козир і запросіть свого партнера","Choose your lead card":"Виберіть картку потенційного клієнта","Request a card in this suit":"Запросіть карту цієї масті","Lead and request this card":"Проведіть і запитайте цю картку","Play selected card":"Зіграти вибрану карту","Choose a card to play":"Виберіть карту для гри","Current trick":"Поточний трюк","Your hand":"Твоя рука","Cards in hand":"Картки в руки","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Дотримуйтесь світлодіодного костюма, коли зможете. Запитана карта партнера повинна бути зіграна в першому прийомі.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Зробіть принаймні половину вашої руки, округлену вгору та вищу за поточну ставку, пройдіть на цей аукціон або зателефонуйте Amerikaner, щоб спробувати кожен трюк самостійно.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Ваш головний костюм стає козирним. Вимагайте картку в грі тієї масті, якої у вас немає; його власник повинен зіграти його першим.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Жодна відповідна карта не залишається в руках опонентів. Вести без напарника; оцінюватиметься лише ваша власна ставка.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Гра почалася. Першим робить ставку гравець ліворуч від дилера.","{player} passed.":"{player} пройдено.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} ставки {count} трюків.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} називається Amerikaner: кожен трюк окремо, без козиря.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Всі пройшли. Роздача була перероздана, і дилер пішов ліворуч.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} має запрошену картку та є вашим партнером.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} виграв трюк.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Круглий завершений. {player} взяв {count} трюків.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} виграв гру з {count} очок!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Гра закінчилася внічию між {players} на {count} очок.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Зроблена ставка: кожен член команди отримує {count} очок.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Ставка пропущена: кожен член команди втрачає {count} очок.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Успішний американець: 52 балів.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Невдалий американець: −52 балів.","Game saved on this device.":"Гра збережена на цьому пристрої.","Saved game resumed.":"Збережену гру відновлено.","Saved game deleted.":"Збережену гру видалено.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Локальне збереження недоступне; ця гра залишатиметься відкритою, доки ви не залишите сторінку.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Не вдалося прочитати збережену гру. Почніть нову гру або видаліть пошкоджене збереження.","There is no saved game on this device.":"На цьому пристрої немає збереженої гри.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Одна стандартна колода карт 52, без джокерів. Роздавайте рівномірно для гравців 3–6, відкладаючи достатню кількість двійок. Звичайна ставка починається з половини роздачі, округленої в більшу сторону, і має перевищувати попередню ставку. Зателефонуйте Amerikaner, щоб взяти на себе всі трюки. На звичайній ставці ведіть, щоб встановити козир і запитати картку партнера. Наслідуйте приклад, коли зможете. Кожна команда отримує або програє ставку; інші гравці отримують свої трюки. Найвищий результат виграє, коли рахунок досягає 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Правила Норвегії перевірено 16 Жовтень 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Amerikaner"},"ur":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"امریکی کارڈ گیم","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner کارڈ گیم آن لائن — بولی لگائیں، ساتھی تلاش کریں اور چالیں جیتیں","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"نارویجن امریکنر کارڈ گیم مقامی طور پر تین سے چھ کھلاڑیوں کے ساتھ کھیلیں۔ چالوں کے لیے بولی لگائیں، ٹرمپ کا انتخاب کریں، اپنے ساتھی کو تلاش کریں اور اس ڈیوائس پر اسکور رکھیں۔","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"ناروے کے تاش کے کھیل Amerikaner میں سیکھیں کہ کتنی چالیں بولی جائیں، نامعلوم ساتھی کو کیسے تلاش کریں، اپنے پہلے پتے سے ٹرمپ کیسے مقرر کریں اور ساتھی ظاہر کرنے والا پتہ کیسے مانگیں۔","A quick example":"ایک تیز مثال","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"چار کھلاڑیوں کے ساتھ، 8 کی بولی جیت جاتی ہے اگر آپ اور آپ کے درخواست کردہ کارڈ سے ظاہر کردہ پارٹنر کم از کم 8 چالیں اکٹھے کریں۔ ہر ساتھی پھر 8 پوائنٹس حاصل کرتا ہے۔ ایک دوسرے کھلاڑی اپنی اپنی چالوں کی گنتی حاصل کرتے ہیں۔","How to play":"کیسے کھیلنا ہے۔","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"یہ معیاری ڈیک کے ساتھ تین سے چھ کھلاڑیوں کی حمایت کرتا ہے اور کوئی جوکر نہیں ہے۔ یکساں طور پر نمٹنے کے لیے، ایک، دو یا چار دو تین، پانچ یا چھ کھلاڑیوں کے لیے الگ رکھے گئے ہیں۔ چار کھلاڑی تمام 52 کارڈ استعمال کرتے ہیں۔ ڈیلر کا چھوڑا ہوا کھلاڑی پہلے بولی لگاتا ہے۔ ایک باقاعدہ بولی کم از کم نصف آپ کے ہاتھ کی گول اور موجودہ بولی سے زیادہ ہونی چاہیے۔ آپ کسی پارٹنر یا ٹرمپ کے بغیر اکیلے ہی ہر چال آزمانے کے لیے امریکینر کو پاس یا کال کر سکتے ہیں۔ اگر آپ باقاعدہ بولی جیتتے ہیں، تو ٹرمپ کو سیٹ کرنے کے لیے پہلے کارڈ کی قیادت کریں اور اس سوٹ میں ایک ان پلے کارڈ کی درخواست کریں جو آپ کے ہاتھ میں نہیں ہے۔ اس کے ہولڈر کو اسے پہلی چال میں کھیلنا چاہیے اور وہ آپ کا ساتھی بن جاتا ہے۔ اگر کوئی مماثل کارڈ مخالفین کے ہاتھ میں بعد کی برتری پر نہیں رہتا ہے، تو بغیر کسی ساتھی کے جاری رکھیں؛ صرف اعلان کنندہ کو بولی لگانے والے کے طور پر گول کیا جاتا ہے۔ کھلاڑیوں کو جب ممکن ہو تو قیادت والے سوٹ کی پیروی کرنی چاہیے۔ اعلی ترین ٹرمپ ایک چال جیتتا ہے، یا قیادت والے سوٹ میں سب سے زیادہ کارڈ اگر ٹرمپ نہیں ہے۔ اعلان کنندہ اور شراکت دار جب بولی لگاتے ہیں تو ہر ایک کو حاصل ہوتا ہے، یا ہر ایک بولی سے محروم ہونے پر ہار جاتا ہے۔ دوسرے کھلاڑی اپنی ہر چال کے لیے ایک پوائنٹ حاصل کرتے ہیں۔ ایک کامیاب امریکنر 52 پوائنٹس حاصل کرتا ہے اور ایک ناکام شخص 52 کھو دیتا ہے۔ ایک چکر کے بعد، ڈیلر بائیں طرف چلا جاتا ہے۔ ایک بار جب کوئی سکور 52 تک پہنچ جاتا ہے، سب سے زیادہ سکور جیت جاتا ہے۔ کمپیوٹر کے مقامی مخالفین سادہ ہورسٹک انتخاب کرتے ہیں۔ کوئی آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر نہیں ہے۔","How many players can play?":"کتنے کھلاڑی کھیل سکتے ہیں؟","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"تین، چار، پانچ یا چھ نشستوں کا انتخاب کریں۔ کھلاڑی ایک آپ ہیں؛ دوسری نشستیں مقامی کمپیوٹر مخالف ہیں۔","How is the deck dealt?":"ڈیک کیسے ڈیل کیا جاتا ہے؟","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"جوکر کے بغیر 52 کارڈز استعمال کریں۔ تین کھلاڑیوں کے لیے ایک دو، چار کے لیے کوئی نہیں، پانچ کے لیے دو، اور چھ کے لیے چاروں دو کو الگ رکھیں تاکہ ہر ایک کے ہاتھ میں کارڈز کی تعداد یکساں ہو۔","How do I find my partner?":"میں اپنے ساتھی کو کیسے تلاش کروں؟","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"عام بولی کے بعد، ٹرمپ کو سیٹ کرنے کے لیے ایک کارڈ کی قیادت کریں اور اس سوٹ کے کارڈ کی درخواست کریں جو آپ کے ہاتھ میں نہیں ہے۔ جو بھی اسے رکھتا ہے اسے پہلی چال میں اسے کھیلنا چاہئے اور آپ کا ساتھی بن جاتا ہے۔","What does Amerikaner mean?":"امریکنر کا کیا مطلب ہے؟","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"یہ سب سے اوپر کی کال ہے: ہر چال اکیلے جیتنے کی کوشش کریں، بغیر کسی پارٹنر کے اور نہ ہی کوئی ٹرمپ۔ ایک کامیاب کال کی قیمت 52 پوائنٹس ہے۔ ایک ناکام کی قیمت 52 ہے۔","How is a normal bid scored?":"عام بولی کیسے لگائی جاتی ہے؟","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"اعلان کنندہ اور پارٹنر ہر ایک بولی حاصل کرتا ہے اگر ان کی مشترکہ چالیں اس پر پورا اترتی ہیں، یا ہر ایک بولی کھو دیتا ہے اگر وہ کم پڑ جائے۔ باقی سب کو فی چال ایک پوائنٹ حاصل ہوتا ہے۔","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"کیا یہ گیم میرے کارڈز یا اسکورز اپ لوڈ کرتا ہے؟","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"نمبر گیم کی حالت اور اختیاری محفوظ کردہ گیم اس ڈیوائس پر اس براؤزر میں رہتی ہے۔","Rules and limitations":"قوانین اور حدود","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"یہ ایک نارویجن اصول سیٹ کا ڈیجیٹل پریکٹس ورژن ہے، یہ دعویٰ نہیں کہ ہر گھر کے اصول کا احاطہ کیا گیا ہے۔ مقامی کمپیوٹر کے مخالفین ماہر حکمت عملی کا نہیں بلکہ سادہ ہیورسٹکس استعمال کرتے ہیں۔ کوئی آن لائن ملٹی پلیئر، اکاؤنٹ یا اپ لوڈ کردہ گیم ڈیٹا نہیں ہے۔ اگر اسکور ختم ہونے پر برابر ہوجاتے ہیں، تو ٹول من مانے طریقے سے کسی ایک کو منتخب کرنے کے بجائے سب سے زیادہ ٹائی کرنے والے کھلاڑیوں کی اطلاع دیتا ہے۔","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"کھیلنے کے لیے مفت۔ کارڈز، اسکورز اور اختیاری بچت اس ڈیوائس پر رہتی ہے۔ کچھ بھی اپ لوڈ نہیں ہے.","Play Amerikaner":"امریکنر کھیلیں","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"مفت · آپ کے براؤزر میں چلتا ہے۔","Total players":"کل کھلاڑی","New game":"نیا گیم","Resume saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Delete saved game":"محفوظ کردہ گیم کو حذف کریں۔","Export scores":"اسکور برآمد کریں۔","Spades":"Spades","Hearts":"دل","Diamonds":"ہیرے","Clubs":"کلب","Jack":"جیک","Queen":"ملکہ","King":"بادشاہ","Ace":"Ace","Choose your bid":"اپنی بولی کا انتخاب کریں۔","Lead a card":"ایک کارڈ کی قیادت کریں۔","Play a card":"ایک کارڈ کھیلیں","No trump":"نہیں ٹرمپ","Not revealed":"ظاہر نہیں کیا گیا۔","No card has been played yet.":"ابھی تک کوئی کارڈ نہیں کھیلا گیا۔","You passed.":"آپ پاس ہو گئے۔","Your lead is on the table.":"آپ کی برتری میز پر ہے۔","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} کی قیادت کی اور پارٹنر کارڈ کی درخواست کی۔","{player} played {card}.":"{player} نے {card} کھیلا۔","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"ایک گیم شروع کریں یا اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ کردہ گیم کو دوبارہ شروع کریں۔","Player":"کھلاڑی","You":"آپ","Computer {number}":"کمپیوٹر {number}","Score":"سکور","Tricks":"چالیں","Round":"گول","Current bid":"موجودہ بولی","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} ایک بولی کا انتخاب کر رہا ہے۔","Turn":"موڑ","Dealer":"ڈیلر","Trump":"ٹرمپ","Partner":"ساتھی","Bid":"بولی۔","Number of tricks":"چالوں کی تعداد","Place bid":"بولی لگائیں۔","Pass":"پاس","Call Amerikaner":"امریکینر کو کال کریں۔","Minimum":"کم سے کم","Maximum":"زیادہ سے زیادہ","Set trump and request your partner":"ٹرمپ سیٹ کریں اور اپنے ساتھی سے درخواست کریں۔","Choose your lead card":"اپنا لیڈ کارڈ منتخب کریں۔","Request a card in this suit":"اس سوٹ میں کارڈ کی درخواست کریں۔","Lead and request this card":"لیڈ کریں اور اس کارڈ کی درخواست کریں۔","Play selected card":"منتخب کارڈ کھیلیں","Choose a card to play":"کھیلنے کے لیے ایک کارڈ منتخب کریں۔","Current trick":"موجودہ چال","Your hand":"آپ کا ہاتھ","Cards in hand":"ہاتھ میں کارڈز","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"جب ہو سکے تو قیادت والے سوٹ کی پیروی کریں۔ درخواست کردہ پارٹنر کارڈ کو پہلی چال میں کھیلا جانا چاہیے۔","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"موجودہ بولی سے کم از کم آدھے ہاتھ کو گول اور اونچی بولی لگائیں، اس نیلامی کے لیے پاس ہوں، یا امریکنر کو کال کریں کہ وہ اکیلے ہی ہر حربہ آزمائے۔","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"آپ کا لیڈ سوٹ ٹرمپ بن جاتا ہے۔ اس سوٹ میں پلے کارڈ کی درخواست کریں جو آپ کے پاس نہیں ہے۔ اس کے ہولڈر کو پہلے اسے کھیلنا چاہیے۔","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"مخالفین کے ہاتھ میں کوئی مماثل کارڈ باقی نہیں رہا۔ ایک ساتھی کے بغیر قیادت؛ صرف آپ کی اپنی بولی اسکور کی جائے گی۔","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"کھیل شروع ہوا۔ ڈیلر کا چھوڑا ہوا کھلاڑی پہلے بولی لگاتا ہے۔","{player} passed.":"{player} گزر گیا۔","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} بولی {count} چالیں۔","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} کو امریکینر کہا جاتا ہے: ہر چال اکیلے، کوئی ٹرمپ نہیں۔","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"سب پاس ہو گئے۔ ہاتھ دوبارہ ڈیل کیا گیا اور ڈیلر بائیں طرف چلا گیا۔","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} کے پاس درخواست کردہ کارڈ ہے اور وہ آپ کا پارٹنر ہے۔","{player} won the trick.":"{player} نے چال جیت لی۔","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"راؤنڈ مکمل۔ {player} نے {count} چالیں لیں۔","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} نے {count} پوائنٹس کے ساتھ گیم جیت لیا!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"کھیل {players} کے درمیان {count} پوائنٹس پر برابری پر ختم ہوا۔","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"بولی لگائی گئی: ہر ٹیم کے ساتھی کو {count} پوائنٹس حاصل ہوتے ہیں۔","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"بولی چھوٹ گئی: ٹیم کا ہر ساتھی {count} پوائنٹس کھو دیتا ہے۔","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"کامیاب امریکی: 52 پوائنٹس۔","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"ناکام امریکی: −52 پوائنٹس۔","Game saved on this device.":"گیم اس ڈیوائس پر محفوظ ہو گئی۔","Saved game resumed.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم دوبارہ شروع ہو گئی۔","Saved game deleted.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم حذف کر دی گئی۔","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"مقامی بچت دستیاب نہیں ہے۔ یہ گیم اس وقت تک کھلا رہے گا جب تک آپ صفحہ چھوڑ نہیں دیتے۔","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"محفوظ کردہ گیم پڑھا نہیں جا سکا۔ ایک نیا گیم شروع کریں یا تباہ شدہ محفوظ کو حذف کریں۔","There is no saved game on this device.":"اس ڈیوائس پر کوئی محفوظ کردہ گیم نہیں ہے۔","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"ایک معیاری 52-کارڈ ڈیک، کوئی جوکر نہیں۔ کافی دو کو ایک طرف رکھ کر 3–6 کھلاڑیوں کے لیے یکساں طور پر ڈیل کریں۔ ایک باقاعدہ بولی آدھے ہاتھ سے شروع ہوتی ہے اور اسے پچھلی بولی سے اوپر ہونا چاہیے۔ تمام چالیں اکیلے لینے کے لیے امریکنر کو کال کریں۔ باقاعدہ بولی پر، ٹرمپ کو سیٹ کرنے کی طرف لے جائیں اور پارٹنر کارڈ کی درخواست کریں۔ جب ممکن ہو تو اس کی پیروی کریں۔ ہر ٹیم بولی حاصل کرتی ہے یا ہارتی ہے۔ دوسرے کھلاڑی اپنی چالوں کی گنتی حاصل کرتے ہیں۔ اسکور 52 تک پہنچنے کے بعد سب سے زیادہ اسکور جیتتا ہے۔","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"نارویجن قوانین کی جانچ پڑتال 16 اکتوبر 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske cortspill · Amerikaner"},"vi":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"Game Bài Mỹ","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Trò chơi bài Mỹ trực tuyến — Đặt giá thầu, tìm đối tác và giành chiến thắng","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"Chơi trò chơi bài người Mỹ gốc Na Uy tại địa phương với ba đến sáu người chơi. Đấu giá các mánh khóe, chọn con át chủ bài, tìm đối tác của bạn và giữ điểm trên thiết bị này.","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"Tìm hiểu trò chơi đánh lừa người Mỹ gốc Na Uy: đặt giá thầu xem bạn và một đối tác không xác định có thể thực hiện bao nhiêu thủ thuật, đặt con át chủ bài với sự dẫn đầu của bạn và yêu cầu lá bài tiết lộ đối tác của bạn.","A quick example":"Ví dụ nhanh","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"Với bốn người chơi, giá thầu 8 sẽ thắng nếu bạn và đối tác được tiết lộ bởi lá bài được yêu cầu của bạn thực hiện ít nhất các thủ thuật 8 cùng nhau. Sau đó, mỗi đồng đội sẽ kiếm được điểm 8; mỗi người chơi khác kiếm được số lần lừa của riêng họ.","How to play":"Cách chơi","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"Phiên bản địa phương này tuân theo các quy tắc của người Mỹ gốc Na Uy được kiểm tra đối với Norske kortspill. Nó hỗ trợ ba đến sáu người chơi với một bộ bài tiêu chuẩn và không có trò đùa. Để chia đều, một, hai hoặc bốn đôi được dành cho ba, năm hoặc sáu người chơi; bốn người chơi sử dụng tất cả các thẻ 52. Người chơi còn lại của nhà cái đặt giá thầu đầu tiên. Giá thầu thông thường phải được làm tròn ít nhất bằng một nửa bàn tay của bạn và cao hơn giá thầu hiện tại; bạn cũng có thể vượt qua hoặc gọi cho Amerikaner để thử mọi thủ thuật một mình mà không cần đồng đội hoặc con át chủ bài. Nếu bạn thắng một cuộc đấu giá thông thường, hãy dẫn quân bài đầu tiên để đặt quân bài tẩy và yêu cầu một quân bài đang chơi trong bộ đồ đó không có trong tay bạn. Người giữ nó phải chơi nó trong lần lừa đầu tiên và trở thành đối tác của bạn. Nếu đối thủ không còn lá bài phù hợp ở lượt dẫn trước sau đó, hãy tiếp tục mà không có đồng đội; chỉ người khai báo mới được tính điểm là người trả giá. Người chơi phải tuân theo bộ đồ dẫn đầu khi có thể. Con át chủ bài cao nhất sẽ thắng một trò lừa hoặc quân bài cao nhất trong bộ đồ dẫn đầu nếu không có con át chủ bài. Người khai báo và đối tác đều thắng thầu khi thực hiện hoặc thua khi bỏ lỡ; những người chơi khác đạt được một điểm cho mỗi thủ thuật họ thực hiện. Một người Mỹ thành công kiếm được 52 điểm và một người thất bại sẽ mất 52. Sau một vòng, người chia bài sẽ di chuyển sang trái. Khi điểm đạt tới 52, điểm cao nhất sẽ thắng. Đối thủ máy tính cục bộ đưa ra những lựa chọn kinh nghiệm đơn giản; không có nhiều người chơi trực tuyến.","How many players can play?":"Có bao nhiêu người chơi có thể chơi?","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"Chọn ba, bốn, năm hoặc sáu chỗ. Người chơi một là bạn; những ghế còn lại là đối thủ máy tính cục bộ.","How is the deck dealt?":"Bộ bài được xử lý như thế nào?","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"Sử dụng thẻ 52 mà không cần pha trò. Dành một hai cho ba người chơi, không có cho bốn, hai cho năm và cả bốn cho sáu người để mỗi tay có cùng số lượng bài.","How do I find my partner?":"Làm cách nào để tìm được đối tác của mình?","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"Sau khi đấu giá bình thường, hãy dẫn một quân bài để đặt át chủ bài và yêu cầu một quân bài của bộ đó không có trong tay bạn. Ai nắm giữ nó phải chơi nó trong lần lừa đầu tiên và trở thành đối tác của bạn.","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Người Mỹ có nghĩa là gì?","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"Đó là lời kêu gọi hàng đầu: cố gắng thắng mọi mánh khóe một mình, không có đối tác và không có con át chủ bài. Một cuộc gọi thành công có giá trị 52 điểm; một cái bị lỗi có giá 52.","How is a normal bid scored?":"Giá thầu thông thường được ghi như thế nào?","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"Người khai báo và đối tác mỗi người sẽ thắng thầu nếu các thủ thuật kết hợp của họ đáp ứng được hoặc mỗi người sẽ thua giá thầu nếu không đạt được. Những người khác nhận được một điểm cho mỗi thủ thuật.","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"Trò chơi này có tải thẻ hoặc điểm của tôi lên không?","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"Không. Trạng thái trò chơi và trò chơi đã lưu tùy chọn vẫn ở trong trình duyệt này trên thiết bị này.","Rules and limitations":"Quy tắc và giới hạn","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"Đây là phiên bản thực hành kỹ thuật số của một bộ quy tắc của Na Uy, không phải tuyên bố rằng mọi quy tắc chung đều được áp dụng. Đối thủ máy tính cục bộ sử dụng phương pháp phỏng đoán đơn giản chứ không phải chiến lược chuyên gia. Không có nhiều người chơi trực tuyến, tài khoản hoặc dữ liệu trò chơi được tải lên. Nếu tỷ số hòa khi về đích, công cụ sẽ báo cáo những người chơi có tỷ số hòa cao nhất thay vì chọn một cách tùy tiện.","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"Chơi miễn phí. Thẻ, điểm số và tùy chọn lưu vẫn còn trên thiết bị này; không có gì được tải lên.","Play Amerikaner":"Chơi Người Mỹ","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"MIỄN PHÍ · CHẠY TRÊN TRÌNH DUYỆT CỦA BẠN","Total players":"Tổng số người chơi","New game":"Trò chơi mới","Resume saved game":"Tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu","Delete saved game":"Xóa trò chơi đã lưu","Export scores":"Xuất điểm","Spades":"Pích","Hearts":"Trái tim","Diamonds":"Kim cương","Clubs":"Câu lạc bộ","Jack":"Jack","Queen":"Nữ hoàng","King":"Vua","Ace":"Át","Choose your bid":"Chọn giá thầu của bạn","Lead a card":"Dẫn thẻ","Play a card":"Chơi bài","No trump":"Không có át chủ bài","Not revealed":"Không được tiết lộ","No card has been played yet.":"Chưa có thẻ nào được chơi.","You passed.":"Bạn đã vượt qua.","Your lead is on the table.":"Khách hàng tiềm năng của bạn đang ở trên bàn.","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} đã dẫn đầu và yêu cầu thẻ đối tác.","{player} played {card}.":"{player} đã chơi {card}.","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"Bắt đầu trò chơi hoặc tiếp tục trò chơi đã lưu trên thiết bị này.","Player":"Người chơi","You":"Bạn","Computer {number}":"Máy tính {number}","Score":"Điểm","Tricks":"thủ thuật","Round":"Tròn","Current bid":"Giá thầu hiện tại","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} đang chọn giá thầu.","Turn":"Xoay","Dealer":"đại lý","Trump":"Trump","Partner":"Cộng sự","Bid":"Giá thầu","Number of tricks":"Số thủ thuật","Place bid":"Đặt giá thầu","Pass":"Đạt","Call Amerikaner":"Gọi người Mỹ","Minimum":"Tối thiểu","Maximum":"Tối đa","Set trump and request your partner":"Đặt át chủ bài và yêu cầu đối tác của bạn","Choose your lead card":"Chọn thẻ khách hàng tiềm năng của bạn","Request a card in this suit":"Yêu cầu thẻ trong bộ đồ này","Lead and request this card":"Dẫn và yêu cầu thẻ này","Play selected card":"Chơi bài đã chọn","Choose a card to play":"Chọn bài để chơi","Current trick":"Thủ thuật hiện tại","Your hand":"Bàn tay của bạn","Cards in hand":"Thẻ trong tay","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"Tuân theo bộ đồ dẫn đầu khi bạn có thể. Thẻ đối tác được yêu cầu phải được chơi trong lần lừa đầu tiên.","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"Đặt giá thầu ít nhất một nửa số bài của bạn được làm tròn và cao hơn giá thầu hiện tại, vượt qua cuộc đấu giá này hoặc gọi cho Amerikaner để thử mọi thủ thuật một mình.","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"Bộ đồ dẫn đầu của bạn sẽ trở thành con át chủ bài. Yêu cầu một thẻ đang chơi trong bộ đồ đó mà bạn không giữ; người giữ nó phải chơi nó trước.","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"Không còn lá bài phù hợp nào trên tay đối thủ. Dẫn đầu mà không có đối tác; chỉ có giá thầu của riêng bạn sẽ được tính điểm.","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"Trò chơi bắt đầu. Người chơi còn lại của nhà cái đặt giá thầu đầu tiên.","{player} passed.":"{player} đã vượt qua.","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} đặt giá thầu các thủ thuật {count}.","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player} gọi là Amerikaner: mỗi chiêu một mình, không át chủ bài.","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"Mọi người đều đã vượt qua. Ván bài được chia lại và người chia bài chuyển sang trái.","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} đã giữ thẻ được yêu cầu và là đối tác của bạn.","{player} won the trick.":"{player} đã thắng trò lừa.","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"Vòng hoàn thành. {player} đã thực hiện các thủ thuật {count}.","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} đã thắng trò chơi với số điểm {count}!","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"Trận đấu kết thúc với tỷ số hòa giữa {players} với số điểm {count}.","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"Giá thầu được thực hiện: mỗi đồng đội nhận được {count} điểm.","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"Giá thầu bị bỏ lỡ: mỗi đồng đội mất {count} điểm.","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"Người Mỹ thành công: 52 điểm.","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"Người Mỹ thất bại: −52 điểm.","Game saved on this device.":"Trò chơi đã được lưu trên thiết bị này.","Saved game resumed.":"Trò chơi đã lưu được tiếp tục.","Saved game deleted.":"Đã xóa trò chơi đã lưu.","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"Tính năng lưu cục bộ không khả dụng; trò chơi này sẽ vẫn mở cho đến khi bạn rời khỏi trang.","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"Không thể đọc được trò chơi đã lưu. Bắt đầu một trò chơi mới hoặc xóa bản lưu bị hỏng.","There is no saved game on this device.":"Không có trò chơi nào được lưu trên thiết bị này.","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"Một bộ bài 52 tiêu chuẩn, không có trò đùa. Chia đều cho người chơi 3–6 bằng cách dành đủ hai. Giá thầu thông thường bắt đầu bằng một nửa ván bài được làm tròn và phải cao hơn giá thầu trước đó. Hãy gọi cho Amerikaner để tự mình thực hiện mọi thủ đoạn. Theo giá thầu thông thường, dẫn đến việc đặt át chủ bài và yêu cầu một thẻ đối tác. Hãy làm theo khi có thể. Mỗi đội thắng hoặc thua giá thầu; những người chơi khác đạt được số lần lừa của họ. Điểm cao nhất sẽ thắng khi điểm đạt đến 52.","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"Quy tắc Na Uy đã kiểm tra 16 Tháng 10 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norske kortspill · Người Mỹ"},"zh":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"美国卡牌游戏","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner 在线纸牌游戏 — 竞标、寻找合作伙伴和获胜技巧","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"在本地与三到六名玩家一起玩挪威美国人纸牌游戏。竞标技巧、选择王牌、找到您的搭档并在该设备上记录分数。","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"学习挪威美国人取牌游戏：竞价您和未知伙伴可以取多少牌，以您的领先优势设定王牌，并请求显示您的伙伴的牌。","A quick example":"一个简单示例","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"四名玩家中，如果您和您所请求的牌中显示的伙伴一起至少完成了 8 墩，则出价 8 获胜。然后每位队友获得 8 积分；每个其他玩家都会获得自己的技巧数。","How to play":"怎么玩","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"此本地版本遵循挪威美国规则，并根据 Norske kortspill 检查。它支持三到六名玩家使用标准牌组且没有小丑。为了均匀分配，为三名、五名或六名球员留出一名、两名或四名二等奖；四名玩家使用全部 52 卡。庄家左边的玩家先叫牌。常规出价必须至少为您手牌的一半，并且高于当前出价；您也可以通过或呼叫 Amerikaner 在没有搭档或王牌的情况下独自尝试所有技巧。如果您赢得常规叫牌，则领先第一张牌设定王牌，并请求一张不在您手中的该花色的游戏中牌。它的持有者必须在第一墩中发挥它并成为你的伙伴。如果在随后领先时对手手上没有剩余牌，则在没有搭档的情况下继续；只有申报者作为竞标者才计分。玩家必须尽可能跟随领牌花色。最大的王牌赢得一墩，或者如果没有王牌，则赢得主导花色中的最大牌。申报者和合伙人投标时各自获胜，错过投标时各自失败；其他玩家每采取一招即可获得一分。成功的美国人会获得 52 积分，失败的美国人会失去 52 积分。一轮结束后，庄家向左移动。一旦分数达到 52，则分数最高者获胜。本地计算机对手做出简单的启发式选择；没有在线多人游戏。","How many players can play?":"有多少玩家可以玩？","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"选择三个、四个、五个或六个座位。一号玩家是你；其他席位是本地电脑对手。","How is the deck dealt?":"这副牌是怎么处理的？","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"使用没有王牌的 52 卡。为三名玩家留出一二，为四名玩家留出一二，为五名玩家留出二，以及为六名玩家留出所有四张二，以便每手牌都有相同数量的牌。","How do I find my partner?":"如何找到我的伴侣？","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"正常叫牌后，引导一张牌下王牌，请求一张不在你手中的同花色牌。谁持有它，谁就必须在第一局中发挥它，并成为您的伙伴。","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner 是什么意思？","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"这是最重要的呼吁：尝试独自赢得每一招，没有伙伴，没有王牌。一次成功通话价值52积分；失败的成本为 52。","How is a normal bid scored?":"正常出价如何评分？","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"如果庄家和搭档的组合花样符合要求，则双方都获得叫牌；如果未达到要求，则双方都会失去叫牌。其他人每招都得一分。","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"这个游戏会上传我的卡牌或分数吗？","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"编号游戏状态和可选的已保存游戏保留在此设备上的浏览器中。","Rules and limitations":"规则和限制","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"这是一套挪威规则集的数字练习版本，并不声称涵盖了每条内部规则。本地计算机对手使用简单的启发式方法，而不是专家策略。没有在线多人游戏、帐户或上传的游戏数据。如果最终得分相同，该工具会报告并列最高的球员，而不是任意选择一名球员。","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"免费玩。卡片、分数和可选的保存内容均保留在此设备上；没有上传任何内容。","Play Amerikaner":"玩美国人","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免费 · 在您的浏览器中运行","Total players":"玩家总数","New game":"新游戏","Resume saved game":"恢复保存的游戏","Delete saved game":"删除已保存的游戏","Export scores":"导出分数","Spades":"黑桃","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"钻石","Clubs":"球杆","Jack":"插孔","Queen":"大号","King":"王","Ace":"王牌","Choose your bid":"选择您的出价","Lead a card":"引导卡","Play a card":"打牌","No trump":"没有王牌","Not revealed":"未透露","No card has been played yet.":"还没有打出任何牌。","You passed.":"你通过了。","Your lead is on the table.":"你的线索已经摆在桌面上了。","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} 引导并请求合作伙伴卡。","{player} played {card}.":"{player} 玩了 {card}。","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"开始游戏或恢复此设备上保存的游戏。","Player":"玩家","You":"你","Computer {number}":"计算机 {number}","Score":"分数","Tricks":"技巧","Round":"圆形的","Current bid":"当前出价","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} 正在选择出价。","Turn":"转动","Dealer":"经销商","Trump":"王牌","Partner":"伙伴","Bid":"出价","Number of tricks":"技巧数","Place bid":"出价","Pass":"通过","Call Amerikaner":"呼叫美国人","Minimum":"最小","Maximum":"最大","Set trump and request your partner":"设置王牌，请求你的伙伴","Choose your lead card":"选择您的主卡","Request a card in this suit":"索取这套套装的卡片","Lead and request this card":"引导并索取此卡","Play selected card":"播放所选卡","Choose a card to play":"选择要打的牌","Current trick":"当前技巧","Your hand":"你的手","Cards in hand":"手中的牌","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"尽可能遵循 LED 套装。所请求的搭档牌必须在第一墩中打出。","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"出价至少有一半的手牌向上舍入并高于当前出价，通过本次拍卖，或致电 Amerikaner 单独尝试每一种技巧。","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"你的主牌成为王牌。请求一张您没有持有的该花色中的牌；它的持有者必须先玩它。","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"对手手中没有剩余的匹配牌。没有合作伙伴的情况下领导；只有您自己的出价才会得分。","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"比赛开始了。庄家左边的玩家先叫牌。","{player} passed.":"{player} 通过。","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} 出价 {count} 技巧。","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player}被称为Amerikaner：每招独善其身，没有王牌。","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"大家都过去了。这手牌被重发，庄家向左移动。","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} 持有所请求的卡并且是您的伙伴。","{player} won the trick.":"{player} 赢得了这一把戏。","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"回合完成。 {player}采取了{count}技巧。","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} 以 {count} 分赢得了比赛！","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"比赛最终以 {players} 平局结束，积分为 {count}。","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"出价：每位队友获得 {count} 分。","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"错过投标：每位队友失去 {count} 分。","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"成功的美国人：52 积分。","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"失败的美国人：−52 分。","Game saved on this device.":"游戏保存在此设备上。","Saved game resumed.":"已保存的游戏已恢复。","Saved game deleted.":"已保存的游戏已删除。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"本地保存不可用；该游戏将保持打开状态，直到您离开页面。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"无法读取已保存的游戏。开始新游戏或删除损坏的保存。","There is no saved game on this device.":"此设备上没有保存的游戏。","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"一副标准 52 牌，无小丑。通过留出足够的双，为 3–6 玩家均匀分配。常规出价从四舍五入的一半开始，并且必须高于先前的出价。呼叫 Amerikaner 独自完成所有技巧。在常规叫牌中，领先者设置王牌并请求合作伙伴卡。有能力时就效仿。各团队获胜或失败；其他玩家获得他们的技巧计数。一旦分数达到 52，最高分数获胜。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"挪威规则已检查 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norsk kortspill · Amerikaner"},"zh_tw":{"Amerikaner Card Game":"美國卡牌遊戲","Amerikaner Card Game Online — Bid, Find a Partner and Win Tricks":"Amerikaner 線上紙牌遊戲 — 競標、尋找合作夥伴和獲勝技巧","Play the Norwegian Amerikaner card game locally with three to six players. Bid for tricks, choose trump, find your partner and keep the score on this device.":"在本地與三到六名玩家一起玩挪威美國人紙牌遊戲。競標技巧、選擇王牌、找到您的搭檔並在該設備上記錄分數。","Learn the Norwegian Amerikaner trick-taking game: bid how many tricks you and an unknown partner can take, set trump with your lead, and request the card that reveals your partner.":"學習挪威美國人取牌遊戲：競價您和未知夥伴可以取多少牌，以您的領先優勢設定王牌，並請求顯示您的伙伴的牌。","A quick example":"一個簡單範例","With four players, a bid of 8 wins if you and the partner revealed by your requested card take at least 8 tricks together. Each teammate then earns 8 points; each other player earns their own trick count.":"四名玩家中，如果您和您所要求的牌中顯示的伙伴一起至少完成了 8 墩，則出價 8 獲勝。然後每位隊友獲得 8 積分；每個其他玩家都會獲得自己的技巧數。","How to play":"怎麼玩","This local version follows the Norwegian Amerikaner rules checked against Norske kortspill. It supports three to six players with a standard deck and no jokers. To deal evenly, one, two or four twos are set aside for three, five or six players; four players use all 52 cards. The player left of the dealer bids first. A regular bid must be at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid; you may also pass or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone without a partner or trump. If you win a regular bid, lead the first card to set trump and request an in-play card in that suit that is not in your hand. Its holder must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner. If no matching card remains in opponents’ hands on a later lead, continue without a partner; only the declarer is scored as the bidder. Players must follow the led suit when possible. Highest trump wins a trick, or the highest card in the led suit if there is no trump. The declarer and partner each gain the bid when they make it, or each lose the bid when they miss; other players gain one point for each trick they take. A successful Amerikaner earns 52 points and a failed one loses 52. After a round, the dealer moves left. Once a score reaches 52, the highest score wins. Local computer opponents make simple heuristic choices; there is no online multiplayer.":"此本地版本遵循挪威美國規則，並根據 Norske kortspill 檢查。它支援三到六名玩家使用標準牌組且沒有小丑。為了均勻分配，為三名、五名或六名球員留出一名、兩名或四名二等獎；四名玩家使用全部 52 卡。莊家左邊的玩家先叫牌。常規出價必須至少為您手牌的一半，並且高於當前出價；您也可以通過或呼叫 Amerikaner 在沒有搭檔或王牌的情況下獨自嘗試所有技巧。如果您贏得常規叫牌，則領先第一張牌設定王牌，並請求一張不在您手中的該花色的遊戲中牌。它的持有者必須在第一墩中發揮它並成為你的伙伴。如果在隨後領先時對手手上沒有剩餘牌，則在沒有搭檔的情況下繼續；只有申報者作為競標者才計分。玩家必須盡可能跟隨領牌花色。最大的王牌贏得一墩，或者如果沒有王牌，則贏得主導花色中的最大牌。申報者和合夥人投標時各自獲勝，錯過投標時各自失敗；其他玩家每採取一招即可獲得一分。成功的美國人會獲得 52 積分，失敗的美國人會失去 52 積分。一輪結束後，莊家向左移動。一旦分數達到 52，則分數最高者獲勝。本地電腦對手做出簡單的啟發式選擇；沒有線上多人遊戲。","How many players can play?":"有多少玩家可以玩？","Choose three, four, five or six seats. Player one is you; the other seats are local computer opponents.":"選擇三個、四個、五個或六個座位。一號玩家是你；其他席位是本地電腦對手。","How is the deck dealt?":"這副牌是怎麼處理的？","Use 52 cards without jokers. Set aside one two for three players, none for four, two for five, and all four twos for six so each hand has the same number of cards.":"使用沒有王牌的​​ 52 卡。為三名玩家留出一二，為四名玩家留出一二，為五名玩家留出二，以及為六名玩家留出所有四張二，以便每手牌都有相同數量的牌。","How do I find my partner?":"如何找到我的夥伴？","After a normal bid, lead a card to set trump and request a card of that suit that is not in your hand. Whoever holds it must play it in the first trick and becomes your partner.":"正常叫牌後，引導一張牌下王牌，請求一張不在你手中的同花色牌。誰持有它，誰就必須在第一局發揮它，並成為您的伙伴。","What does Amerikaner mean?":"Amerikaner 是什麼意思？","It is the top call: try to win every trick alone, with no partner and no trump. A successful call is worth 52 points; a failed one costs 52.":"這是最重要的呼籲：試著獨自贏得每一招，沒有夥伴，沒有王牌。一次成功通話價值52積分；失敗的成本為 52。","How is a normal bid scored?":"正常出價如何評分？","The declarer and partner each gain the bid if their combined tricks meet it, or each lose the bid if they fall short. Everyone else gains one point per trick.":"如果莊家和搭檔的組合花樣符合要求，則雙方都獲得叫牌；如果未達到要求，則雙方都會失去叫牌。其他人每招都得一分。","Does this game upload my cards or scores?":"這個遊戲會上傳我的卡片或分數嗎？","No. Game state and the optional saved game stay in this browser on this device.":"編號遊戲狀態和選購的已儲存遊戲保留在此裝置上的瀏覽器中。","Rules and limitations":"規則與限制","This is a digital practice version of one Norwegian rule set, not a claim that every house rule is covered. Local computer opponents use simple heuristics, not expert strategy. There is no online multiplayer, account or uploaded game data. If scores tie at the finish, the tool reports the tied highest players instead of choosing one arbitrarily.":"這是一套挪威規則集的數位練習版本，並不聲稱涵蓋了每條內部規則。本地電腦對手使用簡單的啟發式方法，而不是專家策略。沒有線上多人遊戲、帳戶或上傳的遊戲數據。如果最終得分相同，該工具會報告並列最高的球員，而不是任意選擇一名球員。","Free to play. Cards, scores and the optional save stay on this device; nothing is uploaded.":"免費玩。卡片、分數和可選的保存內容均保留在此裝置上；沒有上傳任何內容。","Play Amerikaner":"玩美國人","FREE · RUNS IN YOUR BROWSER":"免費 · 在您的瀏覽器中執行","Total players":"玩家總數","New game":"新遊戲","Resume saved game":"恢復保存的遊戲","Delete saved game":"刪除已儲存的遊戲","Export scores":"匯出分數","Spades":"黑桃","Hearts":"心","Diamonds":"鑽石","Clubs":"球桿","Jack":"插孔","Queen":"大號","King":"王","Ace":"王牌","Choose your bid":"選擇您的出價","Lead a card":"引導卡","Play a card":"打牌","No trump":"沒有王牌","Not revealed":"未透露","No card has been played yet.":"還沒打出任何牌。","You passed.":"你通過了。","Your lead is on the table.":"你的線索已經擺在桌面上了。","{player} led and requested a partner card.":"{player} 引導並要求合作夥伴卡。","{player} played {card}.":"{player} 玩了 {card}。","Start a game or resume the one saved on this device.":"開始遊戲或恢復此裝置上已儲存的遊戲。","Player":"玩家","You":"你","Computer {number}":"計算機 {number}","Score":"分數","Tricks":"技巧","Round":"圓形的","Current bid":"目前出價","{player} is choosing a bid.":"{player} 正在選擇出價。","Turn":"轉動","Dealer":"經銷商","Trump":"王牌","Partner":"夥伴","Bid":"出價","Number of tricks":"技巧數","Place bid":"出價","Pass":"透過","Call Amerikaner":"呼叫美國人","Minimum":"最小","Maximum":"最大","Set trump and request your partner":"設定王牌，請求你的夥伴","Choose your lead card":"選擇您的主卡","Request a card in this suit":"索取這套套裝的卡片","Lead and request this card":"引導並索取此卡","Play selected card":"播放所選卡","Choose a card to play":"選擇要打的牌","Current trick":"目前技巧","Your hand":"你的手","Cards in hand":"手中的牌","Follow the led suit when you can. The requested partner card must be played in the first trick.":"盡可能遵循 LED 套裝。所請求的搭檔牌必須在第一墩中打出。","Bid at least half your hand rounded up and higher than the current bid, pass for this auction, or call Amerikaner to try every trick alone.":"出價至少有一半的手牌向上舍入並高於當前出價，透過本次拍賣，或致電 Amerikaner 單獨嘗試每一種技巧。","Your lead suit becomes trump. Request an in-play card in that suit that you do not hold; its holder must play it first.":"你的主牌成為王牌。要求一張您沒有持有的該花色中的牌；它的持有者必須先玩它。","No matching card remains in opponents’ hands. Lead without a partner; only your own bid will be scored.":"對手手中沒有剩餘的配對牌。沒有合作夥伴的情況下領導；只有您自己的出價才會得分。","Game started. The player left of the dealer bids first.":"比賽開始了。莊家左邊的玩家先叫牌。","{player} passed.":"{player} 通過。","{player} bid {count} tricks.":"{player} 出價 {count} 技巧。","{player} called Amerikaner: every trick alone, no trump.":"{player}被稱為Amerikaner：每招獨善其身，沒有王牌。","Everyone passed. The hand was redealt and the dealer moved left.":"大家都過去了。這手牌被重發，莊家向左移動。","{player} held the requested card and is your partner.":"{player} 持有所要求的卡片並且是您的夥伴。","{player} won the trick.":"{player} 贏得了這一招。","Round complete. {player} took {count} tricks.":"回合完成。 {player}採取了{count}技巧。","{player} won the game with {count} points!":"{player} 以 {count} 分贏得了比賽！","The game ended in a tie between {players} at {count} points.":"比賽最終以 {players} 平手結束，積分為 {count}。","Bid made: each teammate gains {count} points.":"出價：每位隊友獲得 {count} 分。","Bid missed: each teammate loses {count} points.":"錯過投標：每位隊友失去 {count} 分。","Successful Amerikaner: 52 points.":"成功的美國人：52 積分。","Failed Amerikaner: −52 points.":"失敗的美國人：−52 分。","Game saved on this device.":"遊戲保存在此裝置上。","Saved game resumed.":"已儲存的遊戲已恢復。","Saved game deleted.":"已儲存的遊戲已刪除。","Local saving is unavailable; this game will remain open until you leave the page.":"本地儲存不可用；遊戲將保持開啟狀態，直到您離開頁面。","Saved game could not be read. Start a new game or delete the damaged save.":"無法讀取已儲存的遊戲。開始新遊戲或刪除損壞的保存。","There is no saved game on this device.":"此裝置上沒有儲存的遊戲。","One standard 52-card deck, no jokers. Deal evenly for 3–6 players by setting aside enough twos. A regular bid starts at half the hand rounded up and must top the previous bid. Call Amerikaner to take all tricks alone. On a regular bid, lead to set trump and request a partner card. Follow suit when able. The team each gains or loses the bid; other players gain their trick counts. Highest score wins once a score reaches 52.":"一副標準 52 牌，無小丑。透過留出足夠的雙，為 3–6 玩家均勻分配。常規出價從四捨五入的一半開始，並且必須高於先前的出價。呼叫 Amerikaner 獨自完成所有技巧。在常規叫牌中，領先者設定王牌並請求合作夥伴卡。有能力時就效法。各團隊獲勝或失敗；其他玩家獲得他們的技巧計數。一旦分數達到 52，最高分數獲勝。","Norwegian rules checked 16 October 2026":"挪威規則已檢查 16 10 月 2026","Norske kortspill · Amerikaner":"Norsk kortspill · Amerikaner"}});
